1
00:00:04,367 --> 00:00:07,467
♪ IN THE NOT-TOO-DISTANT
FUTURE ♪

2
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:10,800
♪ NEXT SUNDAY A.D. ♪

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,700
♪ THERE WAS A GUY NAMED JOEL ♪

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,100
♪ NOT TOO DIFFERENT
FROM YOU OR ME ♪

5
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:20,000
♪ HE WORKED
AT GIZMONIC INSTITUTE ♪

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,967
♪ JUST ANOTHER FACE
IN A RED JUMPSUIT ♪

7
00:00:22,967 --> 00:00:26,000
♪ HE DID A GOOD JOB
CLEANING UP THE PLACE ♪

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,800
♪ ♪ BUT HIS BOSSES
DIDN'T LIKE HIM

9
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:32,500
♪ SO THEY SHOT HIM
INTO SPACE ♪ ♪

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,533
♪ WE'LL SEND HIM
CHEESY MOVIES ♪

11
00:00:35,533 --> 00:00:37,600
♪ THE WORST WE CAN FIND ♪

12
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,867
♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

13
00:00:38,867 --> 00:00:41,733
♪ HE'LL HAVE TO SIT
AND WATCH THEM ALL ♪

14
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:43,767
♪ AND WE'LL MONITOR HIS MIND ♪

15
00:00:43,767 --> 00:00:45,000
♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,733
♪ NOW KEEP IN MIND
JOEL CAN'T CONTROL ♪

17
00:00:47,733 --> 00:00:50,033
♪ WHERE THE MOVIES
BEGIN OR END ♪

18
00:00:50,033 --> 00:00:51,233
♪ LA-LA-LA ♪

19
00:00:51,233 --> 00:00:54,400
♪ BECAUSE HE USED
THOSE SPECIAL PARTS ♪

20
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:59,067
♪ TO MAKE HIS ROBOT FRIENDS ♪

21
00:00:59,067 --> 00:01:01,033
- ♪ ROBOT ROLL CALL ♪
- ALL RIGHT, LET'S GO!

22
00:01:01,033 --> 00:01:02,333
- ♪ CAMBOT! ♪
- PAN LEFT!

23
00:01:02,333 --> 00:01:03,633
- ♪ GYPSY! ♪
- HI, GIRL!

24
00:01:03,633 --> 00:01:05,500
- ♪ TOM SERVO! ♪
- WHAT A COOL GUY!

25
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:07,000
- ♪ CROW...! ♪
- HE'S A WISECRACKER.

26
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,933
♪ IF YOU'RE WONDERING
HOW HE EATS AND BREATHES ♪

27
00:01:09,933 --> 00:01:12,167
♪ AND OTHER SCIENCE FACTS ♪

28
00:01:12,167 --> 00:01:13,367
♪ LA LA LA ♪

29
00:01:13,367 --> 00:01:14,767
♪ THEN REPEAT TO YOURSELF ♪

30
00:01:14,767 --> 00:01:19,233
♪ "IT'S JUST A SHOW,
I SHOULD REALLY JUST RELAX" ♪

31
00:01:19,233 --> 00:01:26,000
♪ FOR "MYSTERY SCIENCE
THEATER 3000!" ♪

32
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:34,367
[WHOOSHING, CREAKING,
WHIRRING, CLANKING]

33
00:01:34,367 --> 00:01:37,400
HEY, HEY, HELLO, WELCOME
TO THE SATELLITE OF LOVE.

34
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,733
I'M JOEL, THESE ARE MY ROBOTS

35
00:01:39,733 --> 00:01:41,800
AND, UH, YOU KNOW,
IT'S BASEBALL SEASON

36
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,433
UP HERE ON
THE SATELLITE OF LOVE,

37
00:01:43,433 --> 00:01:46,300
AND IN SPACE THAT MEANS
ONE THING-- MILWAUKEE.

38
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:47,900
I MEAN TEE-BALL.

39
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:50,033
COMMERCIAL SIGN IN 15 SECONDS.

40
00:01:50,033 --> 00:01:51,667
ALL RIGHT, CROW,
I WANT YOU TO GO LONG.

41
00:01:51,667 --> 00:01:53,833
COME ON, BUDDY, WAY OUT THERE,
BUDDY, WAY OUT THERE.

42
00:01:53,833 --> 00:01:55,433
JOEL, JOEL, IS THIS GONNA HURT?

43
00:01:55,433 --> 00:01:56,600
ARE YOU SURE
IT'S NOT GONNA HURT?

44
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:57,733
QUIT BEING SUCH A PANTYWAIST.

45
00:01:57,733 --> 00:02:00,633
JUST HOLD STILL
AND NOTHING WILL GET HURT.

46
00:02:00,633 --> 00:02:03,433
[ALL CHEER, GLASS BREAKS,
AIR WHOOSHING]

47
00:02:03,433 --> 00:02:07,667
[ALL SCREAMING]

48
00:02:07,667 --> 00:02:10,633
WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK, I HOPE!

49
00:02:10,633 --> 00:02:13,700
♪♪

50
00:02:16,833 --> 00:02:18,667
[ALL SCREAMING, AIR WHOOSHING]

51
00:02:18,667 --> 00:02:20,067
[WHOOSHING STOPS]

52
00:02:20,067 --> 00:02:23,267
OH, THANKS, GYPSY, YOU PATCHED
UP THE HOLE, THANKS A LOT.

53
00:02:23,267 --> 00:02:25,933
I THOUGHT I TOLD YOU KIDS
NOT TO PLAY BALL IN THE HOUSE!

54
00:02:25,933 --> 00:02:28,133
- OH, WE'RE SORRY.
- SORRY, GYPSY.

55
00:02:28,133 --> 00:02:30,167
WE'RE SORRY, WE WON'T DO IT AG--

56
00:02:30,167 --> 00:02:31,300
THE COAST IS CLEAR.

57
00:02:31,300 --> 00:02:32,833
CROW, GO LONG, BUDDY.

58
00:02:32,833 --> 00:02:34,200
ALL RIGHT.

59
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,800
ALL RIGHT, BUDDY,
THIS ONE'S COMING OUT TO YOU.

60
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,967
SHAG IT LONG, JOEL,
SHAG IT LONG.

61
00:02:37,967 --> 00:02:39,800
GO WAY LONG, WAY LONG-- OKAY.

62
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,300
I'M OPEN, I'M OPEN!

63
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:43,000
OW, OW, OW!

64
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,000
I CAUGHT IT!

65
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,300
- YES, YES!
- [CHEERING]

66
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:47,233
ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT, EXCELLENT!

67
00:02:47,233 --> 00:02:49,833
ANOTHER TRIUMPH
OF THE HUMAN SPIRIT!

68
00:02:49,833 --> 00:02:51,867
UH-OH, YOU GUYS--

69
00:02:51,867 --> 00:02:53,167
I CAUGHT IT--

70
00:02:53,167 --> 00:02:54,833
I KNEW READING THAT GEORGE WILL
BOOK WOULD PAY OFF.

71
00:02:54,833 --> 00:02:56,267
HEY, THE MAD STEINBRENNERS
ARE CALLING

72
00:02:56,267 --> 00:02:57,933
AND YOU'RE LOSING YOUR GLOVE.

73
00:02:57,933 --> 00:03:00,133
YES, YES, YES!

74
00:03:00,133 --> 00:03:03,667
DR. FORRESTER, LET'S DO
THE WAVE-- WHOO... OH!

75
00:03:03,667 --> 00:03:05,133
STOP PLAYING AROUND UP THERE

76
00:03:05,133 --> 00:03:08,367
AND GET TO THE INVENTION
EXCHANGE, VAN LINGLE MUNGO.

77
00:03:08,367 --> 00:03:10,433
HEY, NICE MUG!

78
00:03:10,433 --> 00:03:12,967
OH, OKAY, SIRS, I CAN SHOW YOU
MY INVENTION EXCHANGE.

79
00:03:12,967 --> 00:03:15,933
THIS IS MY NEW INVENTION--
IT'S CALLED THE CELLULITE PHONE.

80
00:03:15,933 --> 00:03:18,333
IT REMINDS PEOPLE
THAT THEY SHOULD STOP DIALING

81
00:03:18,333 --> 00:03:19,433
AND START DIETING.

82
00:03:19,433 --> 00:03:20,733
AND THAT'S NOT ALL--

83
00:03:20,733 --> 00:03:22,767
THE CELLULITE PHONE FEATURES
A SPEED-DIALING SYSTEM

84
00:03:22,767 --> 00:03:25,900
THAT PUTS YOU DIRECTLY IN TOUCH
WITH RICHARD SIMMONS.

85
00:03:25,900 --> 00:03:28,400
[IMITATING SIMMONS]
YOU KNOW, WHEN YOU WERE CARRYING
AROUND ALL THAT WEIGHT

86
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:32,000
AND THE KIDS USED TO SHOW MOVIES
ON YOUR SHIRT AND YOU WERE
SO UNHAPPY AND--

87
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:36,900
[CRYING]
USE DEAL-A-MEAL AND--

88
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:39,467
AND THE CELLULITE PHONE GENTLY
REMINDS YOU WHAT COULD HAPPEN

89
00:03:39,467 --> 00:03:41,933
IF YOU ORDER OUT
FOR THE WRONG KIND OF FOOD.

90
00:03:41,933 --> 00:03:45,933
UH, HELLO, DOMINO'S, YEAH,
I'M HERE WITH, UH, A COUPLE
OF FRIENDS, A GROUP OF FRIENDS,

91
00:03:45,933 --> 00:03:49,000
AND WE'D LIKE TO ORDER
YOUR LARGE PIZZA, YEAH,

92
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,900
AND I'D ALSO LIKE THAT
WITH EXTRA BREAKFAST CEREAL
AND SOME FRUIT BATS--

93
00:03:52,900 --> 00:03:54,133
NO OLIVES.

94
00:03:54,133 --> 00:03:56,533
--AND SOME A-1 SAUCE
ON TOP OF THAT--

95
00:03:56,533 --> 00:04:00,200
AND FOR TRAVELING, THE CELLULITE
PHONE CAN BE STORED IN, UM,

96
00:04:00,200 --> 00:04:03,867
THIS SPECIAL PINK NYLON
STRETCH PANTS CARRYING CASE.

97
00:04:03,867 --> 00:04:05,433
WHAT DO YOU THINK, SIRS?

98
00:04:05,433 --> 00:04:07,667
WE DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR THAT KIND OF NONSENSE.

99
00:04:07,667 --> 00:04:12,567
FRANK AND I HAVE STARTED
OUR OWN GIZMONIC DAYCARE CENTER
HERE AT DEEP 13,

100
00:04:12,567 --> 00:04:16,700
AND FRANK'S DEVELOPED
A NEW BABY FORMULA THAT'S GOING
TO BE VERY LUCRATIVE FOR US.

101
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:18,033
ISN'T THAT RIGHT, FRANK?

102
00:04:18,033 --> 00:04:19,900
OH, THAT'S RIGHT, I JUST FED
THIS LITTLE FELLA HERE

103
00:04:19,900 --> 00:04:23,133
SOMETHING I LIKE TO CALL
"MIRACLE BABY GROWTH
WONDER FORMULA."

104
00:04:23,133 --> 00:04:26,033
IT HELPS BUILD STRONG BODIES
IN 12 WAYS.

105
00:04:26,033 --> 00:04:28,333
[BABY CRYING]
OH, YES, YOU LOVE ME,
THAT'S RIGHT.

106
00:04:28,333 --> 00:04:29,500
HERE, THAT'S OKAY...

107
00:04:29,500 --> 00:04:30,967
OH, NEVER MIND.

108
00:04:30,967 --> 00:04:32,433
LOOK, BOOBY,
YOUR EXPERIMENT THIS WEEK

109
00:04:32,433 --> 00:04:35,733
IS CALLED "TIME OF THE APES"
AND IT'S REALLY IMMATURE.

110
00:04:35,733 --> 00:04:37,567
WE ASKED ALL THE KIDS HERE
AND THEY SAID IT--

111
00:04:37,567 --> 00:04:38,967
[EXPLOSION]

112
00:04:38,967 --> 00:04:40,033
I DID IT!

113
00:04:40,033 --> 00:04:41,467
IT WORKED BETTER THAN I THOUGHT!

114
00:04:41,467 --> 00:04:46,300
I'M THE DAD, I'M THE DAD!

115
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,633
TELL ME--
[ALARM BLARING]

116
00:04:47,633 --> 00:04:52,833
[ALL]
MOVIE SIGN! MOVIE SIGN!

117
00:04:52,833 --> 00:04:59,700
[CLANKING, WHIRRING,
CREAKING, WHOOSHING]

118
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:02,133
♪♪

119
00:05:02,133 --> 00:05:05,533
OH, NO,
IT'S A SANDY FRANK THING.

120
00:05:05,533 --> 00:05:08,433
[ALL]
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

121
00:05:08,433 --> 00:05:11,567
♪ HERE WE GO AGAIN ♪♪

122
00:05:11,567 --> 00:05:13,000
- HEY!
- ♪ SANDY... ♪

123
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,933
NEAT! LOOKS LIKE
A "SESAME STREET" SEGMENT.

124
00:05:15,933 --> 00:05:18,933
IT DOES, DOESN'T IT?

125
00:05:18,933 --> 00:05:24,600
I'LL TAKE THE KAZUE TAKITA,
BUT HOLD ON THE NOROBU THERE.

126
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:27,067
[ALL]
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

127
00:05:27,067 --> 00:05:30,933
♪ THESE THINGS
AREN'T IN THE FILM ♪♪

128
00:05:30,933 --> 00:05:32,433
"HELP ME! HELP ME!

129
00:05:32,433 --> 00:05:36,933
I'M TRAPPED IN THIS COPYRIGHT,
I WANNA LIVE, I WANNA LIVE!"

130
00:05:36,933 --> 00:05:38,567
[SLOW GUITAR MUSIC]

131
00:05:38,567 --> 00:05:40,767
OOH, MORE SEDATE.

132
00:05:40,767 --> 00:05:44,767
ORIGINAL STORY BY SASQUATCH,
ADAPTED FROM A PLAY BY KOKO
AND A NOVEL BY CHUCKLES.

133
00:05:44,767 --> 00:05:47,933
HEY, THEY LOOK LIKE
THEY'RE ON A PLAYGROUND--
THEY MUST BE "RECESS" MONKEYS.

134
00:05:47,933 --> 00:05:49,633
- DOH!
- I WILL PULL OFF THAT ARM...

135
00:05:49,633 --> 00:05:51,933
DON'T HURT ME.

136
00:05:51,933 --> 00:05:56,600
I LOVE THE TENDER LOVE THEME
FROM "TIME OF THE APES."

137
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,933
ISAAC ASIMOV?

138
00:05:57,933 --> 00:06:01,000
"WHAT ARE YOU LOOKING AT?"

139
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:04,000
HEY, WHERE'S B.J.?

140
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:07,000
OH...

141
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:10,000
♪♪

142
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,000
I DON'T KNOW WHY I KEPT
DUPLICATES OF THIS SHOT.

143
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:19,233
WHO TOOK THESE PHOTOS ANYWAY,
DIANE ARBUS?

144
00:06:19,233 --> 00:06:22,600
HUH?

145
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,233
[WHISTLING BIRD CALL]

146
00:06:24,233 --> 00:06:25,267
I'M STARVING.

147
00:06:25,267 --> 00:06:26,267
"FOR ATTENTION."

148
00:06:26,267 --> 00:06:28,567
"BUTTER, MMM..."

149
00:06:28,567 --> 00:06:31,700
--SO DON'T DISTURB THEIR WORK.

150
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:33,567
I WON'T, MOTHER.

151
00:06:33,567 --> 00:06:36,033
"AND DON'T DUB
WITH YOUR MOUTH FULL!"

152
00:06:36,033 --> 00:06:41,167
JOHNNY, YOU KNOW
YOUR UNCLE CHARLEY HAS MADE
SOME MAJOR DISCOVERIES.

153
00:06:41,167 --> 00:06:42,500
YOU SHOULD BE PROUD OF HIM.

154
00:06:42,500 --> 00:06:44,333
"HE DISCOVERED YOU'RE JAPANESE."

155
00:06:44,333 --> 00:06:46,167
[DOORBELL RINGS]

156
00:06:46,167 --> 00:06:47,500
THAT'S CAROLINE.

157
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:48,933
HURRY, IT'S TIME TO GO.

158
00:06:48,933 --> 00:06:51,500
[ALL]
SAY... SHE'S-- OH...

159
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:52,600
FOR CRYING OUT LOUD.

160
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,867
- OKAY, I'M READY.
- HELLO, CAROLINE.

161
00:06:54,867 --> 00:06:56,700
- GOOD MORNING.
- HELLO, DEAR.

162
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:58,967
JOHNNY, YOU LOOK AFTER
CAROLINE TODAY.

163
00:06:58,967 --> 00:07:00,667
I WILL, DAD.

164
00:07:00,667 --> 00:07:03,300
"OH! WHAT WAS IN THAT OATMEAL?"

165
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:06,133
A TREMOR.

166
00:07:06,133 --> 00:07:07,767
NO...

167
00:07:07,767 --> 00:07:09,100
JOHNNY, DON'T GO,
IT'S TOO DANGEROUS.

168
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:10,467
I DON'T CARE.

169
00:07:10,467 --> 00:07:11,767
COME ON, CAROLINE.

170
00:07:11,767 --> 00:07:13,967
"OFF TO MEET MY DOOM, MOM,
SEE YOU AFTER SCHOOL."

171
00:07:13,967 --> 00:07:15,300
ENJOY YOURSELVES.

172
00:07:15,300 --> 00:07:17,400
♪ ...HOLIDAY WITH JOHNNY ♪

173
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:19,900
♪ EVERY DAY'S A HOLIDAY-- ♪

174
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:22,167
HEY, IT'S JAME GUMB'S VAN.

175
00:07:22,167 --> 00:07:23,500
[LISPING]
IT PUTS THE LOTION ON ITS SKIN.

176
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:24,500
I THINK THAT'S CUTE.

177
00:07:24,500 --> 00:07:25,533
GOOD MORNING, CHILDREN.

178
00:07:25,533 --> 00:07:26,533
WE'RE NOT TOO LATE, ARE WE?

179
00:07:26,533 --> 00:07:27,533
"OH, WE HIT HER."

180
00:07:27,533 --> 00:07:29,233
- GOOD MORNING.
- HELLO.

181
00:07:29,233 --> 00:07:32,600
AT THE MOMENT WE'RE DOING
SOME EXPERIMENTS ON COLD SLEEP.

182
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,200
[CAROLINE]
COLD SLEEP?

183
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,967
YES, WE'RE TRYING TO PRESERVE
VARIOUS CREATURES

184
00:07:35,967 --> 00:07:37,433
FOR EXTENDED PERIODS.

185
00:07:37,433 --> 00:07:38,433
HIYA, FRED.

186
00:07:38,433 --> 00:07:39,433
HI, SALLY.

187
00:07:39,433 --> 00:07:40,567
BYE.

188
00:07:40,567 --> 00:07:41,733
AND ARE THEY STILL ALIVE?

189
00:07:41,733 --> 00:07:43,533
OH, YES, THEY AWAKEN
WHEN WE THAW THEM OUT.

190
00:07:43,533 --> 00:07:45,033
THAT'S INCREDIBLE.

191
00:07:45,033 --> 00:07:46,833
WHAT'S IN HERE, CATHERINE?

192
00:07:46,833 --> 00:07:49,700
IN THIS ROOM
WE HAVE SOME MONKEYS.

193
00:07:49,700 --> 00:07:52,700
SURPRISE! THAT'S WHERE THE TITLE
OF THE FILM CAME FROM.

194
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:55,867
ACTUALLY, HE WAS ASLEEP FOR OVER
20 YEARS UNTIL THIS MORNING.

195
00:07:55,867 --> 00:07:58,100
"NOW HE'S GRADUATED
FROM COLLEGE"

196
00:07:58,100 --> 00:07:59,633
WE CALL THAT ONE KING KONG.

197
00:07:59,633 --> 00:08:01,067
'CAUSE HE'S SO SMALL, GET IT?

198
00:08:01,067 --> 00:08:02,233
[LAUGHING SARCASTICALLY]

199
00:08:02,233 --> 00:08:05,633
[BEEPING AND CLICKING]

200
00:08:05,633 --> 00:08:08,033
OH, IT'S FANTASTIC!

201
00:08:08,033 --> 00:08:09,200
IT SURE IS.

202
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,333
IT'S CARDBOARD.

203
00:08:10,333 --> 00:08:11,633
IS THIS THE CONTROL CENTER?

204
00:08:11,633 --> 00:08:12,933
WELL, IT'S ABOUT TIME.

205
00:08:12,933 --> 00:08:15,333
IT'S ABOUT SPACE--
[HUMMING]

206
00:08:15,333 --> 00:08:16,333
GOOD MORNING, CAROLINE.

207
00:08:16,333 --> 00:08:17,900
LOOK AT THE MOUNTAIN.

208
00:08:17,900 --> 00:08:20,233
WE HAD A WARNING FROM THE
SEISMOLOGICAL INSTITUTE TODAY.

209
00:08:20,233 --> 00:08:22,100
THERE'S SEEMS TO BE
SOME SUBTERRANEAN SHIFTING.

210
00:08:22,100 --> 00:08:23,533
YOU MEAN AN EARTHQUAKE.

211
00:08:23,533 --> 00:08:26,067
IT LOOKS SERIOUS--
MAYBE AN EARTHQUAKE.

212
00:08:26,067 --> 00:08:28,067
YES, BUT NOTHING'LL
HAPPEN SUDDENLY.

213
00:08:28,067 --> 00:08:29,067
[ALL SCREAM]

214
00:08:29,067 --> 00:08:30,300
WELL, CAROLINE,
IS IT INTERESTING?

215
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:32,233
OH, YES, ESPECIALLY
THE COLD SLEEP EXPERIMENT.

216
00:08:32,233 --> 00:08:35,167
DR. LEE, THE CHILDREN ARE VERY
CONCERNED ABOUT OUR MONKEYS.

217
00:08:35,167 --> 00:08:37,400
YES, YOU GET THE FEELING
THEY'RE REALLY DEAD.

218
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:38,933
ARE YOU SURE THEY'LL LIVE AGAIN?

219
00:08:38,933 --> 00:08:40,467
WHY, OF COURSE THEY WILL.

220
00:08:40,467 --> 00:08:42,300
COME, I'LL SHOW YOU
SOMETHING FASCINATING.

221
00:08:42,300 --> 00:08:43,300
FOR A CHANGE.

222
00:08:43,300 --> 00:08:44,300
HMM...

223
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:46,333
"I LOVE YOU, MARGARET."

224
00:08:46,333 --> 00:08:47,967
"FRANK, NOT NOW!"

225
00:08:47,967 --> 00:08:50,400
♪♪

226
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:53,700
SEEMS LIKE A LOT OF WORK
TO GO THROUGH TO MAKE
AN EGGO FROZEN WAFFLE.

227
00:08:53,700 --> 00:08:55,833
"PLAY 'MISTY' FOR ME."

228
00:08:55,833 --> 00:08:58,200
[CLICK, DISTORTED SOUNDS]

229
00:08:58,200 --> 00:09:02,933
RADIO SHACK PARTS.

230
00:09:02,933 --> 00:09:04,500
KITTY!

231
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:06,067
IT'S SNOWBALL!

232
00:09:06,067 --> 00:09:12,367
HOSTESS SNOWBALL--
[CHUCKLES]

233
00:09:12,367 --> 00:09:15,700
HMM, SOMEBODY'S CARPET.

234
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,867
AND IT'S BEING STEAM-CLEANED.

235
00:09:17,867 --> 00:09:21,433
RUG DOCTOR--
STEAMIN' MAD AT MONKEYS.

236
00:09:21,433 --> 00:09:23,733
[CRACKLING]

237
00:09:23,733 --> 00:09:27,233
YECH--
[SNIFFS]

238
00:09:27,233 --> 00:09:30,000
OH, THEY CAUTERIZED HER.

239
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:32,467
EWW...

240
00:09:32,467 --> 00:09:36,200
THEY'RE USING
GRECIAN FORMULA-- NEAT.

241
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,400
[WHOOSH]

242
00:09:38,400 --> 00:09:40,467
OOH, GOOD GOD A-MONKEY!

243
00:09:40,467 --> 00:09:43,133
"A LITTLE HORSE
FOR A LITTLE MONKEY."

244
00:09:43,133 --> 00:09:46,267
HEY, HE'LL HAVE HIMSELF
ON HIS BACK.

245
00:09:46,267 --> 00:09:47,867
[BEEPING AND CLICKING]

246
00:09:47,867 --> 00:09:51,033
"HMM, MY STOCKS ARE UP."

247
00:09:51,033 --> 00:09:53,167
AH...

248
00:09:53,167 --> 00:09:56,067
"AW, SHOOT, AM I TIRED, OH..."

249
00:09:56,067 --> 00:09:59,933
"NOW TO SHAVE HIS BUTT
AND PUT COSMETICS ON IT."

250
00:09:59,933 --> 00:10:02,900
"OH, I'M NOT GOOD UNTIL I GET
A CUP OF COFFEE, CAN YOU--"

251
00:10:02,900 --> 00:10:06,200
- OH, HE'S ALIVE!
- YES!

252
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:08,000
THERE, AS GOOD AS NEW.

253
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,667
"AND NO FREEZER BURN."

254
00:10:09,667 --> 00:10:11,167
IS IT ALL RIGHT?
THE FREEZING DIDN'T HURT IT?

255
00:10:11,167 --> 00:10:12,333
NO, HE WAS ONLY SLEEPING.

256
00:10:12,333 --> 00:10:13,667
IT'S WILLIAM BURROUGHS.

257
00:10:13,667 --> 00:10:15,633
WE COULD HAVE LEFT HIM FROZEN
FOR A HUNDRED YEARS--

258
00:10:15,633 --> 00:10:18,767
OR EVEN A THOUSAND--
WITHOUT CAUSING HIM ANY DAMAGE.

259
00:10:18,767 --> 00:10:20,733
YOU SEE, WITH OUR NEW PROCESS--

260
00:10:20,733 --> 00:10:22,467
[SNORING AND WHISTLING]

261
00:10:22,467 --> 00:10:24,600
WE CAN PRESERVE LIFE
ALMOST ETERNALLY.

262
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,133
"GO AHEAD, BITE HIM."

263
00:10:26,133 --> 00:10:28,633
WE'VE EVEN EXPERIMENTED
WITH HUMAN BEINGS.

264
00:10:28,633 --> 00:10:30,067
REALLY? HUMAN BEINGS?

265
00:10:30,067 --> 00:10:31,333
"YES-- THIS IS WALT DISNEY."

266
00:10:31,333 --> 00:10:33,367
WE HAVE HERE A VERY WEALTHY MAN,
JAMES BEDFORD.

267
00:10:33,367 --> 00:10:37,167
IN HIS WILL, HE REQUESTED
THAT HIS BODY BE FROZEN
IMMEDIATELY AFTER DEATH.

268
00:10:37,167 --> 00:10:40,233
WE GAVE HIM VARIOUS COMPOUNDS
TO REVERSE THE DECAYING EFFECTS
OF OLD AGE.

269
00:10:40,233 --> 00:10:42,567
"YEAH, WE TURNED HIM
INTO A HUMMEL-- CHECK IT OUT."

270
00:10:42,567 --> 00:10:44,867
--AT 196 DEGREES BELOW ZERO.

271
00:10:44,867 --> 00:10:47,300
AND SO WE HOPE
THAT WHEN HE AWAKENS,

272
00:10:47,300 --> 00:10:50,267
HE'LL BE EVEN YOUNGER
AND HEALTHIER THAN BEFORE.

273
00:10:50,267 --> 00:10:52,800
IT SEEMS WRONG TO TAMPER
WITH THE LAWS OF NATURE.

274
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,933
"HEY, I KNOW."

275
00:10:54,933 --> 00:10:57,267
- HERE.
- [GASPING]

276
00:10:57,267 --> 00:11:00,200
THIS ROOM IS FOR
VERY SPECIAL EXPERIMENTS.

277
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:01,767
JOHNNY, DON'T TOUCH
ANY OF THE EQUIPMENT.

278
00:11:01,767 --> 00:11:03,433
"I DON'T CARE."

279
00:11:03,433 --> 00:11:05,333
THIS CAPSULE IS USED
FOR PEOPLE, RIGHT?

280
00:11:05,333 --> 00:11:07,433
AND THEY'RE FROZEN IN THERE?

281
00:11:07,433 --> 00:11:10,000
ONCE THEY'RE INSIDE, ALL THE
CONTROLS ARE SET FOR OUR TEST

282
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,733
AND A COMPUTER TAKES OVER
AUTOMATICALLY.

283
00:11:11,733 --> 00:11:13,433
"IT'S GLORIOUS."

284
00:11:13,433 --> 00:11:16,067
WE TRANSMIT OUR FINDINGS TO
THE WORLD'S LEADING SCIENTISTS.

285
00:11:16,067 --> 00:11:18,867
BUT WHEN THEY'RE FROZEN AT
HUNDREDS OF DEGREES BELOW ZERO,

286
00:11:18,867 --> 00:11:20,400
IT'S JUST LIKE THEY'RE
REALLY DEAD.

287
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:22,533
- YES.
- ONLY THEY'RE NOT.

288
00:11:22,533 --> 00:11:24,100
"BUT THEIR SOULS ARE."

289
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:25,667
DON'T THEY FEEL ANYTHING?

290
00:11:25,667 --> 00:11:27,800
[SQUEAKING]

291
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:31,533
WE FIRST PREPARE THEM
WITH A SPECIAL INJECTION
LIKE AN ANESTHETIC.

292
00:11:31,533 --> 00:11:32,767
"WANT SOME?"

293
00:11:32,767 --> 00:11:34,067
AND THEN IT'S LIKE
THEY'RE SLEEPING.

294
00:11:34,067 --> 00:11:36,333
SOME EVEN TELL US
THAT THEY WERE DREAMING.

295
00:11:36,333 --> 00:11:37,767
"OF A WHITE CHRISTMAS?"

296
00:11:37,767 --> 00:11:40,167
IT'S REALLY INCREDIBLE.

297
00:11:40,167 --> 00:11:41,467
JOHNNY, DON'T GO IN THERE.

298
00:11:41,467 --> 00:11:42,533
"I DON'T CARE."

299
00:11:42,533 --> 00:11:43,867
COME ON OUT.

300
00:11:43,867 --> 00:11:45,267
WE HAVEN'T COMPLETED
THOSE EXPERIMENTS.

301
00:11:45,267 --> 00:11:48,467
I JUST WONDER WHAT IT'S LIKE
TO BE FROZEN.

302
00:11:48,467 --> 00:11:52,267
NOW GET OUT--
OR I'LL GET VERY ANGRY.

303
00:11:52,267 --> 00:11:53,967
[BOOM]

304
00:11:53,967 --> 00:11:54,967
"SEE?"

305
00:11:54,967 --> 00:11:55,967
AN EARTHQUAKE!

306
00:11:55,967 --> 00:11:57,633
- UH-OH!
- WHOA!

307
00:11:57,633 --> 00:12:00,000
OH... NELLY! OOPS.

308
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:03,400
JOHNNY, GET OUT!
JOHNNY! JOHNNY!

309
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:06,100
"JOHNNY, BE GOOD... AAH...!"

310
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:07,933
GO, JOHNNY, GO!

311
00:12:07,933 --> 00:12:10,300
OH, THE PEOPLE UPSTAIRS
ARE DANCING AGAIN.

312
00:12:10,300 --> 00:12:12,433
OH, FOR CRYING OUT LOUD.

313
00:12:12,433 --> 00:12:16,400
ROCKIN' AND A-- ROLLIN'.

314
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:18,100
GET IN HERE!

315
00:12:18,100 --> 00:12:19,967
"IT KEEPS THE HOT SIDE HOT
AND THE COLD SIDE COLD!"

316
00:12:19,967 --> 00:12:21,867
"HOW DO IT KNOW?"

317
00:12:21,867 --> 00:12:24,900
(GASPING)

318
00:12:24,900 --> 00:12:27,933
- WHOA...
- WHOA!

319
00:12:27,933 --> 00:12:33,067
KRAKATOA!

320
00:12:33,067 --> 00:12:36,200
OH, NO, IT HIT
THE PLOT CONTRIVANCE SWITCH!

321
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:38,533
"OH, WOW..."

322
00:12:38,533 --> 00:12:40,600
ARE YOU THINKING
WHAT I'M THINKING?

323
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:43,533
THEY'RE GONNA END UP BEING
AN IRWIN ALLEN PRODUCTION.

324
00:12:43,533 --> 00:12:46,700
- MM-HMM.
- HERE WE GO.

325
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:49,067
I LOVE THE SOUND
OF BREAKING GLASS.

326
00:12:49,067 --> 00:12:51,500
- ESPECIALLY WHEN I'M LONELY.
- YEAH.

327
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:55,900
OH, BUT I HATE
THESE MINNESOTA WINTERS.

328
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:58,600
LOOKIT-- THEY'RE SHELLACKED,
THEN DECOUPAGED,

329
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,667
THEN SOLD AT AN ART STORE.

330
00:13:00,667 --> 00:13:01,733
NEAT.

331
00:13:01,733 --> 00:13:04,667
HMM.

332
00:13:04,667 --> 00:13:07,433
IF A TREE FALLS IN JAPAN
AND NO ONE IS THERE--

333
00:13:07,433 --> 00:13:09,500
JOHNNY'S CARSON'S MALIBU HOME.

334
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:12,233
- NOT ANYMORE.
- SORRY, JOHNNY.

335
00:13:12,233 --> 00:13:14,133
DID THE EARTH MOVE
FOR YOU TOO?

336
00:13:14,133 --> 00:13:16,100
NO, BUT THE MODEL DID.

337
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:18,900
YOU KNOW, I BET JOHNNY
CARES NOW, HUH, FELLAS?

338
00:13:18,900 --> 00:13:21,567
[ALL CHUCKLING]

339
00:13:21,567 --> 00:13:24,267
I FEEL THE PLOT MOVE
UNDER MY FEET.

340
00:13:24,267 --> 00:13:26,267
WHOA!

341
00:13:26,267 --> 00:13:29,300
I WAS AT A PARTY
LIKE THIS ONCE, YOU KNOW.

342
00:13:29,300 --> 00:13:32,333
WHOA, SUDDENLY
WE'RE AT THE FILLMORE!

343
00:13:32,333 --> 00:13:34,133
OH, BOY, IT'S THE CREDITS AGAIN!

344
00:13:34,133 --> 00:13:35,733
NO...!

345
00:13:35,733 --> 00:13:37,933
♪♪

346
00:13:41,367 --> 00:13:46,367
DO NOT ATTEMPT
TO ADJUST YOUR TV SET.

347
00:13:46,367 --> 00:13:50,400
WOW, SHE'S GOT
FREEZE-PROOF MASCARA.

348
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:53,933
"WHOA, I REALLY TIED ONE ON
LAST NIGHT.

349
00:13:53,933 --> 00:13:57,900
I GOT THE SAKE GOGGLES
BIG-TIME."

350
00:13:57,900 --> 00:13:59,367
IT'S THE DALEKS!

351
00:13:59,367 --> 00:14:02,233
EXTERMINATE,
EXTERMINATE, EXTER--

352
00:14:02,233 --> 00:14:03,767
WHERE ARE WE?

353
00:14:03,767 --> 00:14:05,067
UNCLE!

354
00:14:05,067 --> 00:14:09,633
DOES THAT MEAN GIVE UP?

355
00:14:09,633 --> 00:14:13,000
THE EARTHQUAKE...

356
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,000
[GASPS]

357
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:16,000
IT'S JUST A DOOR.

358
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:18,167
WHAT A PANTYWAIST, GEEZ.

359
00:14:18,167 --> 00:14:20,700
HOW STRANGE.

360
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,833
UNCLE CHARLEY!

361
00:14:23,833 --> 00:14:25,767
[IMITATING WILLIAM DEMAREST]
AH, WHAT DO YOU WANT, KID?

362
00:14:25,767 --> 00:14:30,333
CHIP, ERNIE-- WHERE THE HECK
IS PRESTON STURGES?

363
00:14:30,333 --> 00:14:32,867
IT DOESN'T LOOK LIKE
THE INSTITUTE.

364
00:14:32,867 --> 00:14:38,233
"THE ONE THAT I WAS
COMMITTED TO."

365
00:14:38,233 --> 00:14:40,000
WHAT HAPPENED TO MY UNCLE?

366
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:42,767
WHAT HAPPENED TO YOUR PANTS?

367
00:14:42,767 --> 00:14:44,933
HELLO?

368
00:14:44,933 --> 00:14:47,000
- ♪ HELLO... ♪
- ♪ HELLO... ♪
- ♪ HELLO... ♪

369
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,300
[ALL]
HELLO!

370
00:14:48,300 --> 00:14:50,767
WHAT NOW?

371
00:14:50,767 --> 00:14:52,433
[DRAMATIC MUSIC]

372
00:14:52,433 --> 00:14:53,567
LET'S GO AHEAD.

373
00:14:53,567 --> 00:14:58,033
[IMITATES DRAMATIC MUSIC]

374
00:14:58,033 --> 00:15:00,667
"HEY, OPENED IT--"

375
00:15:00,667 --> 00:15:02,467
UNCLE!

376
00:15:02,467 --> 00:15:04,333
NOT!

377
00:15:04,333 --> 00:15:05,800
[ALL GASP]

378
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:08,100
- "DO I WORRY YOU?"
- "LOVE ME!"

379
00:15:08,100 --> 00:15:10,433
"HI, HOW ARE YA?"

380
00:15:10,433 --> 00:15:12,800
[IMITATES WOODY ALLEN]
"OH, I GOT MY HAND ON THE DOOR

381
00:15:12,800 --> 00:15:15,500
AND IT'S STUCK
AND I'M FRIGHTENED AND-- HO..."

382
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:17,200
[SCREAMS]

383
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:19,233
[ALARM BLARING]

384
00:15:19,233 --> 00:15:22,567
"HUMAN ALERT!"

385
00:15:22,567 --> 00:15:23,900
"HUMAN!"

386
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:25,533
"AH!"

387
00:15:25,533 --> 00:15:28,167
"AH!"

388
00:15:28,167 --> 00:15:34,100
IT'S A WHOLE PLANET
OF RON PERLMANS! WHOA...

389
00:15:34,100 --> 00:15:35,100
LOOK THERE!

390
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:36,167
[CAROLINE SCREAMS]

391
00:15:36,167 --> 00:15:37,633
"MAKE MY DAY!"

392
00:15:37,633 --> 00:15:41,567
AH, YOU-- YOU LET US GO
OR I'LL KILL YOU!

393
00:15:41,567 --> 00:15:43,433
JOHNNY, STOP THAT!

394
00:15:43,433 --> 00:15:47,067
"DON'T TALK TO MONKEYS, JOHNNY."

395
00:15:47,067 --> 00:15:48,333
WHERE ARE WE?

396
00:15:48,333 --> 00:15:49,467
YOU'RE TIED TO A TREE.

397
00:15:49,467 --> 00:15:51,867
WHERE'S MY UNCLE CHARLEY?

398
00:15:51,867 --> 00:15:54,700
I DON'T KNOW, JOHNNY.

399
00:15:54,700 --> 00:15:56,567
IT'S ALL SO STRANGE.

400
00:15:56,567 --> 00:15:58,100
CATHERINE, I'M SCARED!

401
00:15:58,100 --> 00:15:59,233
IT'S LIKE A DE PALMA FILM.

402
00:15:59,233 --> 00:16:00,867
DON'T BE AFRAID, WE'RE WITH YOU.

403
00:16:00,867 --> 00:16:02,500
"WE'RE DOOMED BUT WITH YOU."

404
00:16:02,500 --> 00:16:04,100
WHY ARE THERE ONLY APES HERE?

405
00:16:04,100 --> 00:16:05,267
OOH, I'M GETTING DIZZY.

406
00:16:05,267 --> 00:16:06,567
WHY AREN'T THERE
ANY HUMAN BEINGS?

407
00:16:06,567 --> 00:16:09,000
READ THE BOOK.

408
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:11,567
"DO YOU LIKE
LONG WALKS ON THE BEACH?

409
00:16:11,567 --> 00:16:15,167
CHINESE FOODS?
MUSHING UP YOUR BANANAS?"

410
00:16:15,167 --> 00:16:18,700
"I COULD DO WONDERS
WITH THIS HAIR, YOU REALIZE."

411
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:20,800
CATHERINE, I'M SCARED!

412
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:23,733
WE HAVE TO TRY AND STAY CALM,
CAROLINE, UNDERSTAND?

413
00:16:23,733 --> 00:16:26,833
"IF THEY EAT US NOW,
THEY'LL BE HUNGRY IN AN HOUR."

414
00:16:26,833 --> 00:16:31,033
OH-- [SPITS]

415
00:16:31,033 --> 00:16:35,333
OH, GOOD THING
HE SUDDENLY EVOLVED.

416
00:16:35,333 --> 00:16:37,500
HEY, HERE COMES
THE SCOPES MONKEY TRIAL GUY.

417
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:42,800
OOH-- PSYCHEDELIC.

418
00:16:42,800 --> 00:16:46,600
"OH, WHY, I OUGHTA--
OH, YOU'RE NOT WORTH IT, OH--"

419
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:55,300
NEAT.

420
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:58,633
[AS GEORGE C. SCOTT'S PATTON]
"NOW, YOU MAGNIFICENT
SON OF BITCH--"

421
00:16:58,633 --> 00:17:01,833
[TRUMPET FANFARE]

422
00:17:01,833 --> 00:17:04,333
[SQUEALING]
OH, WHAT ARE THEY
GONNA DO WITH US?

423
00:17:04,333 --> 00:17:05,567
"I HOPE THEY LOWER YOUR VOICE."

424
00:17:05,567 --> 00:17:07,133
IT LOOKS LIKE THEY'RE GONNA
TAKE US SOMEWHERE.

425
00:17:07,133 --> 00:17:08,400
THE COMPANY PICNIC?

426
00:17:08,400 --> 00:17:10,033
THEY'RE GONNA KILL US!

427
00:17:10,033 --> 00:17:13,133
NO! I DON'T WANNA BE KILLED
BY A MONKEY!

428
00:17:13,133 --> 00:17:14,533
"I WANNA DIE AT MY OWN HAND!"

429
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:19,167
WE MUSTN'T DO
ANYTHING TO ANGER THEM.

430
00:17:19,167 --> 00:17:22,200
[LISPING]
"COME ON, GIRLS, WE'RE GONNA
GIVE 'EM A MAKEOVER

431
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:23,400
THEY WON'T BELIEVE."

432
00:17:25,967 --> 00:17:28,867
[TOM SERVO CHUCKLING]

433
00:17:28,867 --> 00:17:30,133
"SHE'S FIRST."

434
00:17:36,733 --> 00:17:39,667
MYSTERY GUEST,
ENTER AND SIGN IN, PLEASE.

435
00:17:39,667 --> 00:17:42,400
MAKE HER WALK THE PLANK,
YOU SALTY DOG.

436
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:44,633
"SLAG HEAP," RATED "R".

437
00:17:44,633 --> 00:17:46,467
[DISTORTED GUITAR MUSIC]

438
00:17:46,467 --> 00:17:48,967
TODAY ON
"INVOLUNTARY CLIFF DIVING,"

439
00:17:48,967 --> 00:17:52,733
WE'VE GOT THREE CONTESTANTS.

440
00:17:52,733 --> 00:17:56,867
THEY'VE ENTERED THE VALLEY
OF THE FUZZ-TONE GUITAR.

441
00:17:56,867 --> 00:17:59,033
OOH...

442
00:17:59,033 --> 00:18:02,600
[ALL GASPING]

443
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:08,633
"A BOWLING BALL!"

444
00:18:08,633 --> 00:18:10,100
THEY'RE HUMAN BONES!

445
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:12,533
THEY'RE GONNA KILL US!

446
00:18:12,533 --> 00:18:14,167
NO!

447
00:18:14,167 --> 00:18:17,133
"I DON'T CARE--
MAYBE JUST A LITTLE."

448
00:18:17,133 --> 00:18:21,733
"I LIKE YOU--
I'M GONNA KILL YOU LAST."

449
00:18:21,733 --> 00:18:26,200
[ALL GASP]

450
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:30,367
"SO, WE PUT UP WITH CENTURIES
OF BELLHOP COSTUMES,

451
00:18:30,367 --> 00:18:32,500
"LITTLE T-SHIRTS
THAT SAY 'ZIPPY' ON THEM,

452
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:35,767
"BADMINTON ON ICE, ROLLER
SKATES, CIGARS IN OUR MOUTHS...

453
00:18:35,767 --> 00:18:37,767
LANCELOT LINK ALONE SET US BACK
A HUNDRED YEARS!"

454
00:18:37,767 --> 00:18:42,433
[IMITATES SPURS JINGLING]

455
00:18:42,433 --> 00:18:43,433
"NOW YOU!"

456
00:18:43,433 --> 00:18:46,200
LET'S RUN, CATHERINE!

457
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,200
WHOA!

458
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,733
"RUN FOR IT!"

459
00:18:49,733 --> 00:18:52,533
[GUNFIRE]

460
00:18:52,533 --> 00:18:54,400
- "SERPENTINE!"
- "SERPENTINE!"

461
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:57,333
- "SERPENTINE!
DODGE THE BULLETS!"

462
00:18:57,333 --> 00:19:00,033
OOH!

463
00:19:00,033 --> 00:19:03,467
OH-- MEANWHILE,
IN THE EMERALD FOREST...

464
00:19:03,467 --> 00:19:06,433
WHERE'S JOHN BOORMAN?

465
00:19:06,433 --> 00:19:08,033
DON'T LET THEM GET AWAY!

466
00:19:08,033 --> 00:19:09,033
KILL THEM!

467
00:19:09,033 --> 00:19:10,333
GOOD PLAN.

468
00:19:10,333 --> 00:19:12,933
[TWANGY MUSIC]

469
00:19:12,933 --> 00:19:13,933
I LOVE THE JAW HARP.

470
00:19:13,933 --> 00:19:17,200
AFTER THEM!

471
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:19,600
WHERE'D THEY GO?

472
00:19:19,600 --> 00:19:20,900
THIS WAY!

473
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:22,767
OH, LOOK UP THERE-- NED BEATTY!

474
00:19:22,767 --> 00:19:26,800
"YOU'RE A FAT OLD HOG, HEH-HEH."

475
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:29,300
SORRY.

476
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,400
AH!

477
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,400
THERE'S A BRIDGE THERE!

478
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:32,800
NICE BRIDGEWORK.

479
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:36,333
LET'S TRY AND CROSS IT, COME ON!

480
00:19:36,333 --> 00:19:38,800
BUT STAY TOGETHER.

481
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,600
YEAH, THAT'S WHAT
AL GREEN SAID-- I AGREE.

482
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:44,067
- I HEAR YA.
- YEAH.

483
00:19:44,067 --> 00:19:45,133
- "WHOA!"
- "WHOA!"

484
00:19:45,133 --> 00:19:46,233
DID YOU SEE THEM?

485
00:19:46,233 --> 00:19:47,267
THEY DISAPPEARED!

486
00:19:47,267 --> 00:19:49,033
COME ON, THIS WAY!

487
00:19:49,033 --> 00:19:51,600
"LET'S HAVE OUR PICNIC
OVER HERE!"

488
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:56,700
"PREPARE TO MEET KALI--
IN HELL!"

489
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:58,533
YOU KNOW,
IT'S GOOD TO HAVE THUMBS.

490
00:19:58,533 --> 00:19:59,800
YEAH-- HUH?

491
00:19:59,800 --> 00:20:01,033
WHERE DID THAT COME FROM?

492
00:20:01,033 --> 00:20:02,100
I DON'T KNOW.

493
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:03,333
YOU SAID "BOWLING BALL" EARLIER.

494
00:20:03,333 --> 00:20:04,467
WHAT DID THAT MEAN?

495
00:20:04,467 --> 00:20:07,533
I DON'T KNOW, IT'S JUST---

496
00:20:07,533 --> 00:20:10,000
THAT'S IT,
JUST A LITTLE MORE TO GO.

497
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:13,300
"MUST... GET TO...
MY UTILITY BELT."

498
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:16,267
- "MORNING, RON."
- "HI, PHIL."

499
00:20:16,267 --> 00:20:19,000
- "HOW'S THE WIFE?"
- "GOOD, THANKS FOR ASKING."

500
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:21,800
"SAY, NICE BOOTS
YOU'RE WEARING THERE."

501
00:20:21,800 --> 00:20:23,500
[GASPING]

502
00:20:23,500 --> 00:20:25,533
[BRITISH ACCENT]
LOOK, IF YOU CAN'T WORK OUT
30 MINUTES A DAY,

503
00:20:25,533 --> 00:20:29,367
YOU DON'T DESERVE A HOT DATE.

504
00:20:29,367 --> 00:20:31,133
SHEENA CROW.

505
00:20:31,133 --> 00:20:33,200
[GASPS]

506
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,267
"MY PIECE OF WOOD!

507
00:20:34,267 --> 00:20:38,067
IT DIED SO THAT WE MIGHT LIVE."

508
00:20:38,067 --> 00:20:42,467
- "OH, IT'S JUST
SOME KIDS DOWN THERE."
- "OH."

509
00:20:42,467 --> 00:20:44,033
DID YOU SEE THEM?

510
00:20:44,033 --> 00:20:45,600
"I CAN'T SEE ANYTHING
THROUGH THIS MASK."

511
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:46,767
WE COULDN'T FIND THEM ANYWHERE.

512
00:20:46,767 --> 00:20:48,600
THEY MUST HAVE CROSSED
TO THE OTHER SIDE.

513
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:51,367
THIS WAY, THIS WAY.

514
00:20:51,367 --> 00:20:54,500
"SO LET'S JUST HANG HERE
FOR A WHILE."

515
00:20:54,500 --> 00:20:59,100
"OOF-- AREN'T YOU GLAD
YOU USE DIAL?"

516
00:20:59,100 --> 00:21:00,600
TICKLE, TICKLE.

517
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,900
"DON'T YOU WISH EVERYBODY DID?"

518
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:03,533
THAT WAS LUCKY.

519
00:21:03,533 --> 00:21:05,000
NOBODY SAW US-- KEEP GOING.

520
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:06,533
TICKLE, TICKLE.

521
00:21:06,533 --> 00:21:08,233
THAT'S MEAN, JOEL.

522
00:21:08,233 --> 00:21:12,033
HEY, HEY, IT'S KEN KESEY
AND THE MERRY PRANKSTERS!

523
00:21:12,033 --> 00:21:14,533
"DANG TOURISTS."

524
00:21:14,533 --> 00:21:15,933
LET'S GO, THIS WAY!

525
00:21:15,933 --> 00:21:18,233
OH, LIKE YOU KNOW
WHERE YOU'RE GOING.

526
00:21:18,233 --> 00:21:19,700
AH, A HOUSE!

527
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:20,800
LOOK, THERE'S A HOUSE!

528
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,000
[SQUEAKY]
YES!

529
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,733
MUST YOU SCREAM
EVERY OBSERVATION?

530
00:21:23,733 --> 00:21:27,300
CAREFUL-- WE DON'T KNOW
WHO LIVES THERE.

531
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:31,133
[GRAVELLY VOICE]
"HI, I'M WILLIAM CONRAD
FOR FIRST ALERT.

532
00:21:31,133 --> 00:21:32,633
"DON'T LET THIS HAPPEN TO YOU.

533
00:21:32,633 --> 00:21:34,333
"PAPER WINDOWS JUST AREN'T SAFE.

534
00:21:34,333 --> 00:21:35,667
"UH, USE THE DOOR.

535
00:21:35,667 --> 00:21:36,667
THANK YOU."

536
00:21:36,667 --> 00:21:38,833
THERE'S NO ONE INSIDE.

537
00:21:38,833 --> 00:21:41,500
"TIME FOR YOUR ORIGAMI LESSONS."

538
00:21:41,500 --> 00:21:43,833
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

539
00:21:43,833 --> 00:21:48,867
[IMITATES MUSIC]

540
00:21:48,867 --> 00:21:54,200
"HEY, LET'S FIND A REFRIGERATOR
AND FREEZE OURSELVES BACK!"

541
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:57,800
"IT'S ROOMY-- I LIKE IT."

542
00:21:57,800 --> 00:21:59,900
DON'T MAKE ANY NOISE.

543
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:03,400
SHH...

544
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,767
HEY, KEITH RICHARDS AT HOME.

545
00:22:04,767 --> 00:22:05,800
[APE SQUEALS]

546
00:22:05,800 --> 00:22:06,900
NO, DON'T--

547
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:08,800
OH, NAKED APES!

548
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:11,300
- NO, DON'T!
- NO, NO!

549
00:22:11,300 --> 00:22:15,400
IT'S A MONKEY MIME!

550
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:18,133
"HI."

551
00:22:18,133 --> 00:22:21,700
HEY, YOU CAUGHT HIM RIGHT
IN THE MIDDLE OF HIS FACIAL.

552
00:22:21,700 --> 00:22:23,900
IS THIS YOUR HOME?

553
00:22:23,900 --> 00:22:25,100
YES.

554
00:22:25,100 --> 00:22:27,133
AH! IT SPEAKS!

555
00:22:27,133 --> 00:22:29,800
I HOPE IT'S ALL RIGHT,
OUR ENTERING LIKE THIS.

556
00:22:29,800 --> 00:22:31,100
I DON'T MIND.

557
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:33,733
YEAH, NOW TELL HIM
ABOUT THE TORN WINDOW.

558
00:22:33,733 --> 00:22:35,900
YEAH--
♪ YOU'RE GONNA GET
IN TROUBLE-- ♪

559
00:22:35,900 --> 00:22:38,500
[APES YELLING OUTSIDE,
CATHERINE GASPS]

560
00:22:38,500 --> 00:22:39,533
THIS WAY!

561
00:22:39,533 --> 00:22:40,533
OVER HERE!

562
00:22:40,533 --> 00:22:41,667
CATHERINE!

563
00:22:41,667 --> 00:22:43,967
HERE! LET'S RUN!

564
00:22:43,967 --> 00:22:52,667
[WHOOSHING, CREAKING,
WHIRRING, CLANKING]

565
00:22:52,667 --> 00:22:55,100
JOHNNY, DON'T GO,
IT'S TOO DANGEROUS.

566
00:22:55,100 --> 00:22:56,367
I DON'T CARE.

567
00:22:56,367 --> 00:22:57,967
"WHY DOESN'T JOHNNY CARE?"

568
00:22:57,967 --> 00:23:00,100
A FILM BY BELL LABS.

569
00:23:00,100 --> 00:23:01,833
[CROW IMITATING PROJECTOR]

570
00:23:01,833 --> 00:23:04,700
JOHNNY LIKES TO SIT NEXT TO
HIS GIRLFRIEND SALLY
HERE ON THE BUS,

571
00:23:04,700 --> 00:23:06,800
BUT SHE'S GOT OTHER FISH TO FRY.

572
00:23:06,800 --> 00:23:08,867
STRIKE ONE AGAINST JOHNNY.

573
00:23:08,867 --> 00:23:12,733
HEY, THAT BUILDING UP AHEAD
IS JOHNNY'S SCHOOL,
TARKUS BRAINLAB 4,

574
00:23:12,733 --> 00:23:16,267
AND HERE IS JOHNNY'S
INNER SANCTUM HELPMATE,
MRS. REESE.

575
00:23:16,267 --> 00:23:20,933
TO JOHNNY, THE HALLS OF TARKUS
BRAINLAB 4 ARE FILLED WITH
DARK, SHADOWY FIGURES.

576
00:23:20,933 --> 00:23:24,767
A FEW WHISPERED WORDS,
THE STING OF A NEEDLE
AND THEY'RE GONE, GONE, GONE.

577
00:23:24,767 --> 00:23:29,933
NO ONE STAYS TOO LONG
IN JOHNNY'S WORLD-- WOULD YOU?

578
00:23:29,933 --> 00:23:32,633
WHAT LOOKS LIKE A NORMAL
PLAYGROUND TO YOU OR I

579
00:23:32,633 --> 00:23:35,900
TAKES ON A HIDEOUS SIMIAN
APPEARANCE IN JOHNNY'S MIND.

580
00:23:35,900 --> 00:23:39,233
IMAGES LEAP AND DANCE LIKE
MELTING COLORED CARAMEL CANDIES.

581
00:23:39,233 --> 00:23:43,967
[DISTORTING VOICE]
JOHNNY'S HEROINE IS ON LOAN FROM
THE BOBBY GOLDSBORO INSTITUTE--

582
00:23:43,967 --> 00:23:45,967
FROM THE SNIDE MUSEUM.

583
00:23:45,967 --> 00:23:48,333
[PROJECTOR IMITATION CONTINUES]

584
00:23:48,333 --> 00:23:51,200
HERE IN JOHNNY'S FUN LAB, HE CAN
MANIPULATE OBJECTS AT WILL

585
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:53,333
AND NO ONE DARES TO STOP HIM.

586
00:23:53,333 --> 00:23:56,767
JOHNNY CONCENTRATES HARD
TO MAKE THE HURTING STOP.

587
00:23:56,767 --> 00:24:01,933
HERE'S BLUE DIRECTOR 4,
DR. TODD AMBROSIUS,
JOHNNY'S REAL DAD.

588
00:24:01,933 --> 00:24:04,500
UH-OH, TIME FOR
A HEART-TO-HEART, JOHNNY.

589
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:07,567
YOU SEE, IT'S ALL BECAUSE
JOHNNY DOESN'T CARE.

590
00:24:07,567 --> 00:24:09,300
DO YOU CARE?

591
00:24:09,300 --> 00:24:13,533
BECAUSE A MIND LIKE JOHNNY'S
IS A TERRIBLE THING TO UNLEASH.

592
00:24:13,533 --> 00:24:16,033
I'M TOM SERVO ANNOUNCING
FOR BELL LABORATORIES.

593
00:24:16,033 --> 00:24:18,467
GOOD NIGHT AND COMMERCIAL SIGN--
[CLICK]

594
00:24:18,467 --> 00:24:21,567
♪♪

595
00:24:24,667 --> 00:24:26,300
WHAT DO WE DO?!

596
00:24:26,300 --> 00:24:27,667
THEY'RE ALL AROUND THE HOUSE!

597
00:24:27,667 --> 00:24:29,500
THERE'S A BACK DOOR THERE!

598
00:24:29,500 --> 00:24:30,500
THANK YOU.

599
00:24:30,500 --> 00:24:31,733
THAT WAS FUN, HUH?

600
00:24:31,733 --> 00:24:32,900
NOW WE KNOW
WHY JOHNNY DOESN'T CARE.

601
00:24:32,900 --> 00:24:34,000
THERE'S A KNIFE! HURRY!

602
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:35,000
OOH, THEY SAVED THE SHOES.

603
00:24:35,000 --> 00:24:36,067
"WHAT DID THEY WANT?"

604
00:24:36,067 --> 00:24:37,533
[STACCATO MUSIC]

605
00:24:37,533 --> 00:24:38,933
♪ TRADITION... ♪

606
00:24:38,933 --> 00:24:41,833
TRADITION!

607
00:24:41,833 --> 00:24:46,967
AFTER THEM, AFTER THEM!

608
00:24:49,933 --> 00:24:52,467
NO, NO, FORGET THE BEACH CHAIR,
YOU'RE IN A HURRY!

609
00:24:52,467 --> 00:24:54,333
[GASPS]

610
00:24:54,333 --> 00:24:57,333
[APES MUTTERING]

611
00:24:57,333 --> 00:24:58,333
STATUTE OF LIMITATIONS.

612
00:24:58,333 --> 00:24:59,333
IT LOOKS LIKE THEY'RE SCARED.

613
00:24:59,333 --> 00:25:01,900
YES, YOU'RE RIGHT.

614
00:25:01,900 --> 00:25:03,533
PICASSO?!

615
00:25:03,533 --> 00:25:06,667
[APES MUTTERING NERVOUSLY]

616
00:25:06,667 --> 00:25:08,667
THEY'RE AFRAID OF THAT SHRINE!

617
00:25:08,667 --> 00:25:10,433
THEY'RE AFRAID OF TRIPE?

618
00:25:10,433 --> 00:25:11,767
NO, "SHRINE," SHRINE.

619
00:25:11,767 --> 00:25:13,967
OH.

620
00:25:13,967 --> 00:25:15,900
LOOKS LIKE TRIPE THOUGH,
DOESN'T IT?

621
00:25:15,900 --> 00:25:18,733
COME ON, RUN, TRY AND MOVE
FASTER THAN THE PLOT.

622
00:25:18,733 --> 00:25:22,900
[APES EXCLAIMING FEARFULLY]

623
00:25:22,900 --> 00:25:24,467
[PHONE RINGING]

624
00:25:24,467 --> 00:25:25,967
HEY, THE CHEESE PHONE
IS RINGING.

625
00:25:25,967 --> 00:25:27,833
YES, MR. COLBY.

626
00:25:27,833 --> 00:25:28,833
MEMBER ON LINE 2.

627
00:25:28,833 --> 00:25:30,067
IT'S ME-- GEBAR.

628
00:25:30,067 --> 00:25:31,633
WHAT'S THAT?

629
00:25:31,633 --> 00:25:34,233
THEY WENT TOWARDS
GREEN MOUNTAIN?

630
00:25:34,233 --> 00:25:36,567
VERY WELL, I'LL BE RIGHT THERE.

631
00:25:36,567 --> 00:25:39,300
OSCAR WILDE? HMM?

632
00:25:39,300 --> 00:25:41,500
DON'T WORRY, SIR,
THEY'LL BE CAUGHT SOON.

633
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:44,267
THIS IS A VERY SERIOUS
SITUATION.

634
00:25:44,267 --> 00:25:46,233
THEY MUST NEVER BE ALLOWED
TO CROSS THE BORDER

635
00:25:46,233 --> 00:25:47,433
AND ENTER GREEN MOUNTAIN!

636
00:25:47,433 --> 00:25:49,767
SMOKING A CIGAR...

637
00:25:49,767 --> 00:25:52,167
WE MUST CALL OUT ALL OUR TROOPS.

638
00:25:52,167 --> 00:25:53,500
WAS THAT BONZO THE MAGICIAN?

639
00:25:53,500 --> 00:25:55,533
I'LL GET THEM BEFORE THEY
REACH THE FRONTIER.

640
00:25:55,533 --> 00:25:57,700
"UH, GIVE ME DAVY CROCKET,
KING OF THE WILD FRONTIER--
THANK YOU."

641
00:25:57,700 --> 00:25:59,733
THIS IS THE DISTRICT LEADER.

642
00:25:59,733 --> 00:26:01,600
WE MUST HAVE REINFORCEMENTS.

643
00:26:01,600 --> 00:26:03,967
"I RESENT HIM."

644
00:26:03,967 --> 00:26:05,633
OH, JOHNNY, ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

645
00:26:05,633 --> 00:26:06,800
"I DON'T CARE."

646
00:26:06,800 --> 00:26:08,033
WE MUST KEEP GOING!

647
00:26:08,033 --> 00:26:12,067
♪ I CANNOT STAY,
I MUST BE GOING... ♪

648
00:26:12,067 --> 00:26:14,700
[BIRDS SCREECHING]

649
00:26:14,700 --> 00:26:19,000
♪ 99 BANANA DAIQUIRIS ON
THE WALL, 99 BANANA DAIQUIRIS ♪

650
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:21,967
[HUMMING TUNE]

651
00:26:21,967 --> 00:26:24,967
HOLD IT!

652
00:26:24,967 --> 00:26:28,300
HO, HO, HO, HOLD THE BUS!

653
00:26:28,300 --> 00:26:31,167
IT'S THE BANANA SPLITS SHOW!

654
00:26:31,167 --> 00:26:36,767
FLEEGLE, DREEGLE,
DROOPER AND SNORK!

655
00:26:36,767 --> 00:26:38,900
ABOUT FACE!

656
00:26:38,900 --> 00:26:41,067
"UH-OH, IT'S PRINCE!

657
00:26:41,067 --> 00:26:43,600
HIS ROYAL PURPLENESS!"

658
00:26:43,600 --> 00:26:45,800
THOSE INVADERS MUST BE CAUGHT!

659
00:26:45,800 --> 00:26:49,733
AND THIS TIME YOU MUSTN'T
LET THEM GET AWAY OR I'LL
HAVE YOU ALL SHOT!

660
00:26:49,733 --> 00:26:51,233
IT IS PRINCE.

661
00:26:51,233 --> 00:26:54,033
WE UNDERSTAND, SIR, BUT NO ONE
WANTS TO GO INTO GREEN MOUNTAIN.

662
00:26:54,033 --> 00:26:55,567
YOU COWARDS!

663
00:26:55,567 --> 00:26:58,400
THOSE INVADERS MUST NEVER BE
ALLOWED TO CROSS THE BORDER

664
00:26:58,400 --> 00:27:00,233
INTO GREEN MOUNTAIN-- GET GOING!

665
00:27:00,233 --> 00:27:01,800
YES, SIR! FORWARD!

666
00:27:01,800 --> 00:27:03,467
AND GET THEM!

667
00:27:03,467 --> 00:27:05,300
"A BIRTHDAY PRESENT--
I LIKE THEM."

668
00:27:09,533 --> 00:27:11,933
RUN THROUGH THE JUNGLE.

669
00:27:11,933 --> 00:27:14,100
[GASPS]

670
00:27:14,100 --> 00:27:15,367
BARBED-WIRE FENCES!

671
00:27:15,367 --> 00:27:17,133
"I DON'T CARE."

672
00:27:17,133 --> 00:27:18,133
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

673
00:27:18,133 --> 00:27:24,000
[IMITATING MUSIC]

674
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:25,767
GREEN MOUNTAIN.

675
00:27:25,767 --> 00:27:27,833
WHOA, HIGH-GRADE WEED!

676
00:27:27,833 --> 00:27:29,667
- COOL! SINSE!
- OOH!

677
00:27:29,667 --> 00:27:31,700
WE CAN'T STAY HERE LIKE THIS.

678
00:27:31,700 --> 00:27:33,533
I WONDER WHY THE FENCE IS HERE.

679
00:27:33,533 --> 00:27:35,167
THERE MUST BE A WAY AROUND.

680
00:27:35,167 --> 00:27:36,833
TO MAKE GOOD NEIGHBORS.

681
00:27:36,833 --> 00:27:40,600
"OKAY, SIZE, PLACE, GET A BUDDY!
PAIR OFF."

682
00:27:40,600 --> 00:27:42,767
"LET'S DIG TO CHINA."

683
00:27:42,767 --> 00:27:43,967
THEY'RE GETTING CLOSE!

684
00:27:43,967 --> 00:27:45,067
"I FOUND A TRUFFLE!"

685
00:27:45,067 --> 00:27:47,667
GO ON, HURRY THROUGH!

686
00:27:47,667 --> 00:27:49,367
GO ON AND KEEP YOUR HEAD DOWN--

687
00:27:49,367 --> 00:27:53,467
"IN SHAME."

688
00:27:53,467 --> 00:27:55,567
THEY WENT THATAWAY.

689
00:27:55,567 --> 00:27:57,933
[CREAKING]
[ CATHERINE GASPS]

690
00:27:57,933 --> 00:27:59,867
JOHNNY, WATCH OUT!

691
00:27:59,867 --> 00:28:05,300
"I DON'T CARE, I DON'T CARE,
I DON'T CARE, I DON'T CARE,
I DON'T CARE!"

692
00:28:05,300 --> 00:28:07,133
BET YOU CARE NOW, DON'T YA?

693
00:28:07,133 --> 00:28:08,400
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT, JOHNNY?

694
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:09,600
YOU'RE NOT HURT?

695
00:28:09,600 --> 00:28:11,633
IT'S SOME KIND OF A TRAP.

696
00:28:11,633 --> 00:28:14,700
IT'S DESIGNED TO KILL
ANYONE WHO ENTERS HERE.

697
00:28:14,700 --> 00:28:15,733
NO...

698
00:28:15,733 --> 00:28:16,967
[LEAVES RUSTLING]

699
00:28:16,967 --> 00:28:18,133
OH, OH, THE TREE'S
HAVING A SEIZURE!

700
00:28:18,133 --> 00:28:19,567
AH-CHOO!

701
00:28:19,567 --> 00:28:21,233
COME ON!

702
00:28:21,233 --> 00:28:26,333
"RAGWEED-- AAH...!"

703
00:28:34,833 --> 00:28:35,833
OOP, SAW THAT COMING.

704
00:28:35,833 --> 00:28:39,100
"OOH, FRESH COCONUTS, AAH...!"

705
00:28:39,100 --> 00:28:41,067
OH, THEY GOT A LOVELY BUNCH.

706
00:28:41,067 --> 00:28:42,233
"I'M ALLERGIC TO IT."

707
00:28:42,233 --> 00:28:43,333
OH, CATHERINE...!

708
00:28:43,333 --> 00:28:44,467
YOU MUSTN'T CRY.

709
00:28:44,467 --> 00:28:45,800
WITH THIS KNIFE,
I'M NOT SCARED OF ANYONE.

710
00:28:45,800 --> 00:28:47,333
WELL, YOU'RE DUMBER
THAN THOSE ROCKS, KID.

711
00:28:47,333 --> 00:28:49,233
HURRY, HURRY!

712
00:28:49,233 --> 00:28:50,800
DON'T LEAVE ME!

713
00:28:50,800 --> 00:28:51,800
[WHOOSH]

714
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:53,633
HELP ME, HELP ME, CATHERINE!

715
00:28:53,633 --> 00:28:54,900
OH, NOW THAT'S FUN.

716
00:28:54,900 --> 00:28:56,267
CAROLINE!

717
00:28:56,267 --> 00:28:57,433
HELP, HELP!

718
00:28:57,433 --> 00:28:58,567
IN THE BAG.

719
00:28:58,567 --> 00:28:59,633
STAY CALM, CAROLINE.

720
00:28:59,633 --> 00:29:02,700
I'LL CLIMB UP AND GET YOU!

721
00:29:02,700 --> 00:29:07,333
HEY, I GOT A GREAT, KOOKY IDEA:
LET'S PRETEND SHE'S A PIÑATA.

722
00:29:07,333 --> 00:29:10,400
OLÉ!

723
00:29:10,400 --> 00:29:12,200
YOU'LL BE ALL RIGHT!

724
00:29:12,200 --> 00:29:16,867
OR NOT.

725
00:29:16,867 --> 00:29:18,033
A LITTLE MORE!

726
00:29:18,033 --> 00:29:21,233
[TWIG SNAPS, CATHERINE GASPS]

727
00:29:21,233 --> 00:29:22,933
HUH?

728
00:29:22,933 --> 00:29:25,800
STEVEN SEAGAL
IN "SHOOT THE MONKEY."

729
00:29:25,800 --> 00:29:28,400
OH...

730
00:29:28,400 --> 00:29:29,567
CATHERINE!

731
00:29:29,567 --> 00:29:31,467
"WHAT? WHAT?"

732
00:29:31,467 --> 00:29:32,567
IT'S MIKE NESMITH!

733
00:29:32,567 --> 00:29:33,900
HE WAS A MONKEE, TRUE.

734
00:29:33,900 --> 00:29:35,667
[RUMBLING DRAMATIC MUSIC]

735
00:29:35,667 --> 00:29:37,500
THAT'S ME ON THE BASS THERE.

736
00:29:37,500 --> 00:29:40,867
"NICE... GUN."

737
00:29:40,867 --> 00:29:43,933
YOU'RE HUMAN, AREN'T YOU?

738
00:29:43,933 --> 00:29:45,333
SHE'S VERY DISCRIMINATING.

739
00:29:45,333 --> 00:29:47,833
YOU ARE-- A HUMAN?

740
00:29:47,833 --> 00:29:49,333
ARE YOU A HUMAN?

741
00:29:49,333 --> 00:29:52,200
YES, I AM-- WE ALL ARE.

742
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:54,367
"AND WE'RE LITTLE KIDS!"

743
00:30:00,233 --> 00:30:03,567
HEY, JUST LIKE ED AMES
ON "THE TONIGHT SHOW."

744
00:30:03,567 --> 00:30:06,733
CATHERINE!

745
00:30:06,733 --> 00:30:09,400
♪♪

746
00:30:09,400 --> 00:30:11,700
WE MET A NICE GUY AT LAST.

747
00:30:11,700 --> 00:30:14,167
THE APES AREN'T THE ONLY ONES
HERE, RIGHT, CATHERINE?

748
00:30:14,167 --> 00:30:15,900
"DAMN, WE GOT US A FAMILY!"

749
00:30:15,900 --> 00:30:17,067
--AFRAID TO FOLLOW US HERE.

750
00:30:17,067 --> 00:30:19,300
I GOT IT--
THE APES DIDN'T SET THE TRAPS.

751
00:30:19,300 --> 00:30:20,800
HE DID IT-- DIDN'T YOU?

752
00:30:20,800 --> 00:30:22,100
"MAYBE."

753
00:30:22,100 --> 00:30:23,467
HOW DID YOU GET TO THIS COUNTRY?

754
00:30:23,467 --> 00:30:24,800
"OUR MOM DROPPED US OFF."

755
00:30:24,800 --> 00:30:27,767
WELL, UH, YOU SEE--

756
00:30:27,767 --> 00:30:32,000
OH, I HAVE SO MANY THINGS
TO ASK YOU.

757
00:30:32,000 --> 00:30:34,133
WE CAME HERE
IN A VERY STRANGE WAY.

758
00:30:34,133 --> 00:30:35,167
"BY REFRIGERATOR."

759
00:30:35,167 --> 00:30:37,133
WHERE ARE WE?
WHAT IS THIS PLACE?

760
00:30:37,133 --> 00:30:38,233
"LOVE ME!"

761
00:30:38,233 --> 00:30:40,300
YOU'RE ON GREEN MOUNTAIN.

762
00:30:40,300 --> 00:30:42,567
THIS IS GREEN MOUNTAIN?

763
00:30:42,567 --> 00:30:46,233
"ARE YOU A HATFIELD OR A McCOY?"

764
00:30:46,233 --> 00:30:48,033
HAVE YOU FOUND THEM?

765
00:30:48,033 --> 00:30:50,100
NOT A TRACE.

766
00:30:50,100 --> 00:30:51,767
THIS WAY-- THEY MUST BE NEAR.

767
00:30:51,767 --> 00:30:53,733
"LET'S CRAP IN OUR HANDS
AND THROW IT AT PEOPLE.

768
00:30:53,733 --> 00:30:57,367
IT DOESN'T MATTER HOW YOU
EVOLVE, IT'S STILL DAMN FUNNY."

769
00:30:57,367 --> 00:30:58,533
LOOK!

770
00:30:58,533 --> 00:31:01,000
"THERE'S SOME NOW."

771
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:04,033
HEADQUARTERS, HEADQUARTERS.

772
00:31:04,033 --> 00:31:06,500
THIS IS POLICE CHIEF GEBAR--
WHAT IS IT?

773
00:31:06,500 --> 00:31:08,967
- "I CAN'T MOVE MY LIPS!"
- THE BARBED WIRE HAS BEEN CUT!

774
00:31:08,967 --> 00:31:10,667
THEY MUST HAVE
CROSSED THE BORDER!

775
00:31:10,667 --> 00:31:12,733
- IDIOTS!
- "WHO HIRED THEM?"

776
00:31:12,733 --> 00:31:14,767
HOW DID THEY GET AWAY FROM YOU?

777
00:31:14,767 --> 00:31:17,367
THIS MEANS THEY'LL JOIN FORCES
WITH GODO!

778
00:31:17,367 --> 00:31:18,367
GO-GO?

779
00:31:18,367 --> 00:31:19,367
YOU MUST FIND THEM!

780
00:31:19,367 --> 00:31:21,267
GORDO?

781
00:31:21,267 --> 00:31:23,500
"WELL, IT'S NOT MUCH,
BUT IT'S CLOSE TO THE BUS LINES

782
00:31:23,500 --> 00:31:27,633
AND I KINDA LIVE HERE
DURING THE OFF YEARS."

783
00:31:27,633 --> 00:31:30,900
"YOU CAN MAKE FIRE?"

784
00:31:30,900 --> 00:31:32,033
OH...

785
00:31:32,033 --> 00:31:33,267
IS THIS WHERE YOU LIVE?

786
00:31:33,267 --> 00:31:35,167
"NO, IT'S MY SUMMER HOME--
WHAT DO YOU THINK?"

787
00:31:35,167 --> 00:31:36,400
I WAS BORN HERE.

788
00:31:36,400 --> 00:31:37,733
GEEZ.

789
00:31:37,733 --> 00:31:41,700
OH-- DO YOU, DO YOU LIVE HERE
WITH YOUR PARENTS?

790
00:31:41,700 --> 00:31:44,000
"NO, THEY'RE DEAD--
DEAD, DEAD!"

791
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:46,567
NO-- THEY DIED A LONG TIME AGO.

792
00:31:46,567 --> 00:31:48,000
OH, YOU'RE RIGHT.

793
00:31:48,000 --> 00:31:49,533
YOU LIVED HERE ALL ALONE?

794
00:31:49,533 --> 00:31:51,867
THEN YOU HAD NO ONE TO LOOK
AFTER YOU WHEN YOU WERE SICK.

795
00:31:51,867 --> 00:31:55,000
"OH, RUB IT IN, KID."

796
00:31:55,000 --> 00:31:57,933
THEN WHY DON'T YOU JOIN US?

797
00:31:57,933 --> 00:31:59,267
LEAVE THE MOUNTAIN WITH US.

798
00:31:59,267 --> 00:32:00,967
- "JOIN US..."
- NO, IT'S MUCH SAFER HERE.

799
00:32:00,967 --> 00:32:02,467
"JOIN US..."

800
00:32:02,467 --> 00:32:03,467
AND THIS IS MY HOME.

801
00:32:03,467 --> 00:32:04,467
COME WITH US.

802
00:32:04,467 --> 00:32:05,567
LOOK, WATER!

803
00:32:05,567 --> 00:32:06,867
JOHNNY!

804
00:32:06,867 --> 00:32:08,167
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

805
00:32:08,167 --> 00:32:11,933
THAT JOHNNY
IS A WALKING FAUX PAS.

806
00:32:11,933 --> 00:32:15,333
"GULP, GULP-- BURP."

807
00:32:15,333 --> 00:32:17,833
MMM, TASTES GOOD-- HERE.

808
00:32:17,833 --> 00:32:19,133
MY NAME IS JOHNNY.

809
00:32:19,133 --> 00:32:22,133
"YEAH, LIKE I CARE--
WHO'S YOUR SISTER?"

810
00:32:22,133 --> 00:32:24,500
THIS IS CATHERINE,
SHE WORKS WITH MY UNCLE.

811
00:32:24,500 --> 00:32:26,467
"AS A GEISHA."

812
00:32:26,467 --> 00:32:28,800
AND THIS IS MY SISTER CAROLINE.

813
00:32:28,800 --> 00:32:30,567
"SHE'LL DRINK ANYTHING."

814
00:32:30,567 --> 00:32:32,800
MY NAME IS GODO.

815
00:32:32,800 --> 00:32:34,567
GODO?
A FUNNY NAME.

816
00:32:34,567 --> 00:32:35,733
"YEAH? WELL, BITE ME, KID."

817
00:32:35,733 --> 00:32:38,700
ALL THE APES SEEM TO BE
AFRAID OF YOU.

818
00:32:38,700 --> 00:32:41,700
GODO, I WAS JUST THINKING.

819
00:32:41,700 --> 00:32:43,433
IF YOU SAY
THAT YOU WERE BORN HERE,

820
00:32:43,433 --> 00:32:46,067
THEN THIS COUNTRY IS NOT
INHABITED ONLY BY APES.

821
00:32:46,067 --> 00:32:47,567
"WELL, THERE'S ME TOO."

822
00:32:47,567 --> 00:32:49,833
AND THERE MUST BE OTHER HUMANS
HERE NEAR THE MOUNTAIN,

823
00:32:49,833 --> 00:32:51,233
DON'T YOU THINK SO?

824
00:32:51,233 --> 00:32:53,600
UM, I DON'T KNOW.

825
00:32:53,600 --> 00:32:55,800
DON'T YOU REMEMBER
ANY OTHER PEOPLE LIVING HERE?

826
00:32:55,800 --> 00:33:01,567
"SHOULD I SHAVE MY MUSTACHE?"

827
00:33:01,567 --> 00:33:02,567
SOME BOOMBAS.

828
00:33:02,567 --> 00:33:04,233
BOOMBOX?

829
00:33:04,233 --> 00:33:06,533
WHAT DID YOU SAY?

830
00:33:06,533 --> 00:33:08,367
I DON'T REMEMBER.

831
00:33:08,367 --> 00:33:10,000
OH, NO SHORT-TERM MEMORY, HUH?

832
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:12,933
I THINK WE OUGHT TO TAKE CARE
OF CAROLINE'S WOUND.

833
00:33:12,933 --> 00:33:14,133
"SHE DOESN'T HAVE ONE"

834
00:33:14,133 --> 00:33:16,700
"WELL, LET'S GIVE HER ONE."

835
00:33:16,700 --> 00:33:18,100
THOSE CLOTHES ARE VERY TORN.

836
00:33:18,100 --> 00:33:19,933
"THEY'RE GOING TO HAVE TO
COME OFF."

837
00:33:19,933 --> 00:33:22,533
[SNICKERING]

838
00:33:22,533 --> 00:33:24,533
WE HAVE TO FIND
SOMETHING FOR YOU.

839
00:33:24,533 --> 00:33:26,833
I'LL LOOK AROUND.

840
00:33:26,833 --> 00:33:29,533
♪♪

841
00:33:32,467 --> 00:33:34,933
FASTER, FASTER, GO ON!

842
00:33:34,933 --> 00:33:36,967
GO ON OR I'LL KILL YOU!

843
00:33:36,967 --> 00:33:39,367
OH, THERE GOES SHERIFF LOBO!

844
00:33:39,367 --> 00:33:41,067
[GOOFY LAUGHTER]

845
00:33:41,067 --> 00:33:42,900
RIGHT ON HIS HEAD.

846
00:33:42,900 --> 00:33:44,767
FORWARD! I SAID FORWARD!
YOU COWARDS!

847
00:33:44,767 --> 00:33:47,433
"UH, COULD YOU TAKE
A LITTLE OFF THE SIDES,

848
00:33:47,433 --> 00:33:49,467
LIKE WHAT HE'S GOT, YEAH."

849
00:33:49,467 --> 00:33:50,833
"MORE, MORE-- THANK YOU, SIR."

850
00:33:50,833 --> 00:33:52,833
THAT'LL TEACH YOU TO DISOBEY ME!

851
00:33:52,833 --> 00:33:55,133
IS THERE ANYONE ELSE WHO REFUSES
TO FOLLOW MY ORDERS?

852
00:33:55,133 --> 00:33:58,133
"YOO-HOO DOWN HERE-- I NEED
SOME DISCIPLINE-- YOO-HOO!

853
00:33:58,133 --> 00:34:00,267
NUTS, HE DIDN'T HEAR ME."

854
00:34:00,267 --> 00:34:02,733
FASTER, FASTER!

855
00:34:02,733 --> 00:34:05,100
HEY, STEVE TYLER FROM AEROSMITH.

856
00:34:05,100 --> 00:34:06,333
LOOK, THERE HE IS.

857
00:34:06,333 --> 00:34:08,333
COME ON!

858
00:34:08,333 --> 00:34:10,933
"BRING ALONG THOSE
FURNACE DOORS BACK THERE."

859
00:34:10,933 --> 00:34:15,867
"MAN, IT'S STARTING TO SMELL
LIKE A ZOO AROUND HERE!"

860
00:34:15,867 --> 00:34:17,100
WHY ARE YOU STOPPING?

861
00:34:17,100 --> 00:34:18,100
KEEP GOING, KEEP GOING!

862
00:34:18,100 --> 00:34:19,500
UH, YES, SIR.

863
00:34:19,500 --> 00:34:21,500
"S-SORRY, SARGE."

864
00:34:21,500 --> 00:34:22,667
YOU, THAT WAY!

865
00:34:22,667 --> 00:34:24,533
THE OTHERS FOLLOW ME!

866
00:34:24,533 --> 00:34:25,700
"I WANT A TASTE OF THAT WHIP."

867
00:34:25,700 --> 00:34:28,400
OH, THE MIME IS BACK.

868
00:34:28,400 --> 00:34:31,500
OH, GREAT,
IT'S A PLANET OF OWLS.

869
00:34:31,500 --> 00:34:33,033
AND THEY ARE NOT WHAT THEY SEEM.

870
00:34:33,033 --> 00:34:34,567
- MM-MM.
- GET IT?

871
00:34:34,567 --> 00:34:37,800
I HEARD ONE CALL MY NAME.

872
00:34:37,800 --> 00:34:39,367
EDDIE MUNSTER!

873
00:34:39,367 --> 00:34:41,867
YEAH!

874
00:34:41,867 --> 00:34:43,200
"THE INVADERS," IN COLOR.

875
00:34:43,200 --> 00:34:46,567
HMM? WHAT THE HECK WAS THAT?

876
00:34:46,567 --> 00:34:48,700
"CORN DODGERS! I LOVE 'EM!"

877
00:34:48,700 --> 00:34:51,733
[CHUCKLING]
"WHAT A PIG!"

878
00:34:53,867 --> 00:34:55,900
IT'S DELICIOUS, ISN'T IT?

879
00:34:55,900 --> 00:34:59,300
[BURP]
"YUP!"

880
00:34:59,300 --> 00:35:00,733
STRANGE FOOD.

881
00:35:00,733 --> 00:35:02,633
YOU LIKE IT?

882
00:35:02,633 --> 00:35:05,467
OH, HE SHAVED
THE BACK OF HIS HANDS TOO.

883
00:35:05,467 --> 00:35:07,267
DO I LOOK MORE CIVILIZED NOW?

884
00:35:07,267 --> 00:35:09,800
"NO."

885
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:11,433
WHAT'S THIS--
IT'S A FUNNY-LOOKING VEGETABLE.

886
00:35:11,433 --> 00:35:13,167
YES.

887
00:35:13,167 --> 00:35:14,533
IT TASTES GOOD, HMM?

888
00:35:14,533 --> 00:35:16,600
IT TASTES LIKE MASHED POTATOES.

889
00:35:16,600 --> 00:35:21,033
[SARCASTIC LAUGHTER]

890
00:35:21,033 --> 00:35:23,167
WHAT IS IT, PEPE?

891
00:35:23,167 --> 00:35:25,767
GODO, THE APE TROOPS
ARE COMING HERE!

892
00:35:25,767 --> 00:35:27,433
THEY'VE SET FIRE
TO THE MOUNTAIN!

893
00:35:27,433 --> 00:35:28,500
WHAT?

894
00:35:28,500 --> 00:35:30,400
"OH, THAT'S GREAT, BUT--
WHO ARE YOU?!"

895
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:34,033
DON'T MOVE FROM HERE!

896
00:35:34,033 --> 00:35:37,100
[JOHNNY]
PEPE, WHAT IS GODO LIKE?

897
00:35:37,100 --> 00:35:39,833
HE'S STRONG AND VERY CLEVER.

898
00:35:39,833 --> 00:35:40,867
"AND A SNAPPY DRESSER."

899
00:35:40,867 --> 00:35:42,267
HOW DID YOU MAKE FRIENDS
WITH GODO?

900
00:35:42,267 --> 00:35:45,667
A LONG TIME AGO, I CAME
TO THIS MOUNTAIN JUST TO PLAY.

901
00:35:45,667 --> 00:35:50,200
THEN MY MOTHER CAME LOOKING FOR
ME BUT SHE WAS CAUGHT IN A TRAP.

902
00:35:50,200 --> 00:35:51,667
"AN OOEY-GOOEY SNAPPY TRAP."

903
00:35:51,667 --> 00:35:53,267
AND THEN GODO CAME
AND RESCUED YOU, RIGHT?

904
00:35:53,267 --> 00:35:56,100
YES, THAT'S WHY I LOVE GODO.

905
00:35:56,100 --> 00:35:58,567
"I LOVE HIM TOO,
MY LITTLE FRIEND."

906
00:35:58,567 --> 00:36:01,833
♪♪

907
00:36:01,833 --> 00:36:05,933
START ANOTHER FIRE THERE,
HURRY, HURRY!

908
00:36:05,933 --> 00:36:07,333
THERE'S GODO!

909
00:36:07,333 --> 00:36:08,833
KILL HIM, KILL HIM!

910
00:36:08,833 --> 00:36:11,500
GO, GO, GODO,
WATCH HIM GO, GO, GO.

911
00:36:11,500 --> 00:36:14,667
GODO, GODO, WATCH HIM
GO, GO, GO.

912
00:36:14,667 --> 00:36:18,800
NO, NO, GODO WILL KILL US--
NO, NO!

913
00:36:18,800 --> 00:36:21,433
KILL HIM! KILL HIM!

914
00:36:21,433 --> 00:36:23,133
HEY, YOU COULD KILL HIM
BY SHOOTING HIM.

915
00:36:23,133 --> 00:36:24,467
"USE THE GUNS!"

916
00:36:24,467 --> 00:36:26,133
KILL GODO!
SHOOT HIM, SHOOT HIM!

917
00:36:26,133 --> 00:36:28,600
FIRE!

918
00:36:28,600 --> 00:36:32,333
[DRAMATIC TRUMPET MUSIC]

919
00:36:32,333 --> 00:36:37,600
IT'S REALLY HARD TO DRAW A BEAD
THROUGH THOSE MASKS, YOU KNOW.

920
00:36:37,600 --> 00:36:40,800
THIS MUSIC SOUNDS LIKE IT'S FROM
"SKETCHES OF SPAIN."

921
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:42,833
OR "SKETCHES OF SPAM!"

922
00:36:42,833 --> 00:36:44,967
[CHUCKLING]

923
00:36:44,967 --> 00:36:46,733
[ALL COUGHING]

924
00:36:46,733 --> 00:36:49,833
[IMITATING ART FERN]
"OOH, THAT'S GOOD WEED--
MM-HMM... OH-HO!"

925
00:36:49,833 --> 00:36:51,900
THE SMOKE'S TOO THICK,
WE CAN'T STAY HERE!

926
00:36:51,900 --> 00:36:53,033
LET'S GO-- HURRY, HURRY!

927
00:36:53,033 --> 00:36:54,700
"OUT HERE WHERE THE PLOT
IS THINNER!"

928
00:36:54,700 --> 00:36:57,800
[GUNFIRE]

929
00:36:57,800 --> 00:37:02,167
NICOLAS CAGE IN "WILD AT HEART."

930
00:37:02,167 --> 00:37:04,433
GODO!

931
00:37:04,433 --> 00:37:06,600
GODO, HELP!

932
00:37:06,600 --> 00:37:08,067
GO TO HELL?

933
00:37:08,067 --> 00:37:10,200
HEY, HE FEEDS YOU,
HE TAKES YOU INTO HIS HOME

934
00:37:10,200 --> 00:37:11,200
AND THAT'S THE THANKS--

935
00:37:11,200 --> 00:37:12,567
NO, "GODO, HELP."

936
00:37:12,567 --> 00:37:14,533
--NEEDS YOUR HELP,
AND CATHERINE'S HURT TOO!

937
00:37:14,533 --> 00:37:19,567
[ALL IMITATE PANTING]

938
00:37:19,567 --> 00:37:22,167
CATHERINE, HOLD ON!

939
00:37:22,167 --> 00:37:25,733
OH, GODO, PEPE IS--
PEPE, DON'T MOVE!

940
00:37:25,733 --> 00:37:27,433
PEPE, DON'T BE A HERO!

941
00:37:27,433 --> 00:37:33,833
NO, DON'T COME HERE--
RUN, RUN-- AAH!

942
00:37:33,833 --> 00:37:36,233
PEPE! GODO!

943
00:37:36,233 --> 00:37:37,767
- GODO!
- PEPE!

944
00:37:37,767 --> 00:37:39,100
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

945
00:37:39,100 --> 00:37:41,533
- PEPE!
- GODO!

946
00:37:41,533 --> 00:37:43,100
HE'S A CRISPY CRITTER, KID.

947
00:37:43,100 --> 00:37:46,133
MM-HMM... IMAGINE WHAT THAT FUR
SMELLS LIKE BURNING?

948
00:37:46,133 --> 00:37:48,967
WHOO-HOO...

949
00:37:48,967 --> 00:37:50,600
"WOW, THERE WAS A BEAR
WITH RANGER HAT ON

950
00:37:50,600 --> 00:37:53,767
AND HE KEPT SCREAMING,
'ONLY YOU--'"

951
00:37:53,767 --> 00:37:55,300
PEPE!

952
00:37:55,300 --> 00:37:57,533
GIVE ME YOUR HAND!

953
00:37:57,533 --> 00:37:58,800
I'VE GOT IT!

954
00:37:58,800 --> 00:38:00,133
OOH, THAT'S NOT MY HAND!

955
00:38:00,133 --> 00:38:02,000
HEY, JOEL, HE'S GOT A MONKEY
ON HIS BACK.

956
00:38:02,000 --> 00:38:05,067
I HEAR YA, I HEAR YA...
[LAUGHTER]

957
00:38:05,067 --> 00:38:06,133
PEPE...

958
00:38:06,133 --> 00:38:08,767
HUH?

959
00:38:08,767 --> 00:38:12,300
[ALL GASP]

960
00:38:12,300 --> 00:38:13,800
OOPS.

961
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:17,033
THEY WORSHIP A GOOFY OWL?

962
00:38:17,033 --> 00:38:19,067
HALT!

963
00:38:19,067 --> 00:38:22,500
PRESENT-- ARMS!

964
00:38:22,500 --> 00:38:23,500
"CRAP IN-- HAND!"

965
00:38:23,500 --> 00:38:24,833
READY...

966
00:38:24,833 --> 00:38:28,600
[SNICKERING]
GODO, ARE YOU READY TO DIE?

967
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:29,600
"UH, FRANKLY, NO."

968
00:38:29,600 --> 00:38:31,033
[ALL GASP]

969
00:38:31,033 --> 00:38:34,833
"'TIS A FAR, FAR BETTER THING
I DO THAN I HAVE EVER DONE."

970
00:38:34,833 --> 00:38:37,167
AIM!

971
00:38:37,167 --> 00:38:40,400
UH-OH, IT'S THE PRODUCER...

972
00:38:40,400 --> 00:38:46,067
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK,
LIKES TO CRAP IN HIS HAND ♪♪

973
00:38:46,067 --> 00:38:48,067
OH, I HOPE HE DOESN'T SEE THIS.

974
00:38:48,067 --> 00:38:49,367
[TRUMPET FANFARE]

975
00:38:49,367 --> 00:38:50,600
ATTENTION!

976
00:38:50,600 --> 00:38:54,933
SOUNDS LIKE PRES'
AND HIS HORN SECTION THERE.

977
00:38:54,933 --> 00:38:57,400
YOUR EXCELLENCY.

978
00:38:57,400 --> 00:39:00,433
"COLONEL SANDERS,
WHAT HAPPENED?"

979
00:39:00,433 --> 00:39:01,833
"WELL, THERE WAS A GREASE FIRE,
YOU KNOW.

980
00:39:01,833 --> 00:39:04,000
I HAD A LITTLE TROUBLE
WITH THE FRIES THERE."

981
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:05,300
AND LOOK, HERE'S PETER NOONE!

982
00:39:05,300 --> 00:39:06,867
YOUR EXCELLENCY!

983
00:39:06,867 --> 00:39:08,567
POLICE CHIEF GEBAR'S
ACTING ON HIS OWN INITIATIVE.

984
00:39:08,567 --> 00:39:10,333
I TRIED TO STOP HIM,
I TRIED TO STOP HIM...

985
00:39:10,333 --> 00:39:13,467
"BUT HE WAS ALL OVER ME
LIKE UGLY ON AN APE!"

986
00:39:18,933 --> 00:39:20,500
RELEASE THEM!

987
00:39:20,500 --> 00:39:21,800
YES, YOUR EXCELLENCY!

988
00:39:21,800 --> 00:39:22,967
HEY, WHO'S THAT VECTOR
ON THE STAKE--

989
00:39:22,967 --> 00:39:26,467
JOHN OF ARC?

990
00:39:26,467 --> 00:39:28,733
YOUR EXCELLENCY,
YOUR EXCELLENCY,

991
00:39:28,733 --> 00:39:30,967
I REQUEST PERMISSION
TO KILL GODO!

992
00:39:30,967 --> 00:39:32,433
HE MUSTN'T BE ALLOWED
TO GO FREE!

993
00:39:32,433 --> 00:39:35,533
HE IS OUR ENEMY!

994
00:39:35,533 --> 00:39:38,100
"SO, THAT'S NO, THEN, HUH?"

995
00:39:43,567 --> 00:39:46,000
OOH...

996
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:50,167
"MONKEYS... I HATE 'EM... UH."

997
00:39:50,167 --> 00:39:51,733
GODO!

998
00:39:51,733 --> 00:39:52,967
JOHNNY!

999
00:39:52,967 --> 00:39:54,200
"I'VE MISSED YOU SO!"

1000
00:39:54,200 --> 00:39:56,433
GODO!

1001
00:39:56,433 --> 00:39:58,633
GODO, DON'T DIE!

1002
00:39:58,633 --> 00:39:59,733
"OKAY."

1003
00:40:03,767 --> 00:40:07,433
"YOU NEED TO WASH YOUR HANDS."

1004
00:40:07,433 --> 00:40:08,700
IT'S GAMERA!

1005
00:40:08,700 --> 00:40:10,300
OH, NO, NO, NO, NO...

1006
00:40:10,300 --> 00:40:12,267
NOT REALLY.

1007
00:40:12,267 --> 00:40:13,200
IT'S A KITCHEN LAMP.

1008
00:40:15,567 --> 00:40:20,833
JOHNNY!

1009
00:40:20,833 --> 00:40:23,000
PLEASE, HE'S JUST A LITTLE BOY!

1010
00:40:23,000 --> 00:40:24,133
"I KNOW."

1011
00:40:24,133 --> 00:40:25,767
OH, PLEASE, DON'T HURT HIM!

1012
00:40:25,767 --> 00:40:26,933
SILENCE!

1013
00:40:26,933 --> 00:40:30,267
"OF THE LAMBS."

1014
00:40:30,267 --> 00:40:31,500
TAKE HIM AWAY!

1015
00:40:31,500 --> 00:40:32,633
NO...

1016
00:40:32,633 --> 00:40:33,633
OSCAR WILDE?

1017
00:40:33,633 --> 00:40:34,933
TO HEADQUARTERS!

1018
00:40:34,933 --> 00:40:36,067
[GODO GROANS]

1019
00:40:36,067 --> 00:40:38,133
[IMITATES GROAN]

1020
00:40:43,600 --> 00:40:46,533
YOUR EXCELLENCY, YOUR
EXCELLENCY, YOU CAN'T DO THIS!

1021
00:40:46,533 --> 00:40:49,033
I HAVE FOUGHT AGAINST GODO
AT THE RISK OF MY LIFE!

1022
00:40:49,033 --> 00:40:51,100
NOW THAT WE HAVE HIM,
HE MUST BE PUNISHED!

1023
00:40:51,100 --> 00:40:54,400
I REQUEST YOUR PERMISSION
TO KILL HIM!

1024
00:40:54,400 --> 00:40:56,033
"ON THE OTHER HAND,
YOU'RE RIGHT OF COURSE.

1025
00:40:56,033 --> 00:40:58,133
CAN I HAVE A NEW DESK?"

1026
00:40:58,133 --> 00:40:59,533
YOUR EXCELLENCY!

1027
00:40:59,533 --> 00:41:01,600
SILENCE!

1028
00:41:01,600 --> 00:41:03,200
"OF THE LAMBS!"

1029
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:05,200
[LISPING]
IT PUTS THE LOTION
ON ITS SKIN...

1030
00:41:05,200 --> 00:41:07,167
[SIREN WAILING]

1031
00:41:07,167 --> 00:41:09,533
MEANWHILE, ON "C.H.I.M.P.S."--

1032
00:41:09,533 --> 00:41:11,767
[IMITATING SIREN]

1033
00:41:11,767 --> 00:41:15,233
HEY, IT'S A SHRINER.

1034
00:41:15,233 --> 00:41:18,933
"HEY, YOU KIDS BEHAVE
OR I'LL TURN THIS PLOT AROUND."

1035
00:41:18,933 --> 00:41:23,933
[GROANS]

1036
00:41:23,933 --> 00:41:26,567
"HEY, HE'S NOT HALF-BAD."

1037
00:41:26,567 --> 00:41:29,900
YOUR EXCELLENCY,
PLEASE LET THE CHILDREN GO--

1038
00:41:29,900 --> 00:41:31,267
JUST THE CHILDREN.

1039
00:41:31,267 --> 00:41:32,767
DO NOT BE AFRAID.

1040
00:41:32,767 --> 00:41:34,200
I WILL NOT HARM YOU.

1041
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:35,700
I DO NOT HURT INNOCENT PEOPLE.

1042
00:41:35,700 --> 00:41:36,967
"I HAVE ASSISTANTS FOR THAT."

1043
00:41:36,967 --> 00:41:39,833
BUT IF YOU CAUSE TROUBLE,
I WILL KILL YOU.

1044
00:41:39,833 --> 00:41:41,100
HAVE YOU UNDERSTOOD THAT?

1045
00:41:41,100 --> 00:41:43,100
"YOU WILL KILL ME!"

1046
00:41:43,100 --> 00:41:47,567
YES, YOUR EXCELLENCY.

1047
00:41:47,567 --> 00:41:49,800
"THIS BITES."

1048
00:41:49,800 --> 00:41:51,300
[GASPS]

1049
00:41:51,300 --> 00:41:53,000
CATHERINE!

1050
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:54,667
[GASPS]

1051
00:41:54,667 --> 00:41:57,833
BETHLEHEM... SORT OF.

1052
00:41:57,833 --> 00:42:00,267
[SIREN WAILING]

1053
00:42:00,267 --> 00:42:05,133
THE KING OF THE APES RIDES IN
STYLE IN THE NEW BUICK SKYLARK.

1054
00:42:05,133 --> 00:42:08,733
HE'S GOT A MONKEY BAR ON IT TOO.

1055
00:42:08,733 --> 00:42:13,733
UH-OH, DON'T LET THOSE RAMP APES
HANDLE YOUR LUGGAGE, GUYS.

1056
00:42:13,733 --> 00:42:15,767
ATTENTION!

1057
00:42:15,767 --> 00:42:18,200
"FLING... CRAP!"

1058
00:42:18,200 --> 00:42:21,767
OH, THEY'RE GONNA GIVE HIM
A 21-TURD SALUTE.

1059
00:42:21,767 --> 00:42:25,567
YOU KNOW, THEY MAY HAVE EVOLVED
BUT THEY STILL HAVE A LOUSY
PAINT JOB-- LOOK AT THAT.

1060
00:42:25,567 --> 00:42:27,933
LOOK AT THAT CAR.

1061
00:42:27,933 --> 00:42:29,633
GET OUT!

1062
00:42:29,633 --> 00:42:30,633
[FANFARE PLAYING]

1063
00:42:30,633 --> 00:42:36,767
[IMITATING FANFARE]

1064
00:42:36,767 --> 00:42:39,333
IT'S A MASONIC TEMPLE.

1065
00:42:39,333 --> 00:42:40,767
YEAH, WE GOT
A SPECIAL HANDSHAKE.

1066
00:42:40,767 --> 00:42:42,200
[GROANING]

1067
00:42:42,200 --> 00:42:44,933
OH, WE BETTER GO.

1068
00:42:44,933 --> 00:42:47,167
[SARCASTICALLY]
SURE WISH WE COULD
GO WITH YOU, GODO.

1069
00:42:47,167 --> 00:42:52,467
[ALL LAUGHING]

1070
00:42:52,467 --> 00:42:55,367
♪♪

1071
00:42:58,767 --> 00:43:00,100
[CLEARS THROAT]

1072
00:43:00,100 --> 00:43:02,133
HELLO, THIS IS
OUR DRAMATICIZED PAGEANT

1073
00:43:02,133 --> 00:43:05,400
OF THE SCOPES MONKEY TRIAL
PIVOTAL INTERPRETATION OF LAW

1074
00:43:05,400 --> 00:43:07,933
WHICH HAS A VERY THIN CONNECTION
TO TODAY'S FILM.

1075
00:43:07,933 --> 00:43:09,933
I'M YOUR HOST, F. LEE BAILEY.

1076
00:43:09,933 --> 00:43:12,567
SCENE ONE, 1925,
DAYTON, TENNESSEE.

1077
00:43:12,567 --> 00:43:15,500
JOHN SCOPES TAUGHT THE THEORY
OF EVOLUTION IN SCHOOL.

1078
00:43:15,500 --> 00:43:17,633
THIS WAS AGAINST STATE LAW.

1079
00:43:17,633 --> 00:43:19,933
MAN EVOLVED FROM APE.

1080
00:43:19,933 --> 00:43:21,267
[IRISH ACCENT]
ALL RIGHT, YOU'RE UNDER ARREST.

1081
00:43:21,267 --> 00:43:22,600
COME WITH ME,
TELL IT TO THE JUDGE.

1082
00:43:22,600 --> 00:43:24,100
THANK YOU VERY MUCH.

1083
00:43:24,100 --> 00:43:26,333
SCENE TWO,
A SWELTERING COURTROOM
SOMEWHERE IN TENNESSEE.

1084
00:43:26,333 --> 00:43:28,033
THE QUESTION BEFORE THE COURT:

1085
00:43:28,033 --> 00:43:31,233
DID MAN EVOLVE FROM APE
OR DID MAN COME FROM THE BIBLE?

1086
00:43:31,233 --> 00:43:35,200
THIS IS THE PLAINTIFF,
WILLIAM JENNINGS BRYAN,
PLAYED BY OUR OWN TOMMY SERVO.

1087
00:43:35,200 --> 00:43:37,433
NOTICE HIS RESEMBLANCE
TO FREDRIC MARCH.

1088
00:43:37,433 --> 00:43:38,567
[SOUTHERN ACCENT]
THANK YOU.

1089
00:43:38,567 --> 00:43:39,700
YOUR HONOR--

1090
00:43:39,700 --> 00:43:41,467
UM, HE'S NOT HERE YET.

1091
00:43:41,467 --> 00:43:43,767
REPRESENTING THE DEFENSE,
CLARENCE DARROW,

1092
00:43:43,767 --> 00:43:45,800
FICTIONALLY PLAYED
BY SPENCER TRACY,

1093
00:43:45,800 --> 00:43:48,033
RECREATED HERE BY CROW T. ROBOT.

1094
00:43:48,033 --> 00:43:49,867
UH, I OBJECT.

1095
00:43:49,867 --> 00:43:51,467
NOT YET.

1096
00:43:51,467 --> 00:43:55,000
UM, PLAYING THE PART OF
HONORABLE JUDGE HARRY MORGAN

1097
00:43:55,000 --> 00:43:59,033
WILL BE THIS CARDBOARD CUTOUT OF
JUDGE WAPNER WE GOT IN THE MAIL,

1098
00:43:59,033 --> 00:44:02,700
WITH THE VOICE OF ME,
F. LEE BAILEY.

1099
00:44:02,700 --> 00:44:04,567
[WHISPERS]
OKAY, GO.

1100
00:44:04,567 --> 00:44:08,367
NOW, WHAT'S ALL THIS
HORSE HOCKEY ABOUT MAN
EVOLVING FROM MONKEYS?

1101
00:44:08,367 --> 00:44:09,700
WELL, THEY DID.

1102
00:44:09,700 --> 00:44:11,100
UH, THE DEFENSE RESTS.

1103
00:44:11,100 --> 00:44:12,700
- THAT'S IT?
- YEAH.

1104
00:44:12,700 --> 00:44:14,933
WELL, THAT WAS
A VERY ELEGANT, ELOQUENT,

1105
00:44:14,933 --> 00:44:17,367
ALMOST OSCAR-WINNING
PERFORMANCE, MR. DARROW.

1106
00:44:17,367 --> 00:44:19,800
YOUR HONOR AND ESTEEMED
COLLEAGUES OF THE BAR--

1107
00:44:19,800 --> 00:44:21,500
- BORING, BORING.
- SHUT UP, CROW!

1108
00:44:21,500 --> 00:44:22,933
JOEL, TELL HIM TO STOP!

1109
00:44:22,933 --> 00:44:25,500
PERHAPS YOU OUGHT TO
CUT TO THE CHASE, COLONEL.

1110
00:44:25,500 --> 00:44:27,433
HEY, I WANNA BE A COLONEL TOO--
THAT SOUNDS NEAT.

1111
00:44:27,433 --> 00:44:30,800
COME ON, YOU GUYS,
YOU'RE GETTING MIRED
IN THE BORING SUBPLOT.

1112
00:44:30,800 --> 00:44:33,000
JOEL, JOEL,
WHERE'S THE DEFENDANT?

1113
00:44:33,000 --> 00:44:34,433
UH, SHE'S STILL CHANGING.

1114
00:44:34,433 --> 00:44:38,367
OH, FOR CRYING OUT--
OH, THERE SHE IS.

1115
00:44:38,367 --> 00:44:40,667
MAN EVOLVED FROM APE.

1116
00:44:40,667 --> 00:44:41,667
YEAH, BUT WHICH MAN?

1117
00:44:41,667 --> 00:44:43,000
YEAH, WHAT ABOUT WOMEN?

1118
00:44:43,000 --> 00:44:45,100
AND WHAT ABOUT
SCARECROW'S BRAIN?

1119
00:44:45,100 --> 00:44:47,567
UH, LET'S SNAP THIS UP, PEOPLE,
WE'RE STARTING TO LOSE 'EM.

1120
00:44:47,567 --> 00:44:50,533
I FIND THE PLAINTIFF,
MR. SCOPES, YOU'RE GUILTY.

1121
00:44:50,533 --> 00:44:53,100
THE FINE IS A THOUSAND--
A HUNDRED DOLLARS.

1122
00:44:53,100 --> 00:44:55,700
HAVE THIS STAMPED BY THE BURSAR.

1123
00:44:55,700 --> 00:44:56,700
SHYSTER!

1124
00:44:56,700 --> 00:44:58,000
HEY...

1125
00:44:58,000 --> 00:45:01,367
AND SO THE TRIAL ENDS
IN CONFUSION-- NEAT, HUH?

1126
00:45:01,367 --> 00:45:06,633
OH, AND WILLIAMS JAMES BRYANT
SUCCUMBED TO THE MORTAL STRAIN
AND DIED FIVE DAYS LATER.

1127
00:45:06,633 --> 00:45:08,700
ARGH... OH... OH!

1128
00:45:08,700 --> 00:45:10,333
CLARENCE DARROW WENT ON
TO GREATER THINGS

1129
00:45:10,333 --> 00:45:12,000
LIKE HIS ROLE IN "PAT AND MIKE"

1130
00:45:12,000 --> 00:45:16,000
AND THE STUNNING "IT'S A MAD,
MAD, MAD, MAD WORLD," THEN DIED.

1131
00:45:16,000 --> 00:45:18,667
ARGH-- OOP.

1132
00:45:18,667 --> 00:45:20,067
IF YOU WANT TO READ
MORE ABOUT IT,

1133
00:45:20,067 --> 00:45:22,733
ASK YOUR LIBRARIAN
FOR THE FOLLOWING BOOKS.

1134
00:45:22,733 --> 00:45:25,333
"PICTURE BOOK OF TENNESSEE,"

1135
00:45:25,333 --> 00:45:29,867
"WELCOME TO THE MONKEY HOUSE"
BY KURT VONNEGUT, JR.,

1136
00:45:29,867 --> 00:45:32,700
THE COMIC BOOK VERSION
OF "PLANET OF THE APES,"

1137
00:45:32,700 --> 00:45:35,100
AND "CURIOUS GEORGE
RIDES A BICYCLE."

1138
00:45:35,100 --> 00:45:37,300
[BUZZING]
WE HAVE MOVIE SIGN.

1139
00:45:37,300 --> 00:45:39,000
MOVIE SIGN!

1140
00:45:39,000 --> 00:45:40,400
OH...!

1141
00:45:40,400 --> 00:45:47,367
[CLANKING, WHIRRING,
CREAKING, WHOOSHING]

1142
00:45:48,433 --> 00:45:50,367
LET GO!

1143
00:45:53,600 --> 00:45:55,467
FLY, JUDGEY, FLY!

1144
00:45:55,467 --> 00:45:58,100
WHEE-- THERE HE GOES.

1145
00:45:58,100 --> 00:45:59,233
DOWN IN FRONT!

1146
00:45:59,233 --> 00:46:01,367
OOH!

1147
00:46:01,367 --> 00:46:03,700
NO ONE CAN ESCAPE
FROM THIS CELL.

1148
00:46:03,700 --> 00:46:05,433
"FROM NOW ON,
YOUR NAME IS ZIPPY."

1149
00:46:05,433 --> 00:46:06,700
[LAUGHING]

1150
00:46:06,700 --> 00:46:10,300
A LITTLE THUMB-IN-CHEEK
HUMOR THERE-- VERY LITTLE.

1151
00:46:10,300 --> 00:46:12,167
[GROANING]

1152
00:46:12,167 --> 00:46:16,033
"OOH, TOO MANY WHITE CASTLES
LAST NIGHT-- [RETCHING]."

1153
00:46:16,033 --> 00:46:17,900
AAH! A BUG ZAPPER!

1154
00:46:17,900 --> 00:46:20,333
I CHECKED IN
BUT I CAN'T CHECK OUT!

1155
00:46:22,600 --> 00:46:26,967
NOW GET IN THERE
AND TEST THAT LUGGAGE-- HA!

1156
00:46:26,967 --> 00:46:29,933
WHAT IS THIS,
"PLANET OF THE FOPS"?

1157
00:46:29,933 --> 00:46:33,467
NOW, REMEMBER-- IF YOU ARE GOOD,
NO HARM WILL COME TO YOU.

1158
00:46:33,467 --> 00:46:34,567
UNDERSTAND?

1159
00:46:34,567 --> 00:46:35,767
YES.

1160
00:46:35,767 --> 00:46:39,933
"MMM... MONKEY EATS."

1161
00:46:39,933 --> 00:46:45,100
"MMM-- REESE'S
PEANUT BUTTER-- OW!"

1162
00:46:45,100 --> 00:46:47,467
WE DO NOT EAT LIKE BARBARIANS.

1163
00:46:47,467 --> 00:46:50,233
YOU MUST SHOW RESPECT
FOR THE CUSTOMS OF OUR COUNTRY.

1164
00:46:50,233 --> 00:46:51,700
"REGURGITATE, THEN EAT."

1165
00:46:51,700 --> 00:46:53,833
FIRST YOU THANK THE GODS
BEFORE YOU SIT.

1166
00:46:53,833 --> 00:46:57,567
THEN YOU RAISE YOUR FOOD AND
EAT WITH DIGNITY, UNDERSTAND?

1167
00:46:57,567 --> 00:46:59,533
"THEN YOU DO THE HOKEY-POKEY
AND TURN YOURSELF AROUND.

1168
00:46:59,533 --> 00:47:01,167
"THAT'S WHAT IT'S ALL ABOUT.

1169
00:47:01,167 --> 00:47:03,800
I'M OUTTA HERE."

1170
00:47:03,800 --> 00:47:06,300
OH, THANK YOU, HANUMAN,
CAN WE EAT NOW?

1171
00:47:09,367 --> 00:47:12,167
"LET ME SEE
IF I'VE GOT THIS RIGHT.

1172
00:47:12,167 --> 00:47:15,333
YOU PUT YOUR RIGHT SHOE IN AND
YOUR LEFT SHOE OFF AND-- AW..."

1173
00:47:15,333 --> 00:47:17,167
OH, NO.

1174
00:47:17,167 --> 00:47:19,133
THAT NEVER WORKS.

1175
00:47:19,133 --> 00:47:21,067
[GROANS]

1176
00:47:21,067 --> 00:47:22,800
HEY, HE'S MAKING
LINOLEUM ANGELS.

1177
00:47:22,800 --> 00:47:25,867
♪♪

1178
00:47:25,867 --> 00:47:29,933
"TRICK OR TREAT FOR UNICEF."

1179
00:47:29,933 --> 00:47:33,200
THIS IS WHEN BEING A MONKEY
REALLY COMES IN HANDY.

1180
00:47:33,200 --> 00:47:35,100
ARE THOSE MONKEY BOYS JEANS
YOU'RE WEARING?

1181
00:47:35,100 --> 00:47:37,533
NO, HE SAT ON A CANDY BAR.

1182
00:47:37,533 --> 00:47:41,133
OH, GRATE. [CHUCKLES]

1183
00:47:41,133 --> 00:47:44,033
YOU KNOW, IT'S FUNNY
HOW FILM DIRECTORS

1184
00:47:44,033 --> 00:47:49,100
ALWAYS MAKE AIR VENTS
BIG ENOUGH TO CRAWL THROUGH.

1185
00:47:49,100 --> 00:47:50,800
YOU KNOW WHAT HE'S AFRAID OF?

1186
00:47:50,800 --> 00:47:54,300
HE'S AFRAID HE'S GONNA
RUN INTO DAVID HEDISON
GOING THE OTHER WAY.

1187
00:47:54,300 --> 00:47:56,533
JOHNNY, IT'S ME!

1188
00:47:56,533 --> 00:47:58,000
OH, PEPE!

1189
00:47:58,000 --> 00:48:01,267
"GIVE A HOOT, DON'T POLLUTE."

1190
00:48:01,267 --> 00:48:02,967
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

1191
00:48:02,967 --> 00:48:06,400
[IMITATING MUSIC]

1192
00:48:09,367 --> 00:48:12,900
JOHNNY--

1193
00:48:12,900 --> 00:48:16,433
"OH... OH, YEAH, YOU GOTTA
LAY OFF THE PANCAKES, KID."

1194
00:48:16,433 --> 00:48:18,367
OOH, HOT PANTS!

1195
00:48:18,367 --> 00:48:20,033
IS THERE A SCREWDRIVER?

1196
00:48:20,033 --> 00:48:21,400
NO, HOW ABOUT A BLOODY MARY?

1197
00:48:21,400 --> 00:48:23,400
HERE'S ONE.

1198
00:48:23,400 --> 00:48:25,067
OH, I GOT IT, PEPE.

1199
00:48:25,067 --> 00:48:26,733
I ALWAYS CARRY ONE.

1200
00:48:26,733 --> 00:48:30,733
OH, GREAT-- WELCOME TO
"PLOT CONVENIENCE PLAYHOUSE."

1201
00:48:30,733 --> 00:48:32,200
♪ POP MUSIC. ♪

1202
00:48:32,200 --> 00:48:34,567
NOW, IT'S RIGHTY-TIGHTY,
LEFTY-LOOSEY.

1203
00:48:34,567 --> 00:48:39,233
AW, LUCY, I NEED
A SCREWDRIVER, AAH...

1204
00:48:41,167 --> 00:48:43,700
OKAY, I CAN GET THROUGH.

1205
00:48:43,700 --> 00:48:46,533
BE CAREFUL NO ONE SEES YOU.

1206
00:48:46,533 --> 00:48:48,800
I'LL FIND GODO AND WE'LL
COME BACK FOR YOU.

1207
00:48:48,800 --> 00:48:52,067
"OH, JOHNNY, DO YOU
NEED TO BE CHANGED? WHEW..."

1208
00:48:52,067 --> 00:48:54,000
I CAN GET THROUGH TOO.

1209
00:48:54,000 --> 00:48:57,167
EVERYONE CAN GET THROUGH
EXCEPT FOR BULKY CATHERINE.

1210
00:48:57,167 --> 00:48:58,533
YOU'D BETTER STAY

1211
00:48:58,533 --> 00:49:00,767
AND YOU JUST PRETEND
I'M STILL INSIDE THE CELL.

1212
00:49:00,767 --> 00:49:01,967
IT'S MUCH SAFER.

1213
00:49:01,967 --> 00:49:03,367
"AND IT'S FUN TOO!"

1214
00:49:03,367 --> 00:49:04,600
"BYE-BYE, KEEP IN TOUCH!

1215
00:49:04,600 --> 00:49:06,900
SCREAM IF YOU GET KILLED."

1216
00:49:06,900 --> 00:49:09,467
TONIGHT ON "CRIME DOG"...

1217
00:49:09,467 --> 00:49:19,100
[PANTING AND GROWLING LIKE DOGS]

1218
00:49:19,100 --> 00:49:21,033
[BARKING]

1219
00:49:21,033 --> 00:49:23,500
DON'T STRAIN YOURSELF.

1220
00:49:23,500 --> 00:49:25,067
[LAUGHS]
THAT'S GREAT.

1221
00:49:25,067 --> 00:49:26,433
GODO!

1222
00:49:26,433 --> 00:49:29,633
"AM I ON A WALL? OH."

1223
00:49:29,633 --> 00:49:32,300
GODO!

1224
00:49:32,300 --> 00:49:34,833
NO, IT'S IMPOSSIBLE.

1225
00:49:34,833 --> 00:49:38,467
"NOT UNLESS I TURN MYSELF
INTO A BOILED POTATO."

1226
00:49:38,467 --> 00:49:41,633
VEG-O-MATIC ACTION.

1227
00:49:41,633 --> 00:49:43,433
OH...

1228
00:49:43,433 --> 00:49:47,600
FAR-OUT TRAILS, MAN... OOH...

1229
00:49:47,600 --> 00:49:51,800
♪ YOU CAN TELL BY THE WAY
I MOVE MY STUFF,

1230
00:49:51,800 --> 00:49:54,467
I'M A WOMAN'S APE,
NO TIME FOR TALK. ♪

1231
00:49:54,467 --> 00:49:58,733
♪ UNH-UNH-UNH-UNH,
STAYIN' ERECT, STAYIN' ERECT ♪

1232
00:49:58,733 --> 00:50:00,300
♪ UNH-UNH... ♪

1233
00:50:00,300 --> 00:50:02,933
HE LOOKS LIKE
TEDDY RUXPIN UP CLOSE.

1234
00:50:02,933 --> 00:50:06,000
"SIMIAN NIGHT FEVER."

1235
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:07,167
[GASPS]

1236
00:50:07,167 --> 00:50:09,367
OH, STUPID KID, DON'T DO THAT!

1237
00:50:09,367 --> 00:50:15,400
♪♪

1238
00:50:15,400 --> 00:50:17,600
"SO, YOU'VE BEEN
TO COST CUTTERS AGAIN."

1239
00:50:17,600 --> 00:50:21,867
GODO! AT LAST I HAVE
LIVED TO SEE THE DAY
WHEN I WILL KILL YOU.

1240
00:50:21,867 --> 00:50:23,267
WELL, IT'S NICE TO HAVE GOALS.

1241
00:50:23,267 --> 00:50:25,467
IT'S TAKEN A LONG TIME.

1242
00:50:25,467 --> 00:50:28,433
FOR YEARS I HAVE THOUGHT OF
THE PLEASURE IT WOULD GIVE ME.

1243
00:50:28,433 --> 00:50:30,700
"TO MOVE MY JAW."

1244
00:50:30,700 --> 00:50:32,500
[LAUGHS]

1245
00:50:32,500 --> 00:50:36,967
THIS TIME YOU WILL NOT
ESCAPE ME!

1246
00:50:36,967 --> 00:50:39,567
"THAT TRICK NEVER WORKS."

1247
00:50:39,567 --> 00:50:42,833
VERY WELL, DO JUST AS YOU LIKE.

1248
00:50:42,833 --> 00:50:44,533
I WANT TO ASK YOU ONE QUESTION.

1249
00:50:44,533 --> 00:50:46,233
"IS IT OKAY TO PET
ON THE FIRST DATE?"

1250
00:50:46,233 --> 00:50:47,233
WHAT'LL YOU DO WITH THOSE THREE?

1251
00:50:47,233 --> 00:50:48,367
I DON'T KNOW YET.

1252
00:50:48,367 --> 00:50:49,733
TAR? YOU'RE SOAKING IN IT.

1253
00:50:49,733 --> 00:50:54,067
LOOK AT THOSE HANDS.

1254
00:50:54,067 --> 00:50:56,200
KILL ME, IT DOESN'T MATTER.

1255
00:50:56,200 --> 00:50:58,367
JUST LET
THOSE THREE HUMANS ALONE.

1256
00:50:58,367 --> 00:51:02,367
"YOU CAN KILL ME, BUT IT'S
OVER MY DEAD BODY!"

1257
00:51:02,367 --> 00:51:05,733
"YOU KNOW, YOU STILL HAVE
SAUSAGE LINKS FOR FINGERS,
I DON'T CARE WHAT YOU DO."

1258
00:51:05,733 --> 00:51:07,400
LOOK, HE'S POINTING
A DUCK CALL AT HIM.

1259
00:51:07,400 --> 00:51:11,000
[IMITATES DUCK CALL]

1260
00:51:11,000 --> 00:51:13,833
[LAUGHING EVILLY]

1261
00:51:13,833 --> 00:51:16,033
[IMITATING LAUGHTER]

1262
00:51:16,033 --> 00:51:18,700
I'M ASKING YOU, LET THEM GO--
THEY ARE INNOCENT!

1263
00:51:18,700 --> 00:51:21,467
SILENCE!

1264
00:51:21,467 --> 00:51:23,333
WHA... WHA... WHA...

1265
00:51:23,333 --> 00:51:26,533
SUDDENLY THE FILM EDITOR
GOES FOR AN OSCAR.

1266
00:51:26,533 --> 00:51:28,800
[GRUNTING]

1267
00:51:28,800 --> 00:51:30,100
TRY PUNCHING HIM.

1268
00:51:30,100 --> 00:51:33,767
NO, HARDER.

1269
00:51:33,767 --> 00:51:39,067
OH, IT'S A GOOD THING
HE GOT THAT BOY OFF HIS BACK.

1270
00:51:41,733 --> 00:51:43,467
[GRUNTING]

1271
00:51:43,467 --> 00:51:46,267
"BEDTIME FOR BONZO!
COME ON, KIDS."

1272
00:51:46,267 --> 00:51:51,033
"UH, I NEED TO GET
A DRINK OF WATER, OKAY,
SO JUST WAIT THERE."

1273
00:51:51,033 --> 00:51:53,700
WHERE ARE THEY,
CAROLINE AND CATHERINE?

1274
00:51:53,700 --> 00:51:54,867
THIS WAY.

1275
00:51:59,600 --> 00:52:01,367
[DRAMATIC CYMBAL CRASH]

1276
00:52:01,367 --> 00:52:02,400
"HEY, WHO PLAYED THAT CYMBAL?!"

1277
00:52:02,400 --> 00:52:04,367
SOMEONE'S THERE!

1278
00:52:04,367 --> 00:52:07,933
"CAN JOHNNY COME OUT AND PLAY?"

1279
00:52:07,933 --> 00:52:09,433
[CHUCKLING]

1280
00:52:09,433 --> 00:52:11,833
OH... IT'S JUST A KID.

1281
00:52:11,833 --> 00:52:13,567
WHO ARE YOU?
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

1282
00:52:13,567 --> 00:52:15,300
"ARE YOU KNOWN FOR YOUR WORK
IN THE THEATER?"

1283
00:52:15,300 --> 00:52:19,033
[ALARM BURBLING]

1284
00:52:19,033 --> 00:52:21,167
GODO'S ESCAPED!
KILL HIM!

1285
00:52:21,167 --> 00:52:24,367
IT SOUNDS LIKE THE ALARM'S
UNDERWATER.

1286
00:52:24,367 --> 00:52:30,333
HEY, APES, I THINK
YOUR SPEAKER'S BLOWN--
IT'S THE WOOFER.

1287
00:52:30,333 --> 00:52:34,800
OH, I GET IT-- THEY'RE GONNA GO
CATCH THE "F" TRAIN.

1288
00:52:34,800 --> 00:52:38,733
[IMITATING BOUNCY MOVIE MUSIC]

1289
00:52:38,733 --> 00:52:40,167
GOIN' UPTOWN.

1290
00:52:40,167 --> 00:52:42,967
"WE'RE GONNA HIDE
IN THIS JIFFY LUBE STAND."

1291
00:52:42,967 --> 00:52:46,967
GODO HAS ESCAPED!
AFTER HIM! KILL HIM!

1292
00:52:46,967 --> 00:52:50,967
"OW, OW, OW, MY FINGERS!
OW, OOH, MY FINGERS, OOH!"

1293
00:52:50,967 --> 00:52:52,600
YOU FOOLS!

1294
00:52:52,600 --> 00:52:54,133
I TOLD YOU
TO BEHAVE YOURSELVES--

1295
00:52:54,133 --> 00:52:55,500
DIDN'T I TELL YOU THAT?

1296
00:52:55,500 --> 00:52:58,200
YES-- I'M VERY SORRY.

1297
00:52:58,200 --> 00:53:00,233
YOU WILL REGRET YOUR BEHAVIOR.

1298
00:53:00,233 --> 00:53:02,167
"THERE WILL BE MORE ZOOMS
LIKE THIS!"

1299
00:53:02,167 --> 00:53:03,667
- MAJOR!
- YOUR EXCELLENCY!

1300
00:53:03,667 --> 00:53:05,033
FIND THAT BOY!

1301
00:53:05,033 --> 00:53:06,800
I WANT GODO AND THE BOY ALIVE!

1302
00:53:06,800 --> 00:53:08,300
IF THESE THREE PRISONERS
ARE KILLED,

1303
00:53:08,300 --> 00:53:10,100
THEN THEY WILL BE
WORTHLESS TO US!

1304
00:53:10,100 --> 00:53:11,433
YES, YOUR EXCELLENCY!

1305
00:53:11,433 --> 00:53:12,833
- FOLLOW ME!
- YES, SIR!

1306
00:53:12,833 --> 00:53:15,600
"I'M THE BOSS-- PRETTY MUCH."

1307
00:53:15,600 --> 00:53:18,167
YOU MEAN GODO HAS RUN AWAY TOO?

1308
00:53:18,167 --> 00:53:19,800
WE WILL FIND HIM AGAIN.

1309
00:53:19,800 --> 00:53:22,467
YOUR EXCELLENCY,
I DON'T CARE ABOUT MY OWN LIFE,

1310
00:53:22,467 --> 00:53:24,000
ONLY THE CHILDREN.

1311
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:25,800
THEY HAVE DONE NOTHING,
THEY ARE INNOCENT.

1312
00:53:25,800 --> 00:53:26,967
LET THEM GO.

1313
00:53:26,967 --> 00:53:28,500
IF YOU HAD NOT DISOBEYED

1314
00:53:28,500 --> 00:53:31,133
AND FOLLOWED MY INSTRUCTIONS,
THINGS WOULD BE DIFFERENT.

1315
00:53:31,133 --> 00:53:32,633
"NOT BETTER, JUST DIFFERENT."

1316
00:53:32,633 --> 00:53:33,967
WE'LL WAIT TILL NIGHTFALL.

1317
00:53:33,967 --> 00:53:36,300
THEY MIGHT FIND US BEFORE THEN.

1318
00:53:36,300 --> 00:53:39,400
OH, NO, WE'VE MADE IT THIS FAR.

1319
00:53:39,400 --> 00:53:43,233
I'M STARTING TO GET HUNGRY.

1320
00:53:43,233 --> 00:53:45,100
[TIRES SQUEAL]

1321
00:53:45,100 --> 00:53:46,800
- COVER ALL THE EXITS!
- YES, SIR!

1322
00:53:46,800 --> 00:53:51,900
"UH, YOUR OIL'S DONE."

1323
00:53:51,900 --> 00:53:54,500
- OH.
- OH.

1324
00:53:54,500 --> 00:53:57,967
THEY MUST BE HERE SOMEWHERE!

1325
00:53:57,967 --> 00:54:00,233
JOHNNY-- WE'LL GET IN THE TRUCK.

1326
00:54:00,233 --> 00:54:02,600
YEAH...

1327
00:54:02,600 --> 00:54:06,833
"I CAN SEE FROM HERE THEY NEED
A NEW OIL FILTER THOUGH."

1328
00:54:06,833 --> 00:54:09,133
"LOOK, FAMOUS POTATOES."

1329
00:54:09,133 --> 00:54:14,300
OKAY.

1330
00:54:14,300 --> 00:54:17,267
EASY.

1331
00:54:17,267 --> 00:54:23,767
"HARDER..."
[GRUNTS]

1332
00:54:23,767 --> 00:54:25,233
GET IN.

1333
00:54:25,233 --> 00:54:27,467
"I SMELL A RAT--
OH, IT'S YOU, PEPE."

1334
00:54:27,467 --> 00:54:29,367
"HI, WE'LL BE RIGHT BACK--
ENJOY THE FILM."

1335
00:54:36,800 --> 00:54:39,967
"SMELLS LIKE A MAN AND A LITTLE
BOY IN HERE-- WHO BATHED?"

1336
00:54:39,967 --> 00:54:42,900
- "NOT ME."
- "WASN'T ME, NO WAY."

1337
00:54:42,900 --> 00:54:49,233
♪♪

1338
00:54:49,233 --> 00:54:54,033
[IMITATES SIREN AND MUSIC]

1339
00:54:54,033 --> 00:54:57,567
"YOU CRIED EARLIER, CARL--
YOU WANNA TALK ABOUT IT?"

1340
00:54:57,567 --> 00:55:01,367
"OH, COVER YOUR KNEES, HONEY--
I MEAN, SERGEANT."

1341
00:55:06,300 --> 00:55:09,800
"COME ON, EVERYBODY."

1342
00:55:09,800 --> 00:55:11,733
HMM?

1343
00:55:11,733 --> 00:55:15,333
♪♪

1344
00:55:15,333 --> 00:55:18,967
OH, SHE'S WAY OVERDUE.

1345
00:55:18,967 --> 00:55:21,400
"HEY, I SAW THIS IN A THREE
STOOGES MOVIE ONCE, COME ON."

1346
00:55:21,400 --> 00:55:23,267
NYUK-NYUK-NYUK.

1347
00:55:23,267 --> 00:55:25,933
[IMITATES WOODY ALLEN]
"IT'S-- I GOT A BAD BACK--
IT'S THIS LUMBAR, IT'S OUT.

1348
00:55:25,933 --> 00:55:29,867
"HE WAS--
GONNA HAVE TO, UH-- OH....

1349
00:55:29,867 --> 00:55:31,100
I'LL HELP YOU, HERE."

1350
00:55:31,100 --> 00:55:35,600
"YOU KNOW, I THOUGHT
I SMELLED AQUA VELVA."

1351
00:55:35,600 --> 00:55:38,367
"LATER, WHEN WE'RE
OFF DUTY? OKAY."

1352
00:55:38,367 --> 00:55:42,100
[DRAMATIC TRUMPET NOTES]

1353
00:55:42,100 --> 00:55:46,300
[IMITATING NOTES]

1354
00:55:50,033 --> 00:55:58,767
[WHISTLING
"COLONEL BOGEY'S MARCH"]

1355
00:55:58,767 --> 00:56:04,133
"HEY, WHO'S WALKING
ON MY BRIDGE?"

1356
00:56:04,133 --> 00:56:05,467
WE'RE FAR AWAY.

1357
00:56:05,467 --> 00:56:07,267
HOW DO WE FIND
CAROLINE AND CATHERINE?

1358
00:56:07,267 --> 00:56:11,533
"I FOUND THEM QUITE PLEASANT,
AND YOU?"

1359
00:56:11,533 --> 00:56:13,133
WHERE ARE THEY HIDING?

1360
00:56:13,133 --> 00:56:14,967
HEY, HOW DID HE GET HIS
OPPOSABLE TOE IN THAT BOOT?

1361
00:56:14,967 --> 00:56:18,433
I TELL YOU, I DON'T KNOW.

1362
00:56:18,433 --> 00:56:20,733
WHY DO YOU INSIST
ON PROTECTING THEM?

1363
00:56:20,733 --> 00:56:23,733
AFTER ALL, DIDN'T THEY RUN AWAY
AND LEAVE YOU HERE TO DIE?

1364
00:56:23,733 --> 00:56:25,767
"HEY, GOOD POINT-- GIVE ME
A BANANA, I'M JOINING YOU."

1365
00:56:25,767 --> 00:56:28,833
ISN'T IT? THEN WHY HAVEN'T THEY
COME FOR YOU?

1366
00:56:28,833 --> 00:56:30,700
"UH, THE LIGHTS
WERE AGAINST THEM?"

1367
00:56:30,700 --> 00:56:32,333
I'M SURE THEY'RE GOING TO
COME BACK FOR US.

1368
00:56:32,333 --> 00:56:34,700
[LAUGHS]

1369
00:56:34,700 --> 00:56:36,100
IT'S NOT THAT FUNNY.

1370
00:56:36,100 --> 00:56:37,600
♪♪

1371
00:56:37,600 --> 00:56:40,567
IT'S A DONOVAN VIDEO!

1372
00:56:40,567 --> 00:56:47,167
[IMITATING DONOVAN]
♪ WALKING IN THE GRASS
WITH THE SUNLIGHT IN HER HAIR ♪

1373
00:56:47,167 --> 00:56:49,167
HUH?

1374
00:56:49,167 --> 00:56:51,733
OH, LOOK OUT
FOR THE FLOATING PITH HELMET.

1375
00:56:51,733 --> 00:56:53,467
WHAT THE...

1376
00:56:53,467 --> 00:56:56,233
THEY'RE GOING TO BLOW-DRY
EVERYONE NOW.

1377
00:56:56,233 --> 00:56:58,400
"UM, SMILE, PLEASE--
THANK YOU.

1378
00:56:58,400 --> 00:57:01,567
"AND NOW THE JUNIOR CLASS--
THANK YOU.

1379
00:57:01,567 --> 00:57:03,867
"AND NOW THE SENIORS--
THANK YOU.

1380
00:57:03,867 --> 00:57:08,067
I'LL HAVE THESE BACK BY THE END
OF THE TRIP-- THANK YOU."

1381
00:57:08,067 --> 00:57:09,167
PEPE, ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?

1382
00:57:09,167 --> 00:57:10,367
A LITTLE TIRED.

1383
00:57:10,367 --> 00:57:11,667
HE'S NOT PEPE ANYMORE.

1384
00:57:11,667 --> 00:57:13,167
WE'LL REST FOR A LITTLE BIT.

1385
00:57:13,167 --> 00:57:16,100
I WAS WONDERING-- THAT FLYING
SAUCER SEEMS TO BE EVERYWHERE,

1386
00:57:16,100 --> 00:57:18,100
LIKE IT WAS FOLLOWING US.

1387
00:57:18,100 --> 00:57:19,633
MM-HMM.

1388
00:57:19,633 --> 00:57:22,833
DO YOU THINK THERE'S A SPECIAL
REASON IT'S DOING THAT?

1389
00:57:22,833 --> 00:57:24,233
MAYBE TO PROTECT US.

1390
00:57:24,233 --> 00:57:25,800
"YEAH, WE NEED IT
FOR THE THIRD ACT."

1391
00:57:25,800 --> 00:57:27,167
COULD BE FROM A FRIENDLY PLANET.

1392
00:57:27,167 --> 00:57:28,700
"MAYBE IT'S RUTH BUZZI
AND JIM NABORS."

1393
00:57:28,700 --> 00:57:30,400
WHY DON'T THEY TRY TO SIGNAL US?

1394
00:57:30,400 --> 00:57:33,200
IT'S A MYSTERY--
WHO DO YOU THINK THEY ARE?

1395
00:57:33,200 --> 00:57:34,367
"WHO DO YOU THINK YOU ARE?

1396
00:57:34,367 --> 00:57:36,667
YOU LOOK LIKE
A HOSTESS CUPCAKE, PEPE."

1397
00:57:36,667 --> 00:57:38,267
PEPE, ARE YOU OKAY NOW?

1398
00:57:38,267 --> 00:57:39,533
YES.

1399
00:57:39,533 --> 00:57:41,467
ALL RIGHT, COME.

1400
00:57:41,467 --> 00:57:44,933
"AH, GEEZ, KID,
YOU'RE SWEATING LIKE A BEAR--

1401
00:57:44,933 --> 00:57:47,033
OR SHOULD I SAY LEMUR?"

1402
00:57:47,033 --> 00:57:48,767
[GASPS]

1403
00:57:48,767 --> 00:57:50,767
NO, NO, I KNOW
WHAT HE LOOKS LIKE.

1404
00:57:50,767 --> 00:57:53,467
HE LOOKS LIKE A WOODCHUCK
THAT GOT NAILED BY A SPLAT BALL.

1405
00:57:53,467 --> 00:57:58,733
MM-HMM.

1406
00:57:58,733 --> 00:58:01,867
[HUMMING CASUALLY]

1407
00:58:01,867 --> 00:58:04,100
[IMITATING MASSIVE GUNFIRE]

1408
00:58:04,100 --> 00:58:05,700
HEY, WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

1409
00:58:05,700 --> 00:58:07,433
"I'M A TRAITOR TO MY SPECIES."

1410
00:58:07,433 --> 00:58:09,100
YOUR FATHER IS STATIONED HERE?

1411
00:58:09,100 --> 00:58:10,300
YES, HE'S AN OFFICER.

1412
00:58:10,300 --> 00:58:11,367
"AND A GENTLEMONKEY."

1413
00:58:11,367 --> 00:58:12,433
WELL, GO ON.

1414
00:58:12,433 --> 00:58:13,633
YOU SHOULDN'T HANG AROUND HERE.

1415
00:58:13,633 --> 00:58:15,500
GOODBYE-- NICE MEETING YOU.

1416
00:58:15,500 --> 00:58:17,633
THERE'S SOME GOOD SECURITY.

1417
00:58:17,633 --> 00:58:19,800
IS THIS WATERGATE?

1418
00:58:19,800 --> 00:58:22,633
OH, THERE ARE GUARDS EVERYWHERE!

1419
00:58:22,633 --> 00:58:24,533
"IT'S BEAUTIFUL."

1420
00:58:24,533 --> 00:58:26,267
[WHOOSH]

1421
00:58:26,267 --> 00:58:27,467
WHY, THAT'S CAROLINE!

1422
00:58:27,467 --> 00:58:29,400
"AND HER PNEUMATIC DRAPERY."

1423
00:58:29,400 --> 00:58:31,500
IS CATHERINE THERE TOO?

1424
00:58:31,500 --> 00:58:34,467
I DON'T KNOW--
I COULDN'T GET ANY CLOSER.

1425
00:58:34,467 --> 00:58:36,867
"DIDN'T HAVE ANY CERTS."

1426
00:58:36,867 --> 00:58:38,900
HERE'S THE BACK DOOR
TO THE BUILDING,

1427
00:58:38,900 --> 00:58:41,533
AND THEY'RE IN A ROOM
ON THE SECOND FLOOR,

1428
00:58:41,533 --> 00:58:42,967
OVERLOOKING THE YARD.

1429
00:58:42,967 --> 00:58:45,000
BUT THERE ARE GUARDS
POSTED ALL OVER.

1430
00:58:45,000 --> 00:58:46,500
"IS THIS TO SCALE?"

1431
00:58:46,500 --> 00:58:48,267
HERE IS AN EMERGENCY EXIT,

1432
00:58:48,267 --> 00:58:51,667
BUT WE CAN'T GET TO IT UNLESS
WE USE THE OUTSIDE STAIRS.

1433
00:58:51,667 --> 00:58:54,433
GODO?

1434
00:58:54,433 --> 00:58:56,267
WELL, HERE'S WHAT WE'LL DO.

1435
00:58:56,267 --> 00:58:59,000
"WE'LL BANG OUR HEADS TOGETHER
AND WALK AROUND IN A DAZE."

1436
00:58:59,000 --> 00:59:02,800
TODAY WE'VE GOT THREE SEPARATE
VIEWS OF LOVE, MONKEY STYLE.

1437
00:59:02,800 --> 00:59:05,000
[GODO]
--LOAD AS MUCH STRAW IN IT
AS YOU CAN.

1438
00:59:05,000 --> 00:59:06,933
WE'LL MEET BACK HERE.

1439
00:59:06,933 --> 00:59:08,933
"JUST ROLL THAT CART AROUND
FOR ABOUT EIGHT HOURS,
THEN HEAD BACK."

1440
00:59:08,933 --> 00:59:11,633
THEN WE'LL TRY TO GET INTO
THE BACK DOOR OF THE BUILDING.

1441
00:59:11,633 --> 00:59:14,633
BUT YOU'LL HAVE TO BE CAREFUL
SO THE GUARDS DON'T
SUSPECT ANYTHING.

1442
00:59:14,633 --> 00:59:17,300
"WOULD YOU SHUT UP BACK THERE?"

1443
00:59:17,300 --> 00:59:20,433
♪♪

1444
00:59:20,433 --> 00:59:23,267
HMM, CHILD LABOR-- NEAT.

1445
00:59:23,267 --> 00:59:24,400
[WHISPERS]
WE'RE THERE.

1446
00:59:24,400 --> 00:59:25,800
[JOHNNY]
PEPE, YOU'RE TERRIFIC.

1447
00:59:25,800 --> 00:59:28,000
HEY, YOU THERE!

1448
00:59:28,000 --> 00:59:30,233
GODO, HE'S COMING.

1449
00:59:30,233 --> 00:59:32,100
OKAY.

1450
00:59:32,100 --> 00:59:33,933
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

1451
00:59:33,933 --> 00:59:35,267
YOU CAN'T LEAVE THAT THERE.

1452
00:59:35,267 --> 00:59:36,467
I GOT TIRED.

1453
00:59:36,467 --> 00:59:37,867
OKAY, I'LL HELP YOU.

1454
00:59:37,867 --> 00:59:39,633
IT'S AGAINST REGULATIONS
TO STAY HERE.

1455
00:59:39,633 --> 00:59:41,000
"AND I'M NOT A GOOD SOLDIER."

1456
00:59:41,000 --> 00:59:42,933
ALL RIGHT NOW, PULL-- WHOA!

1457
00:59:42,933 --> 00:59:45,700
GIVE HIM A RUG BURN!

1458
00:59:45,700 --> 00:59:47,233
MONKEY PILE!

1459
00:59:47,233 --> 00:59:49,267
YAY!

1460
00:59:49,267 --> 00:59:51,867
MONKEY IN A BLANKET.

1461
00:59:51,867 --> 00:59:53,900
- PEPE, KEEP WATCH.
- RIGHT.

1462
00:59:53,900 --> 00:59:56,967
♪♪

1463
01:00:05,400 --> 01:00:07,467
THAT KID LOOKS LIKE ROSEANNE.

1464
01:00:07,467 --> 01:00:09,767
COME ON.

1465
01:00:09,767 --> 01:00:12,400
IS HE GONNA TELL PEOPLE
HE SPILLED NAIR ON HIS FACE?

1466
01:00:15,000 --> 01:00:18,567
NEIL PEART ON DRUMS.

1467
01:00:18,567 --> 01:00:20,233
HE'S STILL THERE.

1468
01:00:26,200 --> 01:00:28,800
♪ LA-LA-LA-LA... ♪

1469
01:00:28,800 --> 01:00:31,800
HE SHOULD REALLY LEARN
THE LYRICS TO THAT.

1470
01:00:31,800 --> 01:00:33,533
OKAY, NOW.

1471
01:00:33,533 --> 01:00:35,533
HMM, KID TALKING TO HAY--
NOTHING WRONG WITH THAT.

1472
01:00:39,200 --> 01:00:42,067
"SEE HOW I DO THAT?"

1473
01:00:42,067 --> 01:00:46,800
[RAPID BASS LINE]

1474
01:00:46,800 --> 01:00:50,833
♪ PEOPLE TRY TO PUT US D-DOWN. ♪

1475
01:00:50,833 --> 01:00:54,100
JOHNNY, YOU WAIT THERE.

1476
01:00:54,100 --> 01:00:55,100
MMM.

1477
01:00:55,100 --> 01:00:59,267
[STACCATO ORGAN MUSIC]

1478
01:00:59,267 --> 01:01:01,867
♪ TALK ABOUT--
POP MUSIC ♪

1479
01:01:01,867 --> 01:01:04,267
♪ EVERYBODY TALKIN' 'BOUT-- ♪

1480
01:01:04,267 --> 01:01:06,867
SOUNDS LIKE
A LOVIN' SPOONFUL SONG.

1481
01:01:06,867 --> 01:01:09,200
- IT KINDA DOES.
- THE GOOD TIME.

1482
01:01:16,700 --> 01:01:19,967
OOH, HE REALLY
SHOCKED THE MONKEY.

1483
01:01:22,367 --> 01:01:24,700
JOHNNY, ALL CLEAR-- COME ON.

1484
01:01:28,800 --> 01:01:31,300
THE WEATHER BALL FLASHES GREEN--

1485
01:01:31,300 --> 01:01:34,267
NO PLOT FORESEEN.

1486
01:01:34,267 --> 01:01:35,833
"HOWDY, MA'AM, HOWDY."

1487
01:01:35,833 --> 01:01:38,533
[STACCATO ORGAN MUSIC]

1488
01:01:38,533 --> 01:01:42,367
SOUNDS LIKE JOHNNY ONE-NOTE
ON HIS EMENEE MAGIC KEY ORGAN.

1489
01:01:42,367 --> 01:01:44,467
- "♪ HELLO... ♪"
- "♪ HELLO... ♪"

1490
01:01:44,467 --> 01:01:45,833
"WHERE'S THE OTHER GUY?"

1491
01:01:45,833 --> 01:01:47,400
- HELLO.
- OH.

1492
01:01:47,400 --> 01:01:49,033
PREPARE THE PLANE FOR COMBAT.

1493
01:01:49,033 --> 01:01:50,267
CAN'T IT WAIT TILL TOMORROW?

1494
01:01:50,267 --> 01:01:52,000
"WE DON'T HAVE PLANES--
WE'RE APES."

1495
01:01:52,000 --> 01:01:54,167
VERY WELL,
I'LL SEE THAT IT'S DONE.

1496
01:01:54,167 --> 01:01:55,533
"DICKWEED."

1497
01:01:55,533 --> 01:02:00,733
WHAT, DOESN'T ANYBODY HAVE
PERIPHERAL VISION IN THIS MOVIE?

1498
01:02:00,733 --> 01:02:02,033
I DON'T KNOW.

1499
01:02:04,733 --> 01:02:06,500
OH, THERE'S A GUARD THERE.

1500
01:02:06,500 --> 01:02:09,067
ELITE REPUBLICAN GUARD.

1501
01:02:09,067 --> 01:02:10,633
THAT'S THE ROOM.

1502
01:02:10,633 --> 01:02:12,400
WHAT DO WE DO?

1503
01:02:12,400 --> 01:02:16,100
LITTLE JOHNNY'S GOT BAGS
UNDER HIS EYES.

1504
01:02:16,100 --> 01:02:18,233
[IMITATES WHISPERING
AND CHUCKLING]

1505
01:02:18,233 --> 01:02:20,800
"THAT'S DIRTY!"

1506
01:02:20,800 --> 01:02:24,500
[WHISTLING]

1507
01:02:24,500 --> 01:02:25,967
[COUGHS]

1508
01:02:25,967 --> 01:02:27,533
"HEY, COVER YOUR MOUTH, KID."

1509
01:02:27,533 --> 01:02:29,933
WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?
HALT! HALT!

1510
01:02:29,933 --> 01:02:32,967
"OOH, THAT'S WHAT YOU'RE
DOING HERE.

1511
01:02:32,967 --> 01:02:35,600
THANK YOU, HAVE A NICE DAY,
THANKS FOR SHOPPING WALMART."

1512
01:02:35,600 --> 01:02:38,300
LET'S GO.

1513
01:02:38,300 --> 01:02:39,867
"THIS IS THE PRINCIPAL'S OFFICE.

1514
01:02:39,867 --> 01:02:43,933
"THEY'RE SHOWING THAT FILM WE'RE
NOT SUPPOSED TO SEE-- HUH?"

1515
01:02:43,933 --> 01:02:45,200
IT'S ME, CATHERINE!

1516
01:02:45,200 --> 01:02:46,567
"YOUR NAME IS CATHERINE?"

1517
01:02:46,567 --> 01:02:48,400
JOHNNY!

1518
01:02:48,400 --> 01:02:50,367
"HUH?"

1519
01:02:50,367 --> 01:02:52,567
JOHNNY...

1520
01:02:52,567 --> 01:02:54,967
"OOH, YOU SMELL
LIKE A PRIMATE HOUSE."

1521
01:02:54,967 --> 01:02:57,800
- CATHERINE!
- JOHNNY!

1522
01:02:57,800 --> 01:03:00,300
"NOW HOW ABOUT A LITTLE SUGAR
FOR GODOT?"

1523
01:03:00,300 --> 01:03:01,533
GODO, GODO.

1524
01:03:01,533 --> 01:03:04,367
CATHERINE...
[SOBBING]

1525
01:03:04,367 --> 01:03:05,967
RICKY SCHRODER IN "THE CHAMP."

1526
01:03:05,967 --> 01:03:08,167
JOHNNY...

1527
01:03:08,167 --> 01:03:10,067
YOU'RE GNAWING
ON MY ARM, JOHNNY.

1528
01:03:10,067 --> 01:03:11,933
YOU'RE SAFE--
WE WERE SO WORRIED.

1529
01:03:11,933 --> 01:03:13,633
"MY HAIR'S ALL WET."

1530
01:03:13,633 --> 01:03:15,533
NICE TEETH.

1531
01:03:15,533 --> 01:03:17,267
"ALL DONE?"

1532
01:03:17,267 --> 01:03:19,100
GODO!

1533
01:03:19,100 --> 01:03:20,700
LET'S HURRY, WE CAN TALK LATER.

1534
01:03:20,700 --> 01:03:22,333
WE HAVE TO GET OUT OF HERE.

1535
01:03:22,333 --> 01:03:24,400
GODO, THERE'S NO REASON
TO RUN AWAY.

1536
01:03:24,400 --> 01:03:25,667
WHAT?

1537
01:03:25,667 --> 01:03:27,033
THE COMMANDER IS VERY NICE

1538
01:03:27,033 --> 01:03:29,267
AND HE SAID WE WERE
UNDER HIS PROTECTION.

1539
01:03:29,267 --> 01:03:31,133
HIS PROTECTION-- IT SOUNDS
LIKE SOME KIND OF TRAP!

1540
01:03:31,133 --> 01:03:32,400
IT MUST BE.

1541
01:03:32,400 --> 01:03:33,400
WE MUST GET GOING.

1542
01:03:33,400 --> 01:03:34,500
NO-- I'M STAYING.

1543
01:03:34,500 --> 01:03:36,300
NO, YOU'RE COMING WITH ME!

1544
01:03:36,300 --> 01:03:38,667
DON'T FORGET,
WE SAW TRACES OF HUMAN BEINGS.

1545
01:03:38,667 --> 01:03:41,700
THEY HAVE TO BE NEAR HERE
AND WE MUST TRY TO FIND THEM.

1546
01:03:41,700 --> 01:03:44,200
GODO...

1547
01:03:44,200 --> 01:03:45,533
YES, WE'LL ALL GO TOGETHER.

1548
01:03:45,533 --> 01:03:47,300
"HUH, WHO DUBBED YOU?"

1549
01:03:47,300 --> 01:03:48,800
CAROLINE!

1550
01:03:48,800 --> 01:03:51,833
I WANT TO FIND
OTHER HUMAN BEINGS!

1551
01:03:51,833 --> 01:03:54,233
CAROLINE, YOU SAW
HOW HE TREATED US.

1552
01:03:54,233 --> 01:03:56,567
THE COMMANDER HAS BEEN
VERY KIND TO US.

1553
01:03:56,567 --> 01:03:57,800
HE'S NOT LIKE THE OTHERS.

1554
01:03:57,800 --> 01:03:59,300
AN APE IS STILL AN APE!

1555
01:03:59,300 --> 01:04:01,933
"AN APE BY ANY OTHER NAME
WOULD SMELL AS BAD."

1556
01:04:01,933 --> 01:04:03,533
WE MUST GET GOING!

1557
01:04:03,533 --> 01:04:04,967
CATHERINE, PLEASE, COME WITH US.

1558
01:04:04,967 --> 01:04:06,433
GODO, I TELL YOU IT'S THE TRUTH!

1559
01:04:06,433 --> 01:04:08,400
THE COMMANDER WAS REALLY
TRYING TO PROTECT US.

1560
01:04:08,400 --> 01:04:09,900
AND I TELL YOU
IT MUST BE A TRICK.

1561
01:04:09,900 --> 01:04:10,967
COME ON, WE'RE LOSING TIME.

1562
01:04:10,967 --> 01:04:12,033
DO SOMETHING!

1563
01:04:12,033 --> 01:04:13,033
COME ON, CAROLINE, HURRY!

1564
01:04:13,033 --> 01:04:14,133
[GUNFIRE]

1565
01:04:14,133 --> 01:04:15,333
"THE BLUE AND THE GRAY."

1566
01:04:15,333 --> 01:04:16,733
THE APES OF THE OLD WEST.

1567
01:04:16,733 --> 01:04:18,133
THAT'S JOHN WESLEY APE--

1568
01:04:18,133 --> 01:04:22,567
HE ONCE FLUNG CRAP AT A MAN
JUST FOR SNORING TOO LOUD.

1569
01:04:22,567 --> 01:04:24,933
AFTER THEM, AFTER THEM!
FORWARD!

1570
01:04:24,933 --> 01:04:28,433
"APES" IS FILMED
LIVE ON LOCATION
IN DEADWOOD, SOUTH DAKOTA.

1571
01:04:28,433 --> 01:04:29,733
WE'RE SURROUNDED!

1572
01:04:29,733 --> 01:04:30,867
THEY'VE GOT US!

1573
01:04:30,867 --> 01:04:33,567
GODO! LET'S SEE YOU ESCAPE NOW!

1574
01:04:33,567 --> 01:04:35,067
LOOK, THE FLYING SAUCER!

1575
01:04:35,067 --> 01:04:36,067
"WHERE?"

1576
01:04:36,067 --> 01:04:39,000
♪♪

1577
01:04:42,233 --> 01:04:45,933
FROM SHOOTOUT TO SPACE-OUT.

1578
01:04:45,933 --> 01:04:47,367
[GASPS]

1579
01:04:47,367 --> 01:04:49,233
IT'S THAT FLYING SAUCER AGAIN!

1580
01:04:49,233 --> 01:04:50,367
SHOOT IT DOWN!

1581
01:04:50,367 --> 01:04:51,567
YES, SIR!

1582
01:04:51,567 --> 01:04:52,733
YEAH, RIGHT.

1583
01:04:52,733 --> 01:04:54,267
"ALL RIGHT, MEN,
PUT YOUR FACE DIAPERS ON!"

1584
01:04:54,267 --> 01:04:56,000
"DEPENDS READY, SIR.

1585
01:04:56,000 --> 01:04:57,467
DON'T THESE GO OVER
OUR RED BUTTS?"

1586
01:05:00,933 --> 01:05:03,500
GET READY TO FIRE
THE NUCLEAR GUNS!

1587
01:05:03,500 --> 01:05:04,933
THIS TIME I'LL SHOW THEM-- FIRE!

1588
01:05:04,933 --> 01:05:06,900
[ZAPPING]

1589
01:05:06,900 --> 01:05:10,500
DOH... HUH-HUH, GO FIGURE.

1590
01:05:10,500 --> 01:05:12,700
MINE'S GONE TOO.

1591
01:05:12,700 --> 01:05:14,733
"THESE ARE NO GOOD."

1592
01:05:14,733 --> 01:05:16,333
FIRE!

1593
01:05:16,333 --> 01:05:17,800
[GOOFY LAUGHTER]

1594
01:05:17,800 --> 01:05:19,300
WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?
SHOOT IT DOWN!

1595
01:05:19,300 --> 01:05:22,367
IT'S "THE WACKIEST WAR
IN THE CONGO!"

1596
01:05:22,367 --> 01:05:24,867
"McHALE'S NAVY GOES TO
THE PLANET OF THE APES!"

1597
01:05:24,867 --> 01:05:26,600
ON TODAY'S MATINEE MOVIE.

1598
01:05:26,600 --> 01:05:28,400
HEY, LOOK, "CADDYSHACK."

1599
01:05:28,400 --> 01:05:29,933
OH, NO, NO, THAT'S PEPE.

1600
01:05:33,967 --> 01:05:36,167
GODO, LOOK, A GUARD.

1601
01:05:36,167 --> 01:05:38,067
"NO..."

1602
01:05:38,067 --> 01:05:41,667
"CAN I BORROW YOUR STYLING GEL?"

1603
01:05:41,667 --> 01:05:43,333
"HALT, WHO GOES THERE?

1604
01:05:43,333 --> 01:05:46,367
"WHO PLAYED DR. ZAIUS
IN 'PLANET OF THE APES'?

1605
01:05:46,367 --> 01:05:48,200
"THAT'S WRONG.

1606
01:05:48,200 --> 01:05:50,733
YOU'RE RIGHT."

1607
01:05:50,733 --> 01:05:51,833
[TWANGY MUSIC]

1608
01:05:51,833 --> 01:05:54,167
COME ON!

1609
01:05:54,167 --> 01:05:56,767
WELL, IT'S ABOUT THIS TIME
THAT THE OLD APE BOYS

1610
01:05:56,767 --> 01:05:59,867
GOT THEMSELVES INTO A HEAP O'
TROUBLE OVER AT COOTER'S PLACE.

1611
01:05:59,867 --> 01:06:02,800
SEE, THEY WERE PICKIN' NITS
OFF EACH OTHER AND, WELL--

1612
01:06:02,800 --> 01:06:04,100
JOHNNY, HURRY!

1613
01:06:10,633 --> 01:06:12,133
WHERE'D THEY GO?

1614
01:06:12,133 --> 01:06:15,900
"WELL, THEY COULD BE IN ONE OF
THOSE TRUCKS DRIVING AWAY."

1615
01:06:15,900 --> 01:06:18,400
SHOOT THEM!
SHOOT THEM, SHOOT THEM!

1616
01:06:18,400 --> 01:06:20,067
OUR GUNS STILL AREN'T FIRING!

1617
01:06:20,067 --> 01:06:24,467
"THROW YOUR GUNS AT THEM!"

1618
01:06:24,467 --> 01:06:26,367
JOHNNY, WHAT'D YOU DO?

1619
01:06:26,367 --> 01:06:29,200
I TOOK THE KEY
FROM THE TRUCK-- THERE!

1620
01:06:29,200 --> 01:06:30,967
"THAT'S OUR TRUCK!"

1621
01:06:30,967 --> 01:06:34,100
JOHNNY, YOU'RE A PRETTY
SMART GUY.

1622
01:06:34,100 --> 01:06:35,967
"IT'S FUN WHEN YOU'RE SMART!"

1623
01:06:35,967 --> 01:06:41,967
[LAUGHING]

1624
01:06:41,967 --> 01:06:44,800
SHALL WE WAIT
FOR THE FLYING SAUCER?

1625
01:06:44,800 --> 01:06:45,867
YES.

1626
01:06:45,867 --> 01:06:47,333
GEBAR MIGHT CATCH UP TO US.

1627
01:06:47,333 --> 01:06:48,633
ZSA ZSA GEBAR?

1628
01:06:48,633 --> 01:06:50,867
OH, NO, NO, NO, SHE'S STILL
DOING COMMUNITY SERVICE.

1629
01:06:50,867 --> 01:06:53,967
IF WE ONLY KNEW
WHY THEY'RE FOLLOWING US.

1630
01:06:53,967 --> 01:06:56,400
MAYBE THEY THINK
WE'RE FOLLOWING THEM.

1631
01:06:56,400 --> 01:06:57,767
"HEY, THAT WOULD BE A SWITCH."

1632
01:06:57,767 --> 01:07:00,000
I NOTICED IT ALWAYS COMES
FROM THE EAST.

1633
01:07:00,000 --> 01:07:03,367
MAYBE THEY'RE TRYING
TO FOLLOW THE PLOT!

1634
01:07:03,367 --> 01:07:05,400
IT'S A LITTLE OLD DEVO HAT!

1635
01:07:05,400 --> 01:07:08,500
THOSE SPUD BOYS ARE EVERYWHERE.

1636
01:07:08,500 --> 01:07:10,600
IT LOOKS LIKE IT'S SIGNALING.

1637
01:07:10,600 --> 01:07:12,067
- YES.
- WELL, LET'S GO.

1638
01:07:12,067 --> 01:07:13,533
NO, WAIT A SECOND!

1639
01:07:13,533 --> 01:07:15,333
I'M BEGINNING TO UNDERSTAND NOW.

1640
01:07:15,333 --> 01:07:19,000
UNLESS I'M WRONG,
THE ORGANIZATION KNOW AS UCOM

1641
01:07:19,000 --> 01:07:21,700
IS NOW TRYING TO TAKE OVER
THE APE COUNTRY.

1642
01:07:21,700 --> 01:07:23,100
IT WANTS US TO LEAVE.

1643
01:07:23,100 --> 01:07:25,633
MAYBE THEY'RE GETTING READY
TO ATTACK.

1644
01:07:25,633 --> 01:07:28,167
UCOM HAS NEVER ATTACKED
HUMAN BEINGS.

1645
01:07:28,167 --> 01:07:30,133
WE SHOULD CONTACT THEM
AND SEEK THEIR PROTECTION

1646
01:07:30,133 --> 01:07:32,200
OR THE APES'LL GET US.

1647
01:07:32,200 --> 01:07:33,700
IT COULD BE DANGEROUS.

1648
01:07:33,700 --> 01:07:34,867
SHALL WE TRY IT?

1649
01:07:34,867 --> 01:07:36,567
ANYTHING TO MOVE THE PLOT!

1650
01:07:36,567 --> 01:07:38,100
IT'S OUR ONLY CHANCE.

1651
01:07:38,100 --> 01:07:39,367
I'M FOR IT!

1652
01:07:39,367 --> 01:07:40,767
[CHUCKLES]

1653
01:07:40,767 --> 01:07:45,233
"YES! TO OUR DEATH, THEN! WHEE!"

1654
01:07:45,233 --> 01:07:48,033
CAREFUL! THE COMMAND CAR
IS APPROACHING!

1655
01:07:48,033 --> 01:07:53,900
"PUT THOSE DICE AWAY
AND GET YOUR ROLLER SKATES ON."

1656
01:07:53,900 --> 01:07:55,600
"HEY, WHERE'D YOU GET
THE BEAMER, MONKEY DUDE?"

1657
01:07:55,600 --> 01:07:58,667
"I, UH, FELL IN A COW PIE--
I HOPE NOBODY NOTICES."

1658
01:07:58,667 --> 01:08:01,167
STOP HIM, STOP HIM,
HE CAN'T COME IN HERE!

1659
01:08:01,167 --> 01:08:03,200
HE'S NOT THE COMMANDER ANYMORE!

1660
01:08:03,200 --> 01:08:04,567
LOSAR IS OUR NEW LEADER!

1661
01:08:04,567 --> 01:08:06,633
WE HAVE ORDERS
NOT TO LET HIM IN!

1662
01:08:06,633 --> 01:08:08,100
"IT'S A MADHOUSE!"

1663
01:08:08,100 --> 01:08:09,200
LET US THROUGH, LET US THROUGH!

1664
01:08:09,200 --> 01:08:10,767
"OSWALD'S BEEN SHOT!"

1665
01:08:10,767 --> 01:08:11,967
DON'T LET ANYBODY IN!

1666
01:08:11,967 --> 01:08:13,833
THE COMMANDER IS COMING!

1667
01:08:13,833 --> 01:08:16,700
IT'S LIKE TRYING TO GET
TO THE BATHROOM AT A FRAT PARTY.

1668
01:08:16,700 --> 01:08:20,067
HOW WOULD YOU KNOW?

1669
01:08:20,067 --> 01:08:24,333
"I'M WITH THE BAND,
I'M OKAY, LET ME THROUGH."

1670
01:08:24,333 --> 01:08:26,133
THE COMMANDER IS HERE!

1671
01:08:26,133 --> 01:08:27,533
HOW DARE YOU COME IN HERE?!

1672
01:08:27,533 --> 01:08:29,133
KEEP 'EM OUT, KEEP 'EM OUT!

1673
01:08:29,133 --> 01:08:30,933
OH, YOUR EXCELLENCY!

1674
01:08:30,933 --> 01:08:33,633
SO, YOU HAVE BETRAYED ME.

1675
01:08:33,633 --> 01:08:36,200
ARREST HIM, ARREST HIM!

1676
01:08:36,200 --> 01:08:37,933
ARREST HIM, I SAID!

1677
01:08:37,933 --> 01:08:39,267
LOWER YOUR WEAPONS.

1678
01:08:39,267 --> 01:08:40,533
CHECK THIS OUT, THIS IS GOOD.

1679
01:08:40,533 --> 01:08:42,367
OOH, REALLY UNFORTUNATE SKIN.

1680
01:08:42,367 --> 01:08:43,533
YOU ARE TOO WEAK!

1681
01:08:43,533 --> 01:08:44,700
YOU PROTECT OUR ENEMIES!

1682
01:08:44,700 --> 01:08:46,300
WE WANT TO FIGHT AND KILL
THOSE INVADERS!

1683
01:08:46,300 --> 01:08:47,300
THAT IS YOUR PLAN?

1684
01:08:47,300 --> 01:08:48,367
YES, IT IS.

1685
01:08:48,367 --> 01:08:49,600
I GAVE ORDERS
TO HAVE THEM KILLED.

1686
01:08:49,600 --> 01:08:50,967
I GIVE THE ORDERS HERE.

1687
01:08:50,967 --> 01:08:52,533
YOU ARE NOT
OUR COMMANDER ANYMORE.

1688
01:08:52,533 --> 01:08:58,167
I'LL GIVE YOU ONE LAST CHANCE
TO CALL OFF THIS REBELLION.

1689
01:08:58,167 --> 01:08:59,967
BUT YOUR EXCELLENCY...

1690
01:08:59,967 --> 01:09:04,233
AND I GIVE YOU MY WORD OF HONOR,
OUR ENEMIES SHALL BE PUNISHED.

1691
01:09:04,233 --> 01:09:06,300
VERY WELL, YOUR EXCELLENCY.

1692
01:09:08,833 --> 01:09:10,800
GODO, WHERE ARE WE GOING?

1693
01:09:10,800 --> 01:09:12,933
"DO THE WORDS 'SHALLOW GRAVE'
MEAN ANYTHING TO YOU?"

1694
01:09:12,933 --> 01:09:14,200
I'M TAKING YOU HOME.

1695
01:09:14,200 --> 01:09:16,367
"HOME, WHERE MY THOUGHTS
ESCAPE ME?

1696
01:09:16,367 --> 01:09:19,233
HOME, WHERE I COMB MY FACEY?"

1697
01:09:19,233 --> 01:09:22,433
AW, SHE'S GONNA BE GROUNDED
UNTIL SHE'S 30.

1698
01:09:22,433 --> 01:09:24,533
IT'S A SHE?

1699
01:09:24,533 --> 01:09:25,500
HMM...

1700
01:09:31,400 --> 01:09:33,467
LOOKS LIKE SHE'S BEEN
ROOTING FOR TUBERS.

1701
01:09:33,467 --> 01:09:34,567
"LASSIE!"

1702
01:09:34,567 --> 01:09:35,567
MAMA!

1703
01:09:35,567 --> 01:09:39,100
PEPE! OH! PEPE!

1704
01:09:39,100 --> 01:09:42,267
[HOOTING LIKE MONKEYS]

1705
01:09:42,267 --> 01:09:44,867
I WAS SO WORRIED ABOUT YOU.

1706
01:09:44,867 --> 01:09:46,667
I LOOKED EVERYWHERE FOR YOU.

1707
01:09:46,667 --> 01:09:49,700
I EVEN WENT
AS FAR AS GREEN MOUNTAIN!

1708
01:09:49,700 --> 01:09:51,933
OH... BUT YOU'RE HOME NOW.

1709
01:09:51,933 --> 01:09:54,333
EXCUSE ME, MA'AM,
BRAWNY WANTS HIS SHIRT BACK.

1710
01:09:54,333 --> 01:09:59,033
PEPE... I COULDN'T IMAGINE
WHAT HAD HAPPENED TO YOU.

1711
01:09:59,033 --> 01:10:05,900
"I'VE BECOME A MAN, MOTHER."

1712
01:10:05,900 --> 01:10:09,467
"THEY ARE CUTE, BUT THEY SMELL."

1713
01:10:09,467 --> 01:10:13,167
PEPE, AT FIRST I EVEN THOUGHT
THAT YOU WERE KILLED

1714
01:10:13,167 --> 01:10:15,367
BY ONE OF THOSE NAKED APES.

1715
01:10:15,367 --> 01:10:16,433
"I EVEN RENTED OUT YOUR ROOM."

1716
01:10:16,433 --> 01:10:18,267
DON'T BE AFRAID.

1717
01:10:18,267 --> 01:10:19,733
PEPE, PEPE!

1718
01:10:19,733 --> 01:10:21,967
IT'S ALL RIGHT, MAMA,
THESE ARE MY FRIENDS.

1719
01:10:21,967 --> 01:10:23,767
THEY'RE THE ONES
WHO SAVED MY LIFE.

1720
01:10:23,767 --> 01:10:25,767
"AND THEY SPEAK MONKEY!"

1721
01:10:25,767 --> 01:10:27,833
I'VE BEEN TRAVELING WITH THEM
A LONG TIME.

1722
01:10:27,833 --> 01:10:29,400
I CAN EXPLAIN.

1723
01:10:29,400 --> 01:10:30,567
WE WERE FORCED TO TAKE PEPE.

1724
01:10:30,567 --> 01:10:32,000
I'M VERY SORRY.

1725
01:10:32,000 --> 01:10:34,800
WE DIDN'T WANT TO TAKE HER
ALONG, BUT WE HAD NO CHOICE.

1726
01:10:34,800 --> 01:10:36,733
WE WERE BEING PURSUED BY TROOPS.

1727
01:10:36,733 --> 01:10:37,867
"THAT TRUE, HONEY?"

1728
01:10:37,867 --> 01:10:39,400
I KNOW HOW WORRIED
YOU MUST HAVE BEEN.

1729
01:10:39,400 --> 01:10:40,400
ARE YOU LEAVING ME NOW?

1730
01:10:40,400 --> 01:10:42,400
YES, TO GO BACK TO OUR COUNTRY.

1731
01:10:42,400 --> 01:10:43,933
YOU UNDERSTAND?

1732
01:10:43,933 --> 01:10:46,100
NO, NO, PLEASE,
TAKE ME WITH YOU!

1733
01:10:46,100 --> 01:10:49,100
PEPE, YOU HAVE TO STAY
AND TAKE CARE OF YOUR MOTHER.

1734
01:10:49,100 --> 01:10:50,900
I WANT TO GO WITH YOU.

1735
01:10:50,900 --> 01:10:54,367
PEPE, I ENVY YOU BECAUSE
YOU FOUND YOUR MOTHER AGAIN.

1736
01:10:54,367 --> 01:10:56,000
BUT I WANT TO GO WITH YOU!

1737
01:10:56,000 --> 01:10:59,133
PEPE, YOU HAVE TO STAY
WITH YOUR MOTHER!

1738
01:10:59,133 --> 01:11:02,867
BUT I-- I WANT TO GO
WITH JOHNNY AND CAROLINE.

1739
01:11:02,867 --> 01:11:04,500
BE QUIET!

1740
01:11:04,500 --> 01:11:07,633
DO YOU WANT YOUR MOTHER
TO BE SAD?

1741
01:11:07,633 --> 01:11:10,800
"UM... CAN I THINK ABOUT IT?"

1742
01:11:10,800 --> 01:11:12,467
[SAD HARMONICA MUSIC]

1743
01:11:12,467 --> 01:11:15,000
OH, IT'S TOOTS THIELEMANS
ON THE MOUTH HARP.

1744
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:18,100
PEPE, JOHNNY IS RIGHT.

1745
01:11:18,100 --> 01:11:19,800
WE'LL SEE YOU AGAIN.

1746
01:11:19,800 --> 01:11:22,133
"NOT."

1747
01:11:22,133 --> 01:11:24,500
JOHNNY!

1748
01:11:24,500 --> 01:11:29,633
PEPE... YOU MUST BE A GOOD GIRL
AND STAY HERE WITH YOUR MOTHER.

1749
01:11:29,633 --> 01:11:31,233
"STAY... STAY, PEPE."

1750
01:11:31,233 --> 01:11:34,233
"SIT... STAY."

1751
01:11:34,233 --> 01:11:38,867
PEPE... YOU'LL BE ALL RIGHT?

1752
01:11:38,867 --> 01:11:43,233
"WE'LL GET YOU A TICK BATH
AND A RAWHIDE CHEW."

1753
01:11:43,233 --> 01:11:45,900
GOODBYE, PEPE, GOODBYE!

1754
01:11:45,900 --> 01:11:47,033
GOODBYE, JOHNNY!

1755
01:11:47,033 --> 01:11:48,467
I'LL MISS YOU!

1756
01:11:48,467 --> 01:11:50,033
COME BACK SOON!

1757
01:11:50,033 --> 01:11:55,867
[ALL IMITATING GUNFIRE
AND SCREAMING]

1758
01:11:55,867 --> 01:11:59,733
SHOULD WE HAVE SHOT HER
THAT MANY TIMES?

1759
01:11:59,733 --> 01:12:02,633
OH...

1760
01:12:02,633 --> 01:12:04,733
THERE'S ONE GOOD THING--
WE MET PEPE.

1761
01:12:04,733 --> 01:12:06,667
I DON'T THINK
I'LL EVER FORGET HER.

1762
01:12:06,667 --> 01:12:11,200
I DON'T THINK YOU'LL EVER GET
THE SMELL OUT OF THE SEATS,
EITHER-- WOOF!

1763
01:12:11,200 --> 01:12:13,067
THAT'S GEBAR'S JEEP!

1764
01:12:16,533 --> 01:12:21,600
- HE MUST BE NEARBY.
- YES.

1765
01:12:21,600 --> 01:12:27,933
"B.J.? HAWKEYE?
TRAPPER JOHN?"

1766
01:12:27,933 --> 01:12:31,133
I'VE BEEN WAITING FOR YOU, GODO!

1767
01:12:31,133 --> 01:12:36,067
"I MADE SNACKS!
I HOPE YOU LIKE PIZZA ROLLS!"

1768
01:12:36,067 --> 01:12:38,400
WHAT DO YOU WANT?

1769
01:12:38,400 --> 01:12:41,300
DON'T WORRY, GODO,
I'VE NO SOLDIERS.

1770
01:12:41,300 --> 01:12:42,433
IT'S JUST YOU AND I.

1771
01:12:42,433 --> 01:12:43,967
I'M IN A HURRY.

1772
01:12:43,967 --> 01:12:45,533
I HAVE NO TIME FOR YOU TODAY.

1773
01:12:45,533 --> 01:12:47,567
I HAVE MORE URGENT BUSINESS.

1774
01:12:47,567 --> 01:12:50,133
WHEN I'VE FINISHED,
THEN I'LL SEE YOU.

1775
01:12:50,133 --> 01:12:51,600
"MAYBE BRUNCH ON SUNDAY?"

1776
01:12:51,600 --> 01:12:55,033
SILENCE!

1777
01:12:55,033 --> 01:12:56,800
"WELL, WE COULD RESCHEDULE.

1778
01:12:56,800 --> 01:12:59,667
MAKE AN APPOINTMENT WITH
MY SECRETARY OR SOMETHING."

1779
01:13:03,733 --> 01:13:05,267
I'M GOING TO KILL YOU!

1780
01:13:05,267 --> 01:13:07,900
I DESERTED MY POST AND CAME HERE
JUST TO KILL YOU!

1781
01:13:07,900 --> 01:13:11,000
I MUST AVENGE
MY WIFE AND MY SON!

1782
01:13:11,000 --> 01:13:14,567
IT'S DON KNOTTS IN
"THE SHAKIEST APE IN THE WEST"!

1783
01:13:14,567 --> 01:13:16,167
I'LL TAKE CARE OF GEBAR,
CATHERINE.

1784
01:13:16,167 --> 01:13:18,200
TAKE THE CHILDREN UP TO THE
CLIFF AND WAIT FOR ME THERE.

1785
01:13:18,200 --> 01:13:19,200
GODO!

1786
01:13:19,200 --> 01:13:20,500
NO, NOT PLUTO-- THAT'S TOO FAR.

1787
01:13:20,500 --> 01:13:21,833
GODO, YOU CAN'T ESCAPE NOW.

1788
01:13:21,833 --> 01:13:24,633
COME ON OUT!

1789
01:13:24,633 --> 01:13:25,900
[GUN CLICKS]

1790
01:13:25,900 --> 01:13:26,967
[GASPS]

1791
01:13:26,967 --> 01:13:28,933
"UH-OH..."

1792
01:13:28,933 --> 01:13:30,833
"GET BACK TO THE PONDEROSA
AND TELL HOSS WE'RE IN TROUBLE

1793
01:13:30,833 --> 01:13:32,033
AND GET ME
SOME CHICKEN-FRIED STEAK."

1794
01:13:32,033 --> 01:13:33,867
[LAUGHING]
GODO!

1795
01:13:33,867 --> 01:13:36,667
I'VE FINALLY GOT MY REVENGE!

1796
01:13:36,667 --> 01:13:38,233
YOU WANTED TO GO
TO GREEN MOUNTAIN

1797
01:13:38,233 --> 01:13:40,333
BUT INSTEAD YOU'LL GO
TO YOUR DEATH!

1798
01:13:40,333 --> 01:13:43,967
[LAUGHING]

1799
01:13:43,967 --> 01:13:45,500
GEE, IT'S NOT THAT FUNNY.

1800
01:13:45,500 --> 01:13:48,833
LISTEN TO ME-- YOUR THIRST
FOR REVENGE IS AGAINST ME!

1801
01:13:48,833 --> 01:13:51,567
BUT THE OTHER THREE ARE NOT
INVOLVED-- LET THEM GO FREE!

1802
01:13:51,567 --> 01:13:52,833
OH, COME ON...

1803
01:13:52,833 --> 01:13:54,933
I CAN'T BELIEVE THE CLOTHES
THOSE GUYS ARE WEARING.

1804
01:13:54,933 --> 01:13:56,800
"MY NAME IS INIGO MONTOYA!"

1805
01:13:56,800 --> 01:14:00,200
GODO-- NOW PREPARE TO DIE!
[LAUGHS]

1806
01:14:00,200 --> 01:14:08,300
[WHOOSHING, CREAKING,
WHIRRING, CLANKING]

1807
01:14:08,300 --> 01:14:11,000
--AND THE OUTLOOK FOR FRIDAY,
MORE OF THE SAME.

1808
01:14:11,000 --> 01:14:13,267
RAIN, RAIN, RAIN, RAIN, RAIN.

1809
01:14:13,267 --> 01:14:15,200
[CHUCKLES]

1810
01:14:15,200 --> 01:14:19,367
SO, UH, IT'S A GOOD IDEA
THAT WE KEEP OUR SCUBA GEAR
FOR THE NEXT COUPLE OF DAYS?

1811
01:14:19,367 --> 01:14:21,367
[CHUCKLING]
OVER TO YOU, JOEL.

1812
01:14:21,367 --> 01:14:22,833
THANKS, TOM SERVO.

1813
01:14:22,833 --> 01:14:26,967
ANYWAY, UP NEXT IS OUR
FASHION EDITOR, CROW T. ROBOT,

1814
01:14:26,967 --> 01:14:28,633
WITH THE FASHION MINUTE--
CROW?

1815
01:14:28,633 --> 01:14:29,667
THANK YOU, JOEL.

1816
01:14:29,667 --> 01:14:31,567
HELLO, HELLO, HELLO!

1817
01:14:31,567 --> 01:14:35,833
THIS SPRING'S APE IS DASHING,
DARING AND ABSOLUTELY SHAMELESS
IN PARAMILITARY GARB

1818
01:14:35,833 --> 01:14:38,800
AS THE HOUSE OF PRIMATES
UNVEILED ITS TARZAN COLLECTION

1819
01:14:38,800 --> 01:14:41,200
TO THE DAZZLED DESIGNERS
ASSEMBLED IN MILAN,

1820
01:14:41,200 --> 01:14:43,833
AND, OH-HO, LUCKY ME,
I HAVE THE FOOTAGE.

1821
01:14:43,833 --> 01:14:45,567
UH, ROLL THAT FOOTAGE, CAMBOT.

1822
01:14:45,567 --> 01:14:48,500
HERE COMES ENNUI, PATROLLING
THE BYWAYS OF FASHION

1823
01:14:48,500 --> 01:14:50,867
IN A BREEZY STREET-LENGTH
HEAVY WOOL DRESS,

1824
01:14:50,867 --> 01:14:54,900
SMARTLY ACCENTED BY AN ORANGE
ASCOT WITH WHITE SHOULDER BAG
AND MATCHING BELT.

1825
01:14:54,900 --> 01:14:57,033
KOKO'S A CLASSIC IN THIS CHANEL.

1826
01:14:57,033 --> 01:15:01,367
SHOULDER PADS, LEGGINGS
AND JAUNTY GOLD BUTTONS
PUT ALL EYES ON THIS SOLDIER.

1827
01:15:01,367 --> 01:15:04,333
TEN-HUT!
COLORS SCREAM FOR ATTENTION

1828
01:15:04,333 --> 01:15:08,133
IN THESE FUN, FUN, FUN,
ONE-PIECE ACTION JUMPSUITS
BY DICKER AND DICKER.

1829
01:15:08,133 --> 01:15:12,533
ALTHOUGH THEY CAN FLY SOLO,
JUST ADD A BROACH, WHITE LACQUER
SKULLCAP AND JACKBOOTS

1830
01:15:12,533 --> 01:15:14,667
AND YOU'LL SOAR
TO NEW FASHION HEIGHTS.

1831
01:15:14,667 --> 01:15:17,300
BACK ON THE HOME FRONT,
YOU'LL WAIT FOR YOUR KING KONG

1832
01:15:17,300 --> 01:15:20,600
WITH THIS INDIGO PRINT KERCHIEF
BY DR. ZAIA.

1833
01:15:20,600 --> 01:15:24,567
BUT HOLD ONTO IT--
THIS LITTLE NUMBER'S RED-HOT
AND LOOKS GREAT ON ANY SPECIES!

1834
01:15:24,567 --> 01:15:26,533
HALT, WHO GOES THERE?!

1835
01:15:26,533 --> 01:15:30,067
WHY, IT'S JACQUES
IN THE TIMELESS
COLONEL SANDERS TOPCOAT.

1836
01:15:30,067 --> 01:15:32,533
NOTED THE RAISED BRASS BUTTONS
AND VELVET COLLAR.

1837
01:15:32,533 --> 01:15:35,467
THIS ENSEMBLE MAKES ANY APE
KING OF HIS JUNGLE.

1838
01:15:35,467 --> 01:15:40,600
OFF DUTY? THEN BIVOUAC
IN THIS OH-SO-SOFT,
RICH VELOUR DINNER JACKET

1839
01:15:40,600 --> 01:15:42,433
FROM THE CORNELIUS COLLECTION.

1840
01:15:42,433 --> 01:15:44,667
JUST ADD A RIDING CROP,
BLUE TAFFETA ASCOT,

1841
01:15:44,667 --> 01:15:47,267
AND YOU'LL BE THE CINDERELLA
OF ANY LIBERTY.

1842
01:15:47,267 --> 01:15:50,433
ATTENTION, ALL PERSONNEL:
INCOMING FASHION!

1843
01:15:50,433 --> 01:15:54,433
OUR MILITARY PARADE ENDS WITH
A SALUTE TO THE MEDICAL CORPS.

1844
01:15:54,433 --> 01:15:58,867
THESE GAUZY WHITE LINEN
SURGICAL MASKS BREATHE LIFE
INTO ANY WARDROBE.

1845
01:15:58,867 --> 01:16:01,500
ONE OF THIS YEARS
MOST VERSATILE ACCESSORIES,

1846
01:16:01,500 --> 01:16:05,033
THE SURGICAL MASK DOUBLES
AS A RED-BUTT COVER.

1847
01:16:05,033 --> 01:16:08,167
WELL, THIS IS ONE REPORTER
WHO IS READY TO ENLIST

1848
01:16:08,167 --> 01:16:10,167
IN ANY "GORILLA" WAR
THAT LOOKS THIS GREAT,

1849
01:16:10,167 --> 01:16:14,267
SO THIS YEAR,
UNCLE CORNELIUS WANTS YOU!

1850
01:16:14,267 --> 01:16:15,567
BACK TO YOU, JOEL.

1851
01:16:15,567 --> 01:16:17,333
THIS IS CROW--
BYE-BYE FOR NOW!

1852
01:16:17,333 --> 01:16:20,733
AROUND THE EARTH IN 30 MINUTES,
THIS IS COMMERCIAL SIGN.

1853
01:16:20,733 --> 01:16:22,667
♪♪

1854
01:16:27,733 --> 01:16:31,733
OH, WE HAVE FUN, DON'T WE?

1855
01:16:31,733 --> 01:16:32,900
[CLICKING]

1856
01:16:32,900 --> 01:16:36,067
"DARN LIGHTER--
OUT OF FLUID."

1857
01:16:36,067 --> 01:16:40,067
[FLYING SAUCER HUMMING]

1858
01:16:40,067 --> 01:16:43,367
THAT FLYING SAUCER AGAIN!

1859
01:16:43,367 --> 01:16:45,400
WHOEVER YOU ARE UP THERE...

1860
01:16:45,400 --> 01:16:48,733
TELL ME, WHY DO YOU PREVENT ME
FROM CARRYING OUT JUSTICE?

1861
01:16:48,733 --> 01:16:50,967
HE'S DOING A SCENE FROM "LEAR"!

1862
01:16:50,967 --> 01:16:52,100
--KILLED MY WIFE AND SON!

1863
01:16:52,100 --> 01:16:53,200
YEAH, YEAH...

1864
01:16:53,200 --> 01:16:54,567
I MUST HAVE MY REVENGE!

1865
01:16:54,567 --> 01:16:58,400
YOU MUST HAVE YOUR VALIUM TOO,
BUDDY-- CALM DOWN.

1866
01:16:58,400 --> 01:17:00,900
YOU MUST LET ME KILL HIM!

1867
01:17:00,900 --> 01:17:02,700
OH, THAT'S HOW BIG IT IS.

1868
01:17:02,700 --> 01:17:04,533
GODO KILLED MY WIFE AND SON!

1869
01:17:04,533 --> 01:17:06,967
HE'S WAITING FOR GODO, I THINK.

1870
01:17:06,967 --> 01:17:08,967
GODOT.

1871
01:17:08,967 --> 01:17:11,467
HEY, IT'S THE HOUSE ON THE ROCK.

1872
01:17:11,467 --> 01:17:15,333
YOU MUST LET ME KILL GODO!

1873
01:17:15,333 --> 01:17:17,767
JUST LET ME DO THIS ONE THING--

1874
01:17:17,767 --> 01:17:20,467
BOY, THAT MONKEY SURE CAN EMOTE.

1875
01:17:20,467 --> 01:17:22,667
JUST LET ME DO THIS ONE THING.

1876
01:17:22,667 --> 01:17:24,233
[COMPUTERIZED VOICE]
UCOM HAS ORDERED

1877
01:17:24,233 --> 01:17:27,067
THAT THERE SHOULD BE A STOP
TO ALL FURTHER KILLING---

1878
01:17:27,067 --> 01:17:29,500
"OR YOU WILL BE KILLED."

1879
01:17:29,500 --> 01:17:33,433
BUT GODO KILLED
MY WIFE AND MY CHILD!

1880
01:17:33,433 --> 01:17:35,867
HE DESERVES TO DIE!

1881
01:17:35,867 --> 01:17:38,200
WHY DO YOU WANT TO SAVE
GODO'S LIFE?

1882
01:17:38,200 --> 01:17:41,067
- HUH?
- HUH?

1883
01:17:41,067 --> 01:17:43,800
OH, YOU KNOW THE PARTY'S OVER
WHEN THEY BRING OUT
THE VACATION SLIDES.

1884
01:17:43,800 --> 01:17:46,267
ABSOLUTELY-- I'M READY TO GO.

1885
01:17:46,267 --> 01:17:48,767
HELP ME, HELP ME!

1886
01:17:48,767 --> 01:17:51,833
IT'S BABU-- IT'S MY SON.

1887
01:17:51,833 --> 01:17:53,367
[ALL GASP]

1888
01:17:53,367 --> 01:17:55,033
OH, I'VE SEEN THIS ONE.

1889
01:17:55,033 --> 01:17:56,767
HOLD ON, HOLD ON.

1890
01:17:56,767 --> 01:17:59,567
BOY, THE COLOR IS TERRIBLE--
THINK YOU CAN DO SOMETHING
ABOUT THAT?

1891
01:17:59,567 --> 01:18:02,367
TRY TO CATCH THIS-- OH!

1892
01:18:02,367 --> 01:18:05,800
"OH, THERE'S THAT ROPE
I USED TO HAVE-- I'VE BEEN
LOOKING FOR THAT."

1893
01:18:05,800 --> 01:18:09,867
OH...

1894
01:18:09,867 --> 01:18:11,967
OOH!

1895
01:18:11,967 --> 01:18:15,367
YOU KNOW, THOSE TWO APES
PROBABLY NEVER DID
VERY GOOD IN GYM.

1896
01:18:15,367 --> 01:18:16,900
THEY CAN'T CLIMB THE ROPES
AT ALL.

1897
01:18:16,900 --> 01:18:19,167
OH, HE SHOULDN'T HAVE
SHAVED HIS MUSTACHE.

1898
01:18:19,167 --> 01:18:22,367
--I'LL TRY TO PULL YOU UP.

1899
01:18:22,367 --> 01:18:25,533
I CAN'T HOLD ON ANY LONGER!

1900
01:18:25,533 --> 01:18:29,100
GODO, TRY TO SAVE MY SON!
SAVE MY SON!

1901
01:18:29,100 --> 01:18:35,100
YOU KNOW, IN FILMS,
THIS IS WHERE GETTING
FINAL CUT REALLY PAYS OFF.

1902
01:18:35,100 --> 01:18:36,800
"LIVE, DAMN IT, LIVE!

1903
01:18:36,800 --> 01:18:41,200
COME ON, YOU NEVER GAVE UP
ON ANYTHING IN YOUR LIFE--
NOW LIVE..."

1904
01:18:41,200 --> 01:18:44,967
"OH, BOY, IS MY FACE RED!"

1905
01:18:44,967 --> 01:18:46,433
THAT'S NOT THE ONLY THING--

1906
01:18:46,433 --> 01:18:47,433
THAT'S RED.

1907
01:18:47,433 --> 01:18:49,333
COME ON!

1908
01:18:49,333 --> 01:18:51,233
HE'S AN APE AND HE CAN'T
HANG ON TO A ROPE?

1909
01:18:51,233 --> 01:18:52,800
SOMETHING'S WRONG.

1910
01:18:52,800 --> 01:18:55,733
A LITTLE MORE! THERE!

1911
01:18:55,733 --> 01:19:01,400
♪♪

1912
01:19:01,400 --> 01:19:03,967
"GODONKO, COME BACK!"

1913
01:19:03,967 --> 01:19:06,467
[GUNSHOT]

1914
01:19:06,467 --> 01:19:11,300
OH, IT'S EARL WARREN'S
SINGLE-APE THEORY HERE.

1915
01:19:11,300 --> 01:19:15,133
HELLO, THERE-- HOPE YOU'VE
ENJOYED TODAY'S MATINEE MOVIE.

1916
01:19:15,133 --> 01:19:20,500
MY SON... I KILLED MY OWN SON!

1917
01:19:20,500 --> 01:19:23,933
IT WASN'T GODO--
I KILLED MY OWN SON!

1918
01:19:23,933 --> 01:19:27,800
"HURTS, DON'T IT?
BYE..."

1919
01:19:27,800 --> 01:19:29,433
♪♪

1920
01:19:29,433 --> 01:19:32,133
[GASPING]

1921
01:19:32,133 --> 01:19:34,733
GEEZ...

1922
01:19:34,733 --> 01:19:38,333
[SOBBING]

1923
01:19:38,333 --> 01:19:43,067
[IMITATES CHARLTON HESTON]
"I DID IT, I FINALLY DID IT...
DAMN ME ALL TO HELL!"

1924
01:19:43,067 --> 01:19:44,833
[PERCUSSION INSTRUMENT RATTLES]

1925
01:19:44,833 --> 01:19:50,600
MEANWHILE, AT THE FORD FALCON
WITH THE VIBRASLAP OPTION--

1926
01:19:50,600 --> 01:19:52,533
IT'S THE COMMANDER!

1927
01:19:52,533 --> 01:19:55,267
"OH-- HANG ON, JUST A SEC--
DON'T SAY ANYTHING YET--

1928
01:19:55,267 --> 01:19:59,400
WAIT, I GOTTA GET THIS DOOR--
OKAY."

1929
01:19:59,400 --> 01:20:01,333
"HOW MUCH DO I OWE YA?

1930
01:20:01,333 --> 01:20:04,000
TOLD YOU NOT TO COME
BY WAY OF THE EXPRESSWAY--
IT'S ALL TORN UP OVER THERE."

1931
01:20:04,000 --> 01:20:05,433
"SORRY, SORRY, SORRY."

1932
01:20:05,433 --> 01:20:08,533
"HURRY IT UP, I GOTTA DO LINCOLN
AT THE GLOBE THEATER."

1933
01:20:08,533 --> 01:20:11,233
YOUR EXCELLENCY,
UCOM'S BEEN SIGNALING US.

1934
01:20:11,233 --> 01:20:14,467
BE CAREFUL-- IT MUST BE A TRAP
TO KILL YOU.

1935
01:20:14,467 --> 01:20:16,933
BUT THE FLYING SAUCER
ALWAYS USED TO HELP US,

1936
01:20:16,933 --> 01:20:18,500
AND IT'S AN AGENT OF UCOM.

1937
01:20:18,500 --> 01:20:19,833
IT'S A TRICK!

1938
01:20:19,833 --> 01:20:21,300
[GEBAR SOBBING]

1939
01:20:21,300 --> 01:20:22,633
GEBAR?

1940
01:20:22,633 --> 01:20:26,833
"HO-HO-HO, I JUST HEARD
THE FUNNIEST JOKE..."

1941
01:20:26,833 --> 01:20:29,667
YOUR EXCELLENCY,
I DON'T DESERVE TO LIVE.

1942
01:20:29,667 --> 01:20:32,133
I'VE DONE A TERRIBLE THING.

1943
01:20:32,133 --> 01:20:33,933
I'M A MURDERER!

1944
01:20:33,933 --> 01:20:36,300
I'VE NO RIGHT TO LIVE ANYMORE.

1945
01:20:36,300 --> 01:20:39,967
I-- I KILLED MY WIFE AND MY SON.

1946
01:20:39,967 --> 01:20:41,233
WHAT'S THAT?

1947
01:20:41,233 --> 01:20:43,333
YES, I KILLED
MY WIFE AND MY SON.

1948
01:20:43,333 --> 01:20:44,567
"COME AGAIN?"

1949
01:20:44,567 --> 01:20:46,967
"GEEZ, YOU ARE A SICKO."

1950
01:20:46,967 --> 01:20:50,900
AND I ALWAYS THOUGHT
THAT GODO HAD KILLED THEM.

1951
01:20:50,900 --> 01:20:54,567
GEBAR, IT WAS AN ACCIDENT.

1952
01:20:54,567 --> 01:20:56,500
YOU HAVE A GOOD HEART--

1953
01:20:56,500 --> 01:20:59,667
"BUT YOU GOT REALLY BAD BREATH."

1954
01:20:59,667 --> 01:21:04,033
OH, YOUR EXCELLENCY...

1955
01:21:04,033 --> 01:21:06,600
GEBAR, IT WAS AN ACCIDENT.

1956
01:21:06,600 --> 01:21:09,367
- K-MART?
- THE SAVINGS PLACE?

1957
01:21:09,367 --> 01:21:14,100
- OH...
- "I DON'T FEEL VERY GOOD, I'M
GONNA GO RENT 'FACES OF DEATH.'"

1958
01:21:14,100 --> 01:21:17,333
GODO... I ACCUSED YOU WRONGLY.

1959
01:21:17,333 --> 01:21:18,733
PLEASE FORGIVE ME.

1960
01:21:18,733 --> 01:21:21,600
"YEAH, WELL, SORRY DON'T FEED
THE BULLDOG, PAL."

1961
01:21:21,600 --> 01:21:23,133
OH...

1962
01:21:23,133 --> 01:21:26,033
"OH, LOU, LOU..."

1963
01:21:26,033 --> 01:21:29,333
OH, THE POOR THING--
TO HAVE TO LIVE WITH THAT.

1964
01:21:29,333 --> 01:21:31,633
"SO, LUNCH, EVERYONE?"

1965
01:21:31,633 --> 01:21:34,700
NO, WE'RE GOING TO CONTACT UCOM.

1966
01:21:34,700 --> 01:21:36,733
YOU ARE BEING FOOLED.

1967
01:21:36,733 --> 01:21:40,867
YOU DO NOT REALIZE THE DANGERS
THAT LIE DEEP IN GREEN MOUNTAIN.

1968
01:21:40,867 --> 01:21:45,500
UCOM CAN BE VERY TREACHEROUS--
STAY HERE WITH ME.

1969
01:21:45,500 --> 01:21:46,967
CATHERINE, LET'S GO.

1970
01:21:46,967 --> 01:21:49,300
JUST A MOMENT, PLEASE.

1971
01:21:49,300 --> 01:21:51,333
THE REBELLION IS OVER.

1972
01:21:51,333 --> 01:21:53,700
WE CAN HAVE A PEACEFUL LIFE.

1973
01:21:53,700 --> 01:21:54,967
LET US GO BACK TOGETHER.

1974
01:21:54,967 --> 01:21:57,867
I CAN'T.

1975
01:21:57,867 --> 01:22:00,367
I KNOW THAT YOU HAVE BEEN KIND.

1976
01:22:00,367 --> 01:22:04,000
ONLY WE ARE HUMAN BEINGS
AND THIS IS AN APE COUNTRY.

1977
01:22:04,000 --> 01:22:05,900
"AND IT STINKS TO HIGH HEAVEN."

1978
01:22:05,900 --> 01:22:07,600
PLEASE UNDERSTAND.

1979
01:22:07,600 --> 01:22:09,400
"THINK OF THE CHILDREN."

1980
01:22:09,400 --> 01:22:12,633
AMONG STRANGE CREATURES,
IN A STRANGE COUNTRY,

1981
01:22:12,633 --> 01:22:13,967
AWAY FROM OUR HOMES--

1982
01:22:13,967 --> 01:22:15,700
"A STRANGER IN A STRANGE LAND."

1983
01:22:15,700 --> 01:22:18,133
SHE'S NOT GONNA START TO SING
"EBONY AND IVORY," IS SHE?

1984
01:22:18,133 --> 01:22:19,500
- NO.
- I HOPE NOT.

1985
01:22:19,500 --> 01:22:22,033
WAIT A MINUTE,
IT'S DARREN McGAVIN.

1986
01:22:22,033 --> 01:22:26,000
I KNEW IT.

1987
01:22:26,000 --> 01:22:28,067
"I'M HUNGRY."

1988
01:22:28,067 --> 01:22:32,867
♪♪

1989
01:22:32,867 --> 01:22:36,067
"YOU REALLY ARE DIFFERENT."

1990
01:22:36,067 --> 01:22:38,133
I UNDERSTAND.

1991
01:22:38,133 --> 01:22:40,333
YES, BECAUSE WE ARE DIFFERENT,

1992
01:22:40,333 --> 01:22:42,500
YOU'D BE AFRAID
TO LIVE AMONG US.

1993
01:22:42,500 --> 01:22:44,267
BUT THAT WILL CHANGE SOON.

1994
01:22:44,267 --> 01:22:47,500
ONE DAY, DIFFERENT PEOPLE
WILL LEARN TO LIVE TOGETHER--

1995
01:22:47,500 --> 01:22:53,633
MESSAGE! THIS IS THE MESSAGE!
MESSAGE, PEOPLE, MESSAGE.

1996
01:22:53,633 --> 01:22:55,800
I WISH YOU WELL ON YOUR JOURNEY.

1997
01:22:55,800 --> 01:22:57,600
THANK YOU, SIR.

1998
01:22:57,600 --> 01:23:01,200
I DON'T KNOW HOW TO EXPRESS
OUR GRATITUDE FOR ALL
YOU'VE DONE FOR US.

1999
01:23:01,200 --> 01:23:03,100
"HOW ABOUT A HICKORY FARMS
GIFT BOX?"

2000
01:23:03,100 --> 01:23:04,867
- CAPTAIN.
- YOUR EXCELLENCY.

2001
01:23:04,867 --> 01:23:06,533
"A COUPLE OF THOSE CIGARS
YOU HAVE ON YOUR SLEEVE."

2002
01:23:06,533 --> 01:23:08,333
"FRUIT IS GOOD, SIR."

2003
01:23:08,333 --> 01:23:11,333
YOU MIGHT NEED THIS.

2004
01:23:11,333 --> 01:23:12,500
"NEAT."

2005
01:23:12,500 --> 01:23:15,033
IT'S BEEN A GREAT PLEASURE
KNOWING YOU.

2006
01:23:15,033 --> 01:23:17,267
I HOPE YOU WILL THINK OF US
ONCE IN A WHILE.

2007
01:23:17,267 --> 01:23:21,267
"YOU KNOW, WHEN YOU DRIVE PAST
A BLOODY RACCOON ON THE SIDE OF
THE ROAD, THAT KIND OF THING."

2008
01:23:21,267 --> 01:23:23,900
TAKE GOOD CARE OF MY FRIENDS.

2009
01:23:23,900 --> 01:23:28,367
"UM, I'D WASH THAT HAND
IF I WERE YOU-- THAT'S
MY THROWING HAND-- YEAH."

2010
01:23:28,367 --> 01:23:33,967
♪♪

2011
01:23:33,967 --> 01:23:38,233
GOODBYE, GOODBYE.

2012
01:23:38,233 --> 01:23:40,833
"I GOTTA GET THIS OUTFIT
BACK TO PRINCE."

2013
01:23:40,833 --> 01:23:46,433
"I, UH, PUT A TIME BOMB
IN THEIR CAR-- WATCH THIS."

2014
01:23:46,433 --> 01:23:49,500
ANY OF YOU GUYS
EVER BEEN TO THE DELLS?

2015
01:23:49,500 --> 01:23:52,333
THIS KINDA REMINDS ME OF IT.

2016
01:23:52,333 --> 01:23:53,567
YOU RIDE THE DUCKS.

2017
01:23:53,567 --> 01:23:55,167
WE'RE VERY CLOSE.

2018
01:23:55,167 --> 01:23:58,067
THE ENTRANCE MUST BE SOMEWHERE
BEHIND THE MOUNTAIN.

2019
01:23:58,067 --> 01:24:00,400
WELL, THAT'S NARROWING IT DOWN,
ISN'T IT?

2020
01:24:00,400 --> 01:24:02,233
LOOK, THERE'S THE FLYING SAUCER!

2021
01:24:02,233 --> 01:24:03,800
[MOCKING]
"THERE'S THE FLYING SAUCER"

2022
01:24:03,800 --> 01:24:05,200
[MOCKING IN GIBBERISH]

2023
01:24:05,200 --> 01:24:08,100
WELL, PUT YOUR THUMBS OUT,
MAYBE YOU CAN HITCH A RIDE.

2024
01:24:08,100 --> 01:24:10,967
GODO, WHERE'S IT LANDING?

2025
01:24:10,967 --> 01:24:13,500
BEHIND THAT ROCK FORMATION.

2026
01:24:13,500 --> 01:24:15,300
I DON'T KNOW THIS PLACE.

2027
01:24:15,300 --> 01:24:17,967
I WASN'T ALLOWED TO PLAY HERE
AS A CHILD.

2028
01:24:17,967 --> 01:24:19,767
THEN UCOM'S CERTAINLY THERE.

2029
01:24:25,633 --> 01:24:29,500
BE CAREFUL.

2030
01:24:29,500 --> 01:24:32,467
OH, LOOK!

2031
01:24:32,467 --> 01:24:36,900
"IT'S A U-STORE-IT!"

2032
01:24:36,900 --> 01:24:38,533
THIS MUST BE THE ENTRANCE.

2033
01:24:38,533 --> 01:24:40,267
HOW DO WE GET IN?

2034
01:24:40,267 --> 01:24:42,633
"TRY KNOCKING."

2035
01:24:42,633 --> 01:24:45,000
AGAIN WITH THE FEET!

2036
01:24:45,000 --> 01:24:47,167
[CLICKING AND WHOOSHING]

2037
01:24:47,167 --> 01:24:48,833
THAT WAS EASY.

2038
01:24:48,833 --> 01:24:50,000
[CAROLINE GASPS]

2039
01:24:50,000 --> 01:24:52,800
[IMITATING GASPS]

2040
01:24:52,800 --> 01:24:55,700
WELL, LET'S GO.

2041
01:24:55,700 --> 01:24:58,967
[SUSPENSEFUL TRUMPET NOTES]

2042
01:24:58,967 --> 01:25:01,633
MILES DAVIS IS IN THERE.

2043
01:25:01,633 --> 01:25:04,433
BEWARE OF THE BALROG...

2044
01:25:04,433 --> 01:25:07,533
ISN'T THAT FROM
"LORD OF THE RINGS"?

2045
01:25:07,533 --> 01:25:11,567
WE ALL OF A SUDDEN
HAVE LEATHER LACE-UP BOOTS
AND EIGHT-SIDED DICE?

2046
01:25:11,567 --> 01:25:13,333
HEY, GIVE ME A BREAK.

2047
01:25:13,333 --> 01:25:16,433
YOU KNOW, IF YOU LOOKED
AT THOSE LACE-UP BOOTS,

2048
01:25:16,433 --> 01:25:18,200
I'D HAVE TO KILL YOU?

2049
01:25:18,200 --> 01:25:19,633
OOH.

2050
01:25:19,633 --> 01:25:22,400
[WHOOSHING]

2051
01:25:22,400 --> 01:25:26,067
HMM... HMM... HMM?

2052
01:25:26,067 --> 01:25:29,167
THIS WEEK ONLY,
AT THE OMNI THEATER...

2053
01:25:29,167 --> 01:25:31,067
THE JOSHUA LIGHT SHOW!

2054
01:25:31,067 --> 01:25:33,633
♪♪

2055
01:25:36,700 --> 01:25:40,200
[CATHERINE]
WE MUST HAVE COME
INTO THE FUTURE.

2056
01:25:40,200 --> 01:25:41,500
[ZAPPING]

2057
01:25:41,500 --> 01:25:44,067
OOH, BOY...

2058
01:25:44,067 --> 01:25:48,067
ARE WE IN THE LEFT VENTRICLE?

2059
01:25:48,067 --> 01:25:53,100
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK... ♪

2060
01:25:53,100 --> 01:25:55,433
"I'M FRANCES FARMER!"

2061
01:25:55,433 --> 01:25:57,433
JOHNNY?

2062
01:25:57,433 --> 01:26:02,600
NOPE, CATHERINE'S VIVIEN LEIGH
AND JOHNNY IS JOHN BERRYMAN NOW.

2063
01:26:02,600 --> 01:26:04,967
FASHIONS BY ISSEY MIYAKE.

2064
01:26:04,967 --> 01:26:09,333
AND IT SHOWS.

2065
01:26:09,333 --> 01:26:11,533
[RATTLING DOORKNOB]

2066
01:26:11,533 --> 01:26:13,733
THAT WAS EASY.

2067
01:26:13,733 --> 01:26:16,567
NOW SHE'S ON THE INSIDE.

2068
01:26:16,567 --> 01:26:17,700
FOCUS!

2069
01:26:17,700 --> 01:26:18,700
PLEASE!

2070
01:26:18,700 --> 01:26:19,700
FOCUS!

2071
01:26:19,700 --> 01:26:21,033
HEY, FOCUS!

2072
01:26:21,033 --> 01:26:23,100
HEY, IT'S A SCENE
FROM "THE MIRACLE WORKER."

2073
01:26:23,100 --> 01:26:24,567
- LA.
- LA.

2074
01:26:24,567 --> 01:26:26,200
[DISCORDANT JAZZ]

2075
01:26:26,200 --> 01:26:33,433
OH, NO, IT'S ANTHONY BRAXTON
AND DON CHERRY, RUN-- NO...!

2076
01:26:33,433 --> 01:26:39,000
IT'S VERY SURREAL.

2077
01:26:39,000 --> 01:26:40,333
[GASPS]

2078
01:26:40,333 --> 01:26:42,100
"HI."

2079
01:26:42,100 --> 01:26:44,433
IT'S WILLIAM CONRAD
FOR FIRST ALERT!

2080
01:26:44,433 --> 01:26:48,033
[ALARM BLARING]

2081
01:26:48,033 --> 01:26:49,967
CATHERINE...!

2082
01:26:49,967 --> 01:26:52,367
[IMITATING ALARM]

2083
01:26:52,367 --> 01:26:54,700
THIS IS LIKE
AN OBSESSION COMMERCIAL.

2084
01:26:54,700 --> 01:26:59,133
"IF I'M AN APE,
THEN PRONOUNCE ME GUILTY."

2085
01:26:59,133 --> 01:27:01,667
"BETWEEN APES AND MEN...
LIES OBSESSION."

2086
01:27:01,667 --> 01:27:03,167
I THOUGHT I'D LOST YOU...

2087
01:27:03,167 --> 01:27:06,633
[MOCKING ECHO]
LOST YOU... LOST YOU...
LOST YOU... LOST YOU...

2088
01:27:06,633 --> 01:27:11,233
LOST YOU...

2089
01:27:11,233 --> 01:27:13,333
CAROLINE!

2090
01:27:13,333 --> 01:27:14,633
RUN LIKE A DUCK!

2091
01:27:14,633 --> 01:27:17,400
[IMITATES QUACKING]

2092
01:27:17,400 --> 01:27:19,633
CAROLINE!

2093
01:27:19,633 --> 01:27:22,133
SHE PASSED OUT FROM
THE SHEER LENGTH OF THE FILM.

2094
01:27:22,133 --> 01:27:25,200
CAROLINE, CAROLINE!

2095
01:27:25,200 --> 01:27:30,000
UH, SHE WAS AWAKE
ABOUT TEN SLAPS AGO.

2096
01:27:30,000 --> 01:27:31,433
"MY BROTHER LIVES IN FLORIDA."

2097
01:27:31,433 --> 01:27:32,700
CATHERINE!

2098
01:27:32,700 --> 01:27:34,067
CAROLINE!

2099
01:27:34,067 --> 01:27:38,967
[IMITATING GIDDY LAUGHTER]

2100
01:27:38,967 --> 01:27:41,133
YOU KNOW WHERE JOHNNY IS?

2101
01:27:41,133 --> 01:27:44,333
"DO YOU KNOW WHERE
BUFFY AND CISSY ARE?"

2102
01:27:44,333 --> 01:27:45,700
WE'RE STILL IN THE APE COUNTRY!

2103
01:27:45,700 --> 01:27:47,000
I JUST SAW APES!

2104
01:27:47,000 --> 01:27:48,100
CAROLINE, CALM YOURSELF.

2105
01:27:48,100 --> 01:27:49,200
I SAW APES, CATHERINE!

2106
01:27:49,200 --> 01:27:50,200
CALM DOWN, CAROLINE.

2107
01:27:50,200 --> 01:27:53,300
I DID SEE THEM, I DID!

2108
01:27:53,300 --> 01:27:55,133
THEY'RE COMING,
THEY'RE COMING AFTER US!

2109
01:27:55,133 --> 01:27:58,100
WE'LL TALK TO THEIR LEADER,
THE COMMANDER.

2110
01:27:58,100 --> 01:28:00,433
CATHERINE!

2111
01:28:00,433 --> 01:28:03,200
JAMES BOND.
[HUMS BOND THEME]

2112
01:28:03,200 --> 01:28:05,733
CATHERINE!

2113
01:28:05,733 --> 01:28:08,733
HEY, IT'S THE GUYS FROM
"CLOCKWORK ORANGE," THE DROOGS.

2114
01:28:08,733 --> 01:28:10,833
OH, YEAH.

2115
01:28:10,833 --> 01:28:15,167
OH, NO, NO, NO, I THINK IT'S
A GROUP OF CASTRO IMPERSONATORS.

2116
01:28:15,167 --> 01:28:19,433
♪♪

2117
01:28:19,433 --> 01:28:20,967
PLEASE DON'T HURT US!

2118
01:28:20,967 --> 01:28:22,900
DON'T HURT US!

2119
01:28:22,900 --> 01:28:23,900
HUH?

2120
01:28:23,900 --> 01:28:26,767
THEY SEEM TO BE
IN A STATE OF SHOCK.

2121
01:28:26,767 --> 01:28:28,767
UH, SO ARE WE.

2122
01:28:28,767 --> 01:28:30,733
[GASPING]

2123
01:28:30,733 --> 01:28:35,167
[MOCKING GASPING]

2124
01:28:35,167 --> 01:28:37,033
OUR MYSTERY GUEST IS...

2125
01:28:37,033 --> 01:28:38,700
WHO'S THAT?

2126
01:28:38,700 --> 01:28:40,633
DR. LEE!

2127
01:28:40,633 --> 01:28:42,200
[GASPS]

2128
01:28:42,200 --> 01:28:43,800
[ORGAN PLAYING]

2129
01:28:43,800 --> 01:28:45,233
WELCOME BACK HOME.

2130
01:28:45,233 --> 01:28:47,067
"THE MUSIC IS GOOFY HERE TOO."

2131
01:28:47,067 --> 01:28:48,633
WE'RE BACK WHERE WE STARTED!

2132
01:28:48,633 --> 01:28:50,100
CATHERINE!

2133
01:28:50,100 --> 01:28:51,700
[MOCKING GASPING]

2134
01:28:51,700 --> 01:28:56,400
ANY MORE GASPING AND WE'RE GONNA
RUN OUT OF AIR IN THIS ROOM.

2135
01:28:56,400 --> 01:28:59,067
"AAH! IT'S AN APE!"

2136
01:28:59,067 --> 01:29:00,700
DOCTOR, THEY'VE HAD
QUITE AN EXPERIENCE.

2137
01:29:00,700 --> 01:29:02,433
I DON'T THINK THEY'LL FORGET IT
FOR A LONG TIME.

2138
01:29:02,433 --> 01:29:04,867
- YES.
- "THAT OUGHTA TEACH 'EM."

2139
01:29:04,867 --> 01:29:06,067
[GASPS]

2140
01:29:06,067 --> 01:29:07,733
AND NOW, PART TWO
OF "TIME OF THE APES."

2141
01:29:07,733 --> 01:29:09,833
DR. LEE,
WHERE ARE THE OTHER TWO?

2142
01:29:09,833 --> 01:29:11,433
HMM, TWO?

2143
01:29:11,433 --> 01:29:13,233
YES, JOHNNY AND--

2144
01:29:13,233 --> 01:29:15,733
JOHNNY IS OVER THERE.

2145
01:29:15,733 --> 01:29:19,233
WE PUT THE THREE OF YOU
IN DIFFERENT ROOMS.

2146
01:29:19,233 --> 01:29:21,000
BUT WE WERE FOUR.

2147
01:29:21,000 --> 01:29:23,333
THE THIRD CAPSULE WAS EMPTY.

2148
01:29:23,333 --> 01:29:25,267
NO, IT CAN'T BE!

2149
01:29:25,267 --> 01:29:27,167
GODO WAS WITH US, A YOUNG MAN!

2150
01:29:27,167 --> 01:29:29,233
FACE IT, SISTER,
HE BLEW YOU OFF.

2151
01:29:29,233 --> 01:29:33,867
YOU MUST HAVE HAD
SOME KIND OF HALLUCINATION.

2152
01:29:33,867 --> 01:29:35,800
THE CAPSULE IS STILL HERE?

2153
01:29:35,800 --> 01:29:38,667
IT'S IN THE LABORATORY,
THE DOOR ON THE RIGHT.

2154
01:29:38,667 --> 01:29:40,767
"TAKE IT OUT FOR A TEST DRIVE.

2155
01:29:40,767 --> 01:29:43,367
I GOTTA GET BACK
TO THE MEAT COUNTER."

2156
01:29:43,367 --> 01:29:45,800
CATHERINE!

2157
01:29:45,800 --> 01:29:48,700
RUN LIKE A DUCK AGAIN!

2158
01:29:48,700 --> 01:29:52,967
[MACHINES BEEPING]

2159
01:29:52,967 --> 01:29:56,200
"I SWEAR HE WAS IN
ONE OF THESE."

2160
01:29:56,200 --> 01:30:00,267
OH!

2161
01:30:00,267 --> 01:30:02,533
GODO'S A PENDANT?

2162
01:30:02,533 --> 01:30:03,967
MAYBE HE'S IN THERE.

2163
01:30:03,967 --> 01:30:05,367
CATHERINE!

2164
01:30:05,367 --> 01:30:07,933
HE "IN DE PENDANT."
[LAUGHS]

2165
01:30:07,933 --> 01:30:11,733
SORRY.

2166
01:30:11,733 --> 01:30:14,633
"UH, YOUR LOAN'S BEEN APPROVED."

2167
01:30:14,633 --> 01:30:15,633
ROSEANNE!

2168
01:30:15,633 --> 01:30:17,367
- MOTHER!
- MOTHER!

2169
01:30:17,367 --> 01:30:19,867
JOHNNY!

2170
01:30:19,867 --> 01:30:23,067
"HEY, BUDDY! BUDDY, BUDDY BOY!
WHERE ARE MY GOLDFISH?"

2171
01:30:23,067 --> 01:30:25,267
IT'S SO GOOD TO BE BACK.

2172
01:30:25,267 --> 01:30:27,600
JOHNNY.

2173
01:30:27,600 --> 01:30:29,567
I NEVER THOUGHT
I'D SEE YOU AGAIN.

2174
01:30:29,567 --> 01:30:31,800
"WE WERE HOPING."

2175
01:30:31,800 --> 01:30:34,200
"IT'S DONE--
TURN UP THE VOLTAGE, HANK."

2176
01:30:34,200 --> 01:30:35,867
[IMITATES ELECTRICITY ZAPPING]

2177
01:30:35,867 --> 01:30:37,767
WELL, THAT WAS REALLY GOOD,
LET'S GET GOING.

2178
01:30:37,767 --> 01:30:39,100
YEAH, LET'S GET OUT OF HERE.

2179
01:30:39,100 --> 01:30:40,200
I LIKED THAT ONE.

2180
01:30:40,200 --> 01:30:43,933
THAT WAS FUN,
THAT WAS REALLY COOL.

2181
01:30:43,933 --> 01:30:45,733
WHAT?

2182
01:30:45,733 --> 01:30:46,900
HEY, WAIT A MINUTE.

2183
01:30:46,900 --> 01:30:48,067
IT'S STILL ON?

2184
01:30:48,067 --> 01:30:50,167
OH, FOR CRYING OUT LOUD.

2185
01:30:50,167 --> 01:30:51,367
SEVEN DAYS?

2186
01:30:51,367 --> 01:30:54,000
FORTUNATELY, ONLY A LIMITED AREA
WAS DAMAGED--

2187
01:30:54,000 --> 01:30:55,567
HOW MANY ENDINGS
ARE WE GONNA GET?

2188
01:30:55,567 --> 01:30:57,633
THE RESCUE TEAM
WORKED AROUND THE CLOCK.

2189
01:30:57,633 --> 01:31:00,100
IT STILL TOOK SEVEN DAYS
TO DIG YOU OUT.

2190
01:31:00,100 --> 01:31:03,200
ONLY SEVEN DAYS?

2191
01:31:03,200 --> 01:31:05,100
IN MAY.

2192
01:31:05,100 --> 01:31:06,800
YOU'VE HAD AN INCREDIBLE
ADVENTURE, I KNOW,

2193
01:31:06,800 --> 01:31:07,967
BUT TIME IS RELATIVE.

2194
01:31:07,967 --> 01:31:09,267
"YOU MEAN, LIKE MY DAD?"

2195
01:31:09,267 --> 01:31:11,233
NO ONE WILL BELIEVE THAT YOUR
EXPERIENCE OF SIX MONTHS

2196
01:31:11,233 --> 01:31:12,700
ONLY LASTED SEVEN DAYS.

2197
01:31:12,700 --> 01:31:14,333
BUT IT'S THE TRUTH!

2198
01:31:14,333 --> 01:31:16,300
"YEAH, RIGHT."
[BLOWING RASPBERRY]

2199
01:31:16,300 --> 01:31:18,733
I KNOW IT'S THE TRUTH
AND I HAVE EVIDENCE.

2200
01:31:18,733 --> 01:31:21,833
- MM-HMM?
- YEAH?

2201
01:31:21,833 --> 01:31:23,700
I HAVE DATA THAT CORROBORATES
YOUR STORY.

2202
01:31:23,700 --> 01:31:26,267
HE'S NOW WORKING
FOR "STAR TREK."

2203
01:31:26,267 --> 01:31:28,667
I NOTICED CERTAIN DEVIATIONS
IN THE TIME SCALE.

2204
01:31:28,667 --> 01:31:32,633
IT SHOWS 3,714 YEARS.

2205
01:31:32,633 --> 01:31:34,033
"YEAH, I CAN SEE IT."

2206
01:31:34,033 --> 01:31:35,900
AND THE THERMOMETER SHOWS
AN INCREDIBLY LOW TEMPERATURE.

2207
01:31:35,900 --> 01:31:37,333
"NEAT."

2208
01:31:37,333 --> 01:31:41,567
WE THOUGHT 273 DEGREES BELOW
ZERO WAS THE LOWEST TEMPERATURE,

2209
01:31:41,567 --> 01:31:43,233
BUT THESE READINGS INDICATE--

2210
01:31:43,233 --> 01:31:45,200
"UM, ARE YOU CALLING ME FRIGID?"

2211
01:31:45,200 --> 01:31:49,000
AND THAT COULD HAVE
ELONGATED THE TIME SCALE.

2212
01:31:49,000 --> 01:31:51,167
HELL, IT'S A SHOT ANYWAY--
LET'S JUST END THIS THING.

2213
01:31:51,167 --> 01:31:55,767
DR. LEE, THE CAPSULE WAS IN
SUCH A LOW TEMPERATURE ZONE--

2214
01:31:55,767 --> 01:31:57,533
HMM...

2215
01:31:57,533 --> 01:31:59,800
WHERE THE UNIVERSAL
COMPUTER WAS.

2216
01:31:59,800 --> 01:32:01,067
HMM...

2217
01:32:01,067 --> 01:32:02,467
- HMM.
- MM-HMM.

2218
01:32:02,467 --> 01:32:04,400
HEY, ISN'T THIS SCENE
LIKE CLOSING THE BARN DOORS

2219
01:32:04,400 --> 01:32:06,033
AFTER THE COWS ARE OUT?

2220
01:32:06,033 --> 01:32:08,567
I UNDERSTAND NOW--
IT'S ALL VERY CLEAR.

2221
01:32:08,567 --> 01:32:12,567
- IT'S SMOKING.
- IT'S A BIG JOKE FOR PEOPLE
WHO ARE HIGH!

2222
01:32:12,567 --> 01:32:14,800
YOU REVERSED INTO THE PAST.

2223
01:32:14,800 --> 01:32:16,600
[WHISPERS]
KEEP STRETCHING...

2224
01:32:16,600 --> 01:32:18,033
BUT THERE WAS ANOTHER FACTOR.

2225
01:32:18,033 --> 01:32:22,167
EXTREMELY LOW TEMPERATURE, WHICH
CAUSED THE TIME SCALE TO WARP,

2226
01:32:22,167 --> 01:32:27,500
AND THEREFORE
THE DEEP FREEZE CAPSULE
ACTED AS A TIME CONVERTER.

2227
01:32:27,500 --> 01:32:32,533
OH... THIS MOVIE'S EVEN STUPIDER
THAN I THOUGHT IT WAS.

2228
01:32:32,533 --> 01:32:34,700
OH, GODO...

2229
01:32:34,700 --> 01:32:36,867
OH, WHAT HAPPENED TO HIM?

2230
01:32:36,867 --> 01:32:39,667
HE ENJOYS LONG WALKS ON
THE BEACH AT HIS MALIBU RETREAT.

2231
01:32:39,667 --> 01:32:43,200
HE MUST HAVE TAKEN A WRONG TURN
AT ALBUQUERQUE.

2232
01:32:43,200 --> 01:32:45,300
HMM...

2233
01:32:45,300 --> 01:32:47,833
WELL, THAT'S THE SAND.

2234
01:32:47,833 --> 01:32:50,700
CATHERINE, THERE'S SOMETHING
I'D LIKE TO ASK YOU.

2235
01:32:50,700 --> 01:32:52,200
ME TOO.

2236
01:32:52,200 --> 01:32:54,000
I KNOW WHAT IT IS.

2237
01:32:54,000 --> 01:32:55,400
YOU WANT TO ASK ME ABOUT GODO.

2238
01:32:55,400 --> 01:32:57,200
"NO-- WHY DOES MY ICE CREAM
TASTE LIKE A BURGER

2239
01:32:57,200 --> 01:32:59,800
AND WHY ARE WE NOW LITTLE KIDS?"

2240
01:32:59,800 --> 01:33:02,633
IT'S NOT EASY TO EXPLAIN.

2241
01:33:02,633 --> 01:33:04,800
WE CAME BACK
TO WHERE WE STARTED--

2242
01:33:04,800 --> 01:33:05,933
WE RETURNED TO THE PRESENT.

2243
01:33:05,933 --> 01:33:07,200
MM-HMM?

2244
01:33:07,200 --> 01:33:08,700
GODO HAD A DIFFERENT JOURNEY.

2245
01:33:08,700 --> 01:33:10,500
HE'S IN ANOTHER TIME ZONE.

2246
01:33:10,500 --> 01:33:12,567
DID HE GO TO THE PAST
OR THE FUTURE?

2247
01:33:12,567 --> 01:33:15,367
WHERE DO YOU THINK HE IS?

2248
01:33:15,367 --> 01:33:16,733
"I'M MY OWN GRANDFATHER!"

2249
01:33:16,733 --> 01:33:18,200
I DON'T THINK WE'LL EVER KNOW.

2250
01:33:18,200 --> 01:33:19,233
HMM?

2251
01:33:19,233 --> 01:33:20,467
"SO, MORE ICE CREAM?"

2252
01:33:20,467 --> 01:33:22,800
BUT ONE THING I DO KNOW,
AND I KNOW FOR CERTAIN.

2253
01:33:22,800 --> 01:33:27,767
GODO, WHEREVER HE IS NOW,
HE'LL ALWAYS BE IN OUR HEARTS.

2254
01:33:27,767 --> 01:33:29,200
[CHILDREN]
OH, YES.

2255
01:33:29,200 --> 01:33:30,333
OH, YES, DEFINITELY.

2256
01:33:30,333 --> 01:33:31,500
IN OUR HEARTS.

2257
01:33:31,500 --> 01:33:33,567
"WE'LL ALWAYS FORGET HIM
FOREVER."

2258
01:33:33,567 --> 01:33:37,167
OH, IS THERE GONNA BE
ANOTHER ENDING NOW?

2259
01:33:37,167 --> 01:33:38,433
HEY!

2260
01:33:38,433 --> 01:33:40,733
YAY!

2261
01:33:40,733 --> 01:33:43,933
♪♪

2262
01:33:43,933 --> 01:33:48,967
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK,
GADS ABOUT THE HOUSE ALL DAY ♪♪

2263
01:33:48,967 --> 01:33:54,667
♪♪

2264
01:33:54,667 --> 01:34:03,533
[WHOOSHING, CREAKING,
WHIRRING, CLANKING]

2265
01:34:03,533 --> 01:34:06,567
COME ON, EVERYBODY,
LET'S DO THE SANDY FRANK SONG!

2266
01:34:06,567 --> 01:34:08,333
♪♪

2267
01:34:08,333 --> 01:34:10,667
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

2268
01:34:10,667 --> 01:34:13,733
♪ HE'S THE SOURCE
OF ALL OUR PAIN ♪

2269
01:34:13,733 --> 01:34:16,833
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

2270
01:34:16,833 --> 01:34:19,933
♪ GADS ABOUT THE HOUSE ALL DAY ♪

2271
01:34:19,933 --> 01:34:22,967
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

2272
01:34:22,967 --> 01:34:26,067
♪ THINKS THAT PEOPLE
COME FROM TREES ♪

2273
01:34:26,067 --> 01:34:28,900
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

2274
01:34:28,900 --> 01:34:32,200
♪ GETS HORRID MOVIES
FROM JAPAN ♪

2275
01:34:32,200 --> 01:34:35,200
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

2276
01:34:35,200 --> 01:34:38,300
♪ THEN THEY'RE ALWAYS
POORLY DUBBED ♪

2277
01:34:38,300 --> 01:34:41,400
♪ SANDY FRANK, SANDY FRANK ♪

2278
01:34:41,400 --> 01:34:44,400
♪ SPIELBERG WON'T RETURN
HIS CALLS... ♪

2279
01:34:44,400 --> 01:34:48,367
SIR, UH, BETTER CHECK THIS OUT.

2280
01:34:48,367 --> 01:34:50,500
THEY'RE GADDING ABOUT AGAIN.

2281
01:34:50,500 --> 01:34:51,900
OH, FOR HEAVEN'S SAKE,

2282
01:34:51,900 --> 01:34:53,467
WE DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR THIS KIND OF NONSENSE.

2283
01:34:53,467 --> 01:34:55,533
DON'T YOU HAVE A LETTER TO READ?

2284
01:34:55,533 --> 01:34:58,833
AND QUIT CAMPING IT UP
UP THERE-- BABIES ARE SLEEPING.

2285
01:34:58,833 --> 01:35:02,667
OH, YEAH, WE COULD READ THE
LETTER, I DON'T SEE ANYTHING
WRONG WITH THAT, DO YOU?

2286
01:35:02,667 --> 01:35:05,967
WELL, THIS LETTER WE PICKED OUT
IS FROM A GUY--

2287
01:35:05,967 --> 01:35:07,833
WELL, I'LL JUST READ IT TO YOU.

2288
01:35:07,833 --> 01:35:09,700
LET'S PUT THAT
ON STILL STORE, CAMBOT.

2289
01:35:09,700 --> 01:35:11,633
IT SAYS, "DEAR JOEL,
CROW AND TOM SERVO,

2290
01:35:11,633 --> 01:35:14,267
"MY NAME IS VLADIMIR LOPEZ,
I'M 15 YEARS OLD

2291
01:35:14,267 --> 01:35:16,733
AND A DEVOTED FAN OF MST3000.

2292
01:35:16,733 --> 01:35:19,867
"IT IS MY ABSOLUTE NUMERO UNO
A-1 FAVORITE SHOW.

2293
01:35:19,867 --> 01:35:22,300
"I LIVE IN TIJUANA, MEXICO,
AND NEVER MISS A SHOW.

2294
01:35:22,300 --> 01:35:24,000
"I JUST LOVE EVERYTHING
ABOUT IT,

2295
01:35:24,000 --> 01:35:26,833
"ESPECIALLY THE SONGS AND
PLAYS YOU COME UP WITH
DURING THE BREAKS.

2296
01:35:26,833 --> 01:35:28,567
"HOWEVER THERE'S
ONE PART I HATE,

2297
01:35:28,567 --> 01:35:30,900
"AND THAT IS WHEN THE MAD
SCIENTISTS PUSH THE BUTTON.

2298
01:35:30,900 --> 01:35:32,967
I WISH IT WOULD GO ON LONGER."

2299
01:35:32,967 --> 01:35:34,100
WE TOO.

2300
01:35:34,100 --> 01:35:35,567
AND THEN HE ADDED
A REALLY COOL---

2301
01:35:35,567 --> 01:35:37,967
OH, NOW, THAT'S COOL.

2302
01:35:37,967 --> 01:35:39,933
LET'S PUT THAT UP THERE, CAMBOT.

2303
01:35:39,933 --> 01:35:41,667
GOOD WORK, VLADIMIR!

2304
01:35:41,667 --> 01:35:44,067
LET'S TELL 'EM ABOUT THE MST
INFORMATION CLUB, TOM SERVO.

2305
01:35:44,067 --> 01:35:45,500
ALL RIGHT-- SEND YOUR LETTERS

2306
01:35:45,500 --> 01:35:47,633
OR ANYTHING ELSE YOU CAN
FIT IN A MAILBOX TO:

2307
01:35:54,500 --> 01:35:55,933
DO IT TODAY.

2308
01:35:55,933 --> 01:35:57,100
I DON'T THINK
YOU SHOULD HAVE SAID

2309
01:35:57,100 --> 01:35:58,300
THAT THING ABOUT THE MAILBOX.

2310
01:35:58,300 --> 01:35:59,567
WHAT DO YOU THINK, SIRS?

2311
01:35:59,567 --> 01:36:02,833
UH, I'D BETTER
PUSH THE BUTTON, SIR.

2312
01:36:02,833 --> 01:36:04,100
YOU BETTER CHANGE HIM.

2313
01:36:04,100 --> 01:36:05,267
UH, TELL YOU WHAT, FRANK.

2314
01:36:05,267 --> 01:36:06,400
I CHANGED HIM THE LAST TIME.

2315
01:36:06,400 --> 01:36:08,200
I'LL PUSH THE BUTTON
AND YOU CHANGE HIM.

2316
01:36:08,200 --> 01:36:10,233
WELL, I ALWAYS PUSH THE BUTTON.

2317
01:36:10,233 --> 01:36:12,033
I KNOW, AND I--
YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE TO.

2318
01:36:12,033 --> 01:36:13,533
I'LL PUSH THE BUTTON THIS TIME.

2319
01:36:13,533 --> 01:36:15,333
NO, IT'S FINE, I'LL DO IT,
DON'T WORRY ABOUT IT.

2320
01:36:15,333 --> 01:36:17,100
YOU GO AHEAD AND CHANGE HIM,
I'LL PUSH THE BUTTON.

2321
01:36:17,100 --> 01:36:18,933
NO, I THINK YOU SHOULD
HAVE THIS EXPERIENCE.

2322
01:36:18,933 --> 01:36:20,800
YOU CAN CHANGE HIM
SO YOU'LL KNOW--

2323
01:36:20,800 --> 01:36:23,267
OH, I'LL PUSH THE BUTTON.

2324
01:36:23,267 --> 01:36:24,700
[FRANK]
HIS FIRST WORDS!

2325
01:36:24,700 --> 01:36:27,100
♪♪

2326
01:37:27,067 --> 01:37:28,933
JOHNNY, DON'T GO,
IT'S TOO DANGEROUS.

2327
01:37:28,933 --> 01:37:30,167
I DON'T CARE!
